#: ../../../build/NEWS:67
msgid ""
":gh:`135034`: Fixes multiple issues that allowed ``tarfile`` extraction "
"filters (``filter=\"data\"`` and ``filter=\"tar\"``) to be bypassed using "
"crafted symlinks and hard links."
