msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:73
msgid ""
":gh:`133767`: Fix use-after-free in the \"unicode-escape\" decoder with a "
"non-\"strict\" error handler."
msgstr ":gh:`133767`: 修复在非\"严格\"错误处理程序中使用\"unicode-escape\"解码器时的释放后使用问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:76
msgid ""
":gh:`128840`: Short-circuit the processing of long IPv6 addresses early in "
":mod:`ipaddress` to prevent excessive memory consumption and a minor denial-"
"of-service."
msgstr ":gh:`128840`: 在 :mod:`ipaddress` 中早期短路处理长IPv6地址，以防止过多的内存消耗和轻微的拒绝服务。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:83
msgid ""
":gh:`128840`: Fix parsing long IPv6 addresses with embedded IPv4 address."
msgstr ":gh:`128840`: 修复了解析包含嵌入式IPv4地址的长IPv6地址的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:85
msgid ""
":gh:`134062`: :mod:`ipaddress`: fix collisions in :meth:`~object.__hash__` "
"for :class:`~ipaddress.IPv4Network` and :class:`~ipaddress.IPv6Network` "
"objects."
msgstr ""
":gh:`134062`: :mod:`ipaddress`: 修复 :meth:`~object.__hash__` 中 "
":class:`~ipaddress.IPv4Network` 和 :class:`~ipaddress.IPv6Network` 对象的冲突。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:89
msgid ""
":gh:`123409`: Fix :attr:`ipaddress.IPv6Address.reverse_pointer` output "
"according to :rfc:`RFC 3596, §2.5 <3596#section-2.5>`.  Patch by Bénédikt "
"Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123409`: 根据 :rfc:`RFC 3596, §2.5 <3596#section-2.5>` 修复 "
":attr:`ipaddress.IPv6Address.reverse_pointer` 的输出。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:93
msgid ""
":issue:`43633`: Improve the textual representation of IPv4-mapped IPv6 "
"addresses (:rfc:`4291` Sections 2.2, 2.5.5.2) in :mod:`ipaddress`. Patch by "
"Oleksandr Pavliuk."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43633`: 改进 :mod:`ipaddress` 中 IPv4 映射的 IPv6 地址 (:rfc:`4291` 第 2.2, "
"2.5.5.2 节) 的文本表示。由 Oleksandr Pavliuk 提交补丁。"

