":meth:`ssl.SSLContext.get_ca_certs` 现在在 :class:`ssl.SSLContext` "
"被多个线程共享时正确锁定对证书存储的访问。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:325
msgid ""
":gh:`116296`: Fix possible refleak in :meth:`!object.__reduce__` internal "
"error handling."
msgstr ":gh:`116296`: 修复 :meth:`!object.__reduce__` 内部错误处理中可能的内存泄漏。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:328
msgid ":gh:`116034`: Fix location of the error on a failed assertion."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:330
msgid ""
":gh:`115823`: Properly calculate error ranges in the parser when raising "
":exc:`SyntaxError` exceptions caused by invalid byte sequences. Patch by "
"Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`115823`: 在由于无效字节序列引发 :exc:`SyntaxError` 异常时，正确计算解析器中的错误范围。由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:334
msgid ""
":gh:`112087`: For an empty reverse iterator for list will be reduced to "
":func:`reversed`. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:337
msgid ""
":gh:`115011`: Setters for members with an unsigned integer type now support "
"the same range of valid values for objects that has a "
":meth:`~object.__index__` method as for :class:`int`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115011`: 现在，对于具有 :meth:`~object.__index__` 方法的对象，无符号整数类型成员的设置器支持与 "
":class:`int` 相同的有效值范围。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:341
msgid ""
":gh:`96497`: Fix incorrect resolution of mangled class variables used in "
"assignment expressions in comprehensions."
msgstr ":gh:`96497`: 修复在理解中使用的赋值表达式中混淆的类变量的错误解析。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:347
msgid ""
":gh:`117310`: Fixed an unlikely early & extra ``Py_DECREF`` triggered crash "
"in :mod:`ssl` when creating a new ``_ssl._SSLContext`` if CPython was built "
"implausibly such that the default cipher list is empty **or** the SSL "
"library it was linked against reports a failure from its C "
"``SSL_CTX_set_cipher_list()`` API."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117310`: 修复了在创建新的 ``_ssl._SSLContext`` 时，如果 CPython "
"被不合理地构建导致默认密码列表为空，或链接的 SSL 库报告其 C ``SSL_CTX_set_cipher_list()`` API "
"失败时，可能触发的早期及额外的 ``Py_DECREF`` 崩溃问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:353
msgid ""
":gh:`117178`: Fix regression in lazy loading of self-referential modules, "
"introduced in :gh:`114781`."
msgstr ":gh:`117178`: 修复了在 :gh:`114781` 中引入的自引用模块的懒加载回归问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:356
msgid ""
":gh:`117084`: Fix :mod:`zipfile` extraction for directory entries with the "
"name containing backslashes on Windows."
msgstr ":gh:`117084`: 修复了 Windows 上 :mod:`zipfile` 提取包含反斜杠名称的目录条目时的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:359
msgid ""
":gh:`117110`: Fix a bug that prevents subclasses of :class:`typing.Any` to "
"be instantiated with arguments. Patch by Chris Fu."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117110`: 修复了一个阻止 :class:`typing.Any` 的子类用参数实例化的错误。由 Chris Fu 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:362
msgid ""
":gh:`90872`: On Windows, :meth:`subprocess.Popen.wait` no longer calls "
"``WaitForSingleObject()`` with a negative timeout: pass ``0`` ms if the "
"timeout is negative. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90872`: 在Windows上，:meth:`subprocess.Popen.wait` 不再用负超时调用 "
"``WaitForSingleObject()``：如果超时为负，则传递 ``0`` 毫秒。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:366
msgid ""
":gh:`116957`: configparser: Don't leave ConfigParser values in an invalid "
"state (stored as a list instead of a str) after an earlier read raised "
"DuplicateSectionError or DuplicateOptionError."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116957`: configparser: 在早期读取引发 DuplicateSectionError 或 "
"DuplicateOptionError 后，不再将 ConfigParser 值保留在无效状态（存储为列表而不是字符串）。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:370
msgid ":gh:`90095`: Ignore empty lines and comments in ``.pdbrc``"
msgstr ":gh:`90095`: 忽略 ``.pdbrc`` 中的空行和注释。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:372
msgid ""
":gh:`116764`: Restore support of ``None`` and other false values in "
":mod:`urllib.parse` functions :func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qs` and "
":func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qsl`. Also, they now raise a TypeError for non-"
"zero integers and non-empty sequences."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116764`: 恢复在 :mod:`urllib.parse` 函数 :func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qs` 和 "
":func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qsl` 中对 ``None`` 和其他假值的支持。此外，现在它们会对非零整数和非空序列抛出 "
"TypeError。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:377
msgid ""
":gh:`116811`: In ``PathFinder.invalidate_caches``, delegate to "
"``MetadataPathFinder.invalidate_caches``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116811`: 在 ``PathFinder.invalidate_caches`` 中，委托给 "
"``MetadataPathFinder.invalidate_caches``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:380
msgid ":gh:`116600`: Fix :func:`repr` for global :class:`~enum.Flag` members."
msgstr ":gh:`116600`: 修复全局 :class:`~enum.Flag` 成员的 :func:`repr`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:382
msgid ""
":gh:`116484`: Change automatically generated :class:`tkinter.Checkbutton` "
"widget names to avoid collisions with automatically generated "
":class:`tkinter.ttk.Checkbutton` widget names within the same parent widget."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116484`: 修改自动生成的 :class:`tkinter.Checkbutton` 控件名称，以避免在同一父容器内与自动生成的 "
":class:`tkinter.ttk.Checkbutton` 控件名称发生冲突。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:387
msgid ""
":gh:`116401`: Fix blocking :func:`os.fwalk` and :func:`shutil.rmtree` on "
"opening named pipe."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116401`: 修复了 :func:`os.fwalk` 和 :func:`shutil.rmtree` 在打开命名管道时的阻塞问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:390
msgid ""
":gh:`116143`: Fix a race in pydoc ``_start_server``, eliminating a window in"
" which ``_start_server`` can return a thread that is \"serving\" but without"
" a ``docserver`` set."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116143`: 修复 pydoc ``_start_server`` 中的竞争条件，消除 ``_start_server`` 返回一个 "
"\"serving\" 但没有设置 ``docserver`` 的线程的窗口。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:394
msgid ""
":gh:`116325`: :mod:`typing`: raise :exc:`SyntaxError` instead of "
":exc:`AttributeError` on forward references as empty strings."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116325`: :mod:`typing`: 对前向引用为空字符串的情况，抛出 :exc:`SyntaxError` 而非 "
":exc:`AttributeError`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:397
msgid ""
":gh:`90535`: Fix support of *interval* values > 1 in "
":class:`logging.TimedRotatingFileHandler` for ``when='MIDNIGHT'`` and "
"``when='Wx'``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90535`: 修复了在 :class:`logging.TimedRotatingFileHandler` 中对于 "
"``when='MIDNIGHT'`` 和 ``when='Wx'`` 时 *interval* 值 > 1 的支持。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:401
msgid ""
":gh:`115978`: Disable preadv(), readv(), pwritev(), and writev() on WASI."
msgstr ":gh:`115978`: 在 WASI 上禁用 preadv()、readv()、pwritev() 和 writev()。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:403
msgid ""
"Under wasmtime for WASI 0.2, these functions don't pass test_posix "
"(https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/7830)."
msgstr ""
"在 WASI 0.2 的 wasmtime 下，这些函数未能通过 test_posix 测试 "
"(https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/7830)。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:406
msgid ""
":gh:`88352`: Fix the computation of the next rollover time in the "
":class:`logging.TimedRotatingFileHandler` handler. :meth:`!computeRollover` "
"now always returns a timestamp larger than the specified time and works "
"correctly during the DST change. :meth:`!doRollover` no longer overwrite the"
" already rolled over file, saving from data loss when run at midnight or "
"during repeated time at the DST change."
msgstr ""
":gh:`88352`: 修复 :class:`logging.TimedRotatingFileHandler` "
"处理程序中下一次滚动时间的计算。:meth:`!computeRollover` 现在总是返回一个大于指定时间的时间戳，并且在 DST "
"变更时也能正确工作。:meth:`!doRollover` 不再覆盖已经滚动过的文件，从而避免了在午夜或 DST 变更时重复运行导致的数据丢失。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:414
msgid ""
":gh:`87115`: Set ``__main__.__spec__`` to ``None`` when running a script "
"with :mod:`pdb`"
msgstr ""
":gh:`87115`: 在使用 :mod:`pdb` 运行脚本时，将 ``__main__.__spec__`` 设置为 ``None``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:417
msgid ""
":gh:`76511`: Fix UnicodeEncodeError in :meth:`email.Message.as_string` that "
"results when a message that claims to be in the ascii character set actually"
" has non-ascii characters. Non-ascii characters are now replaced with the "
"U+FFFD replacement character, like in the ``replace`` error handler."
msgstr ""
":gh:`76511`: 修复 :meth:`email.Message.as_string` 中的 "
"UnicodeEncodeError，该错误发生在消息声称使用 ascii 字符集但实际上包含非 ascii 字符时。现在，非 ascii "
"字符会被替换为 U+FFFD 替换字符，类似于 ``replace`` 错误处理器的行为。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:423
msgid ""
":gh:`75988`: Fixed :func:`unittest.mock.create_autospec` to pass the call "
"through to the wrapped object to return the real result."
msgstr ""
":gh:`75988`: 修复 :func:`unittest.mock.create_autospec` 以通过调用传递给包装对象来返回真实结果。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:426
msgid ""
":gh:`115881`: Fix issue where :func:`ast.parse` would incorrectly flag "
"conditional context managers (such as ``with (x() if y else z()): ...``) as "
"invalid syntax if ``feature_version=(3, 8)`` was passed. This reverts "
"changes to the grammar made as part of :gh:`94949`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115881`: 修复了当传递 ``feature_version=(3, 8)`` 时，:func:`ast.parse` "
"会错误地将条件上下文管理器（如 ``with (x() if y else z()): ...``）标记为无效语法的问题。这撤销了作为 "
":gh:`94949` 一部分对语法所做的更改。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:431
msgid ""
":gh:`115886`: Fix silent truncation of the name with an embedded null "
"character in :class:`multiprocessing.shared_memory.SharedMemory`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115886`: 修复了 :class:`multiprocessing.shared_memory.SharedMemory` "
"中嵌入空字符的名称被静默截断的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:434
msgid ""
":gh:`115809`: Improve algorithm for computing which rolled-over log files to"
" delete in :class:`logging.TimedRotatingFileHandler`. It is now reliable for"
" handlers without ``namer`` and with arbitrary deterministic ``namer`` that "
"leaves the datetime part in the file name unmodified."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115809`: 改进了 :class:`logging.TimedRotatingFileHandler` "
"中计算要删除哪些滚动日志文件的算法。现在对于没有 ``namer`` 和具有任意确定性 ``namer`` (不修改文件名中的日期时间部分) "
"的处理程序来说是可靠的。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:439
msgid ""
":gh:`74668`: :mod:`urllib.parse` functions :func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qs` "
"and :func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qsl` now support bytes arguments containing "
"raw and percent-encoded non-ASCII data."
msgstr ""
":gh:`74668`: :mod:`urllib.parse` 函数 :func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qs` 和 "
":func:`~urllib.parse.parse_qsl` 现在支持包含原始和百分比编码非 ASCII 数据的字节参数。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:443
msgid ""
":gh:`67044`: :func:`csv.writer` now always quotes or escapes ``'\\r'`` and "
"``'\\n'``, regardless of *lineterminator* value."
msgstr ""
":gh:`67044`: :func:`csv.writer` 现在总是引用或转义 ``'\\r'`` 和 ``'\\n'``，不管 "
"*lineterminator* 的值如何。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:446
msgid ""
":gh:`115712`: :func:`csv.writer()` now quotes empty fields if delimiter is a"
" space and skipinitialspace is true and raises exception if quoting is not "
"possible."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:450
msgid ""
":gh:`115618`: Fix improper decreasing the reference count for ``None`` "
"argument in :class:`property` methods :meth:`~property.getter`, "
":meth:`~property.setter` and :meth:`~property.deleter`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115618`: 修复 :class:`property` 方法 "
":meth:`~property.getter`、:meth:`~property.setter` 和 "
":meth:`~property.deleter` 中对 ``None`` 参数引用计数不当减少的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:454
msgid ""
":gh:`115570`: A :exc:`DeprecationWarning` is no longer omitted on access to "
"the ``__doc__`` attributes of the deprecated ``typing.io`` and ``typing.re``"
" pseudo-modules."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:458
msgid ""
":gh:`112006`: Fix :func:`inspect.unwrap` for types with the ``__wrapper__`` "
"data descriptor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:461
msgid ""
":gh:`101293`: Support callables with the ``__call__()`` method and types "
"with ``__new__()`` and ``__init__()`` methods set to class methods, static "
"methods, bound methods, partial functions, and other types of methods and "
"descriptors in :meth:`inspect.Signature.from_callable`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101293`: 在 :meth:`inspect.Signature.from_callable` 中支持带有 ``__call__()``"
" 方法的可调用对象，以及将 ``__new__()`` 和 ``__init__()`` "
"方法设置为类方法、静态方法、绑定方法、部分函数以及其他类型的方法和描述符的类型。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:466
msgid ""
":gh:`115392`: Fix a bug in :mod:`doctest` where incorrect line numbers would"
" be reported for decorated functions."
msgstr ":gh:`115392`: 修复 :mod:`doctest` 中的一个错误，该错误会导致装饰函数的行号报告不正确。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:469
msgid ""
":gh:`114563`: Fix several :func:`format()` bugs when using the C "
"implementation of :class:`~decimal.Decimal`: * memory leak in some rare "
"cases when using the ``z`` format option (coerce negative 0) * incorrect "
"output when applying the ``z`` format option to type ``F`` (fixed-point with"
" capital ``NAN`` / ``INF``) * incorrect output when applying the ``#`` "
"format option (alternate form)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:476
msgid ""
":gh:`115197`: ``urllib.request`` no longer resolves the hostname before "
"checking it against the system's proxy bypass list on macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115197`: ``urllib.request`` 在 macOS 和 Windows 上不再在检查系统代理绕过列表之前解析主机名。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:479
msgid ":gh:`115198`: Fix support of Docutils >= 0.19 in :mod:`distutils`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:481
msgid ""
":gh:`115165`: Most exceptions are now ignored when attempting to set the "
"``__orig_class__`` attribute on objects returned when calling :mod:`typing` "
"generic aliases (including generic aliases created using "
":data:`typing.Annotated`). Previously only :exc:`AttributeError` was "
"ignored. Patch by Dave Shawley."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115165`: 现在在尝试为调用 :mod:`typing` 泛型别名（包括使用 :data:`typing.Annotated` "
"创建的泛型别名）返回的对象设置`__orig_class__` 属性时，大多数异常会被忽略。之前只有 :exc:`AttributeError` "
"被忽略。由Dave Shawley提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:487
msgid ""
":gh:`115133`: Fix tests for :class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.XMLPullParser` "
"with Expat 2.6.0."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115133`: 修复与Expat 2.6.0兼容的 "
":class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.XMLPullParser` 测试。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:490
msgid ""
":gh:`115059`: :meth:`io.BufferedRandom.read1` now flushes the underlying "
"write buffer."
msgstr ":gh:`115059`: :meth:`io.BufferedRandom.read1` 现在会刷新底层写入缓冲区。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:493
msgid ""
":gh:`79382`: Trailing ``**`` no longer allows to match files and non-"
"existing paths in recursive :func:`~glob.glob`."
msgstr ":gh:`79382`: 在递归 :func:`~glob.glob` 中，尾随的 ``**`` 不再允许匹配文件和不存在的路径。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:496
msgid ""
":gh:`114763`: Protect modules loaded with :class:`importlib.util.LazyLoader`"
" from race conditions when multiple threads try to access attributes before "
"the loading is complete."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114763`: 保护使用 :class:`importlib.util.LazyLoader` "
"加载的模块，防止在加载完成前多个线程尝试访问属性时出现竞争条件。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:500
msgid ""
":gh:`97959`: Fix rendering class methods, bound methods, method and function"
" aliases in :mod:`pydoc`. Class methods no longer have \"method of "
"builtins.type instance\" note. Corresponding notes are now added for class "
"and unbound methods. Method and function aliases now have references to the "
"module or the class where the origin was defined if it differs from the "
"current. Bound methods are now listed in the static methods section. Methods"
" of builtin classes are now supported as well as methods of Python classes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97959`: 修复 :mod:`pydoc` "
"中类方法、绑定方法、方法及函数别名的渲染问题。类方法不再显示“builtins.type实例的方法”注释。现在为类和未绑定方法添加了相应的注释。方法和函数别名现在如果原始定义与当前不同，会引用到定义原始内容的模块或类。绑定方法现在列在静态方法部分。内置类的方法现在和Python类的方法一样得到支持。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:509
msgid ""
":gh:`112281`: Allow creating :ref:`union of types<types-union>` for "
":class:`typing.Annotated` with unhashable metadata."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112281`: 允许为 :class:`typing.Annotated` 创建 :ref:`类型的联合 <types-"
"union>`，即使元数据不可哈希。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:512
msgid ""
":gh:`111775`: Fix :meth:`importlib.resources.simple.ResourceHandle.open` for"
" text mode, added missed ``stream`` argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111775`: 修复了 :meth:`importlib.resources.simple.ResourceHandle.open` "
"在文本模式下的问题，添加了遗漏的 ``stream`` 参数。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:515
msgid ":gh:`90095`: Make .pdbrc and -c work with any valid pdb commands."
msgstr ":gh:`90095`: 使 .pdbrc 和 -c 可以与任何有效的 pdb 命令一起工作。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:517
msgid ""
":gh:`107155`: Fix incorrect output of ``help(x)`` where ``x`` is a "
":keyword:`lambda` function, which has an ``__annotations__`` dictionary "
"attribute with a ``\"return\"`` key."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107155`: 修复了 ``help(x)`` 的错误输出，其中 ``x`` 是一个 :keyword:`lambda` "
"函数，该函数有一个带有 ``\"return\"`` 键的 ``__annotations__`` 字典属性。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:521
msgid ""
":gh:`105866`: Fixed ``_get_slots`` bug which caused error when defining "
"dataclasses with slots and a weakref_slot."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105866`: 修复了 ``_get_slots`` 的 bug，该 bug 在定义带有 slots 和 weakref_slot "
"的数据类时会导致错误。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:524
msgid ":gh:`60346`: Fix ArgumentParser inconsistent with parse_known_args."
msgstr ":gh:`60346`: 修复 ArgumentParser 与 parse_known_args 不一致的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:526
msgid ""
":gh:`100985`: Update HTTPSConnection to consistently wrap IPv6 Addresses "
"when using a proxy."
msgstr ":gh:`100985`: 更新 HTTPSConnection 以在使用代理时一致地包装 IPv6 地址。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:529
msgid ""
":gh:`100884`: email: fix misfolding of comma in address-lists over multiple "
"lines in combination with unicode encoding."
msgstr ":gh:`100884`: email: 修复在多行地址列表中结合 Unicode 编码时逗号的错误折叠问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:532
msgid ""
":gh:`95782`: Fix :func:`io.BufferedReader.tell`, "
":func:`io.BufferedReader.seek`, :func:`_pyio.BufferedReader.tell`, "
":func:`io.BufferedRandom.tell`, :func:`io.BufferedRandom.seek` and "
":func:`_pyio.BufferedRandom.tell` being able to return negative offsets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:537
msgid ""
":gh:`96310`: Fix a traceback in :mod:`argparse` when all options in a "
"mutually exclusive group are suppressed."
msgstr ":gh:`96310`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 中当互斥组中的所有选项被抑制时出现的回溯问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:540
msgid ""
":gh:`93205`: Fixed a bug in "
":class:`logging.handlers.TimedRotatingFileHandler` where multiple rotating "
"handler instances pointing to files with the same name but different "
"extensions would conflict and not delete the correct files."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93205`: 修复 :class:`logging.handlers.TimedRotatingFileHandler` "
"中的一个错误，其中指向具有相同名称但不同扩展名的文件的多个旋转处理程序实例会冲突并且不会删除正确的文件。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:545
msgid ""
":issue:`44865`: Add missing call to localization function in "
":mod:`argparse`."
msgstr ":issue:`44865`: 在 :mod:`argparse` 中添加对本地化函数的缺失调用。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:547
msgid ""
":issue:`43952`: Fix :meth:`multiprocessing.connection.Listener.accept()` to "
"accept empty bytes as authkey. Not accepting empty bytes as key causes it to"
" hang indefinitely."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:551
msgid ""
":issue:`42125`: linecache: get module name from ``__spec__`` if available. "
"This allows getting source code for the ``__main__`` module when a custom "
"loader is used."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42125`: linecache: 如果可用，从 ``__spec__`` 获取模块名称。这允许在使用自定义加载器时获取 "
"``__main__`` 模块的源代码。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:555
msgid ""
":gh:`66543`: Make :func:`mimetypes.guess_type` properly parsing of URLs with"
" only a host name, URLs containing fragment or query, and filenames with "
"only a UNC sharepoint on Windows. Based on patch by Dong-hee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`66543`: 使 :func:`mimetypes.guess_type` "
"能够正确解析仅包含主机名的URL、包含片段或查询的URL以及Windows上仅包含UNC共享点的文件名。基于 Dong-hee Na 的补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:559
msgid ""
":issue:`33775`: Add 'default' and 'version' help text for localization in "
"argparse."
msgstr ":issue:`33775`: 在 argparse 中为本地化添加了 'default' 和 'version' 帮助文本。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:565
msgid ""
":gh:`115399`: Document CVE-2023-52425 of Expat <2.6.0 under \"XML "
"vulnerabilities\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:568
msgid ""
":gh:`115233`: Fix an example for :class:`~logging.LoggerAdapter` in the "
"Logging Cookbook."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115233`: 修复 Logging Cookbook 中 :class:`~logging.LoggerAdapter` 的一个例子。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:574
msgid ""
":gh:`83434`: Disable JUnit XML output (``--junit-xml=FILE`` command line "
"option) in regrtest when hunting for reference leaks (``-R`` option). Patch "
"by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`83434`: 在regrtest中搜索引用泄漏（``-R``选项）时禁用JUnit XML输出（``--junit-"
"xml=FILE``命令行选项）。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:578
msgid ":gh:`117187`: Fix XML tests for vanilla Expat <2.6.0."
msgstr ":gh:`117187`: 修复对 vanilla Expat <2.6.0 的XML测试。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:580
msgid ""
