msgid ""
":gh:`110017`: Disable a signal handling stress test on macOS due to a bug in"
" macOS (FB13453490)."
msgstr ":gh:`110017`: 由于 macOS 中的一个错误 (FB13453490)，在 macOS 上禁用信号处理压力测试。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1003
msgid ""
":gh:`109981`: Use ``/dev/fd`` on macOS to determine the number of open files"
" in ``test.support.os_helper.fd_count`` to avoid a crash with \"guarded\" "
"file descriptors when probing for open files."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109981`: 在 macOS 上使用 ``/dev/fd`` 来确定 "
"``test.support.os_helper.fd_count`` 中打开的文件数量，以避免在探测打开的文件时因“受保护”的文件描述符而崩溃。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1010
msgid ""
":gh:`96905`: In idlelib code, stop redefining built-ins 'dict' and 'object'."
msgstr ":gh:`96905`: 在idlelib代码中，停止重新定义内置的'dict'和'object'。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1012
msgid ""
":gh:`72284`: Improve the lists of features, editor key bindings, and shell "
"key bingings in the IDLE doc."
msgstr ":gh:`72284`: 改进 IDLE 文档中的功能列表、编辑器键绑定和 shell 键绑定。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1015
msgid ""
":gh:`113903`: Fix rare failure of test.test_idle, in test_configdialog."
msgstr ":gh:`113903`: 修复 test.test_idle 在 test_configdialog 中的罕见失败。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1017
msgid ":gh:`113729`: Fix the \"Help -> IDLE Doc\" menu bug in 3.11.7 and 3.12.1."
msgstr ":gh:`113729`: 修复 3.11.7 和 3.12.1 中的“帮助 -> IDLE 文档”菜单错误。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1019
msgid ":gh:`113269`: Fix test_editor hang on macOS Catalina."
msgstr ":gh:`113269`: 修复 test_editor 在 macOS Catalina 上的挂起问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1021
msgid ""
":gh:`112898`: Fix processing unsaved files when quitting IDLE on macOS."
msgstr ":gh:`112898`: 修复在macOS上退出IDLE时处理未保存文件的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1023
msgid ""
":gh:`103820`: Revise IDLE bindings so that events from mouse button 4/5 on "
"non-X11 windowing systems (i.e. Win32 and Aqua) are not mistaken for "
"scrolling."
msgstr ""
":gh:`103820`: 修改IDLE绑定，使得在非X11窗口系统（即Win32和Aqua）上来自鼠标按钮4/5的事件不会被误认为是滚动。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1027
msgid ""
":issue:`13586`: Enter the selected text when opening the \"Replace\" dialog."
msgstr ":issue:`13586`: 打开“替换”对话框时输入选中的文本。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1032
msgid ""
":gh:`109991`: Update GitHub CI workflows to use OpenSSL 3.0.13 and "
"multissltests to use 1.1.1w, 3.0.13, 3.1.5, and 3.2.1."
msgstr ""
