"3.0.13，并更新multissltests以使用1.1.1w、3.0.13、3.1.5和3.2.1。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1035
msgid ""
":gh:`115015`: Fix a bug in Argument Clinic that generated incorrect code for"
" methods with no parameters that use the :ref:`METH_METHOD | METH_FASTCALL |"
" METH_KEYWORDS <METH_METHOD-METH_FASTCALL-METH_KEYWORDS>` calling "
"convention. Only the positional parameter count was checked; any keyword "
"argument passed would be silently accepted."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115015`: 修复Argument Clinic中的一个bug，该bug会为没有参数但使用 :ref:`METH_METHOD | "
"METH_FASTCALL | METH_KEYWORDS <METH_METHOD-METH_FASTCALL-METH_KEYWORDS>` "
"调用约定的方法生成错误的代码。之前只检查了位置参数的数量；任何传递的关键字参数都会被静默接受。"

