#: ../../../build/NEWS:1050
msgid ""
":gh:`112625`: Fixes a bug where a bytearray object could be cleared while "
"iterating over an argument in the ``bytearray.join()`` method that could "
"result in reading memory after it was freed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112625`: 修复在 ``bytearray.join()`` "
