#: ../../../build/NEWS:1606
msgid "Python 3.11.5 final"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1608
msgid "*Release date: 2023-08-24*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1613
msgid ""
":gh:`108310`: Fixed an issue where instances of :class:`ssl.SSLSocket` were "
"vulnerable to a bypass of the TLS handshake and included protections (like "
"certificate verification) and treating sent unencrypted data as if it were "
"post-handshake TLS encrypted data.  Security issue reported as "
"`CVE-2023-40217 <https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-"
"bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2023-40217>`_ by Aapo Oksman. Patch by Gregory P. "
"Smith."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1624
msgid ""
":gh:`104432`: Fix potential unaligned memory access on C APIs involving "
"returned sequences of ``char *`` pointers within the :mod:`grp` and "
":mod:`socket` modules. These were revealed using a ``-fsaniziter=alignment``"
" build on ARM macOS. Patch by Christopher Chavez."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104432`: 修复了在 :mod:`grp` 和 :mod:`socket` 模块中涉及返回 ``char *`` 指针序列的C "
"API中潜在的非对齐内存访问。这些是在ARM macOS上使用 ``-fsaniziter=alignment`` "
"构建时发现的。由Christopher Chavez提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1629
msgid ""
":gh:`77377`: Ensure that multiprocessing synchronization objects created in "
"a fork context are not sent to a different process created in a spawn "
"context. This changes a segfault into an actionable RuntimeError in the "
"parent process."
msgstr ""
":gh:`77377`: "
"确保在fork上下文中创建的多进程同步对象不会被发送到在spawn上下文中创建的不同进程。这将在父进程中将段错误更改为可操作的RuntimeError。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1634
msgid ""
":gh:`106092`: Fix a segmentation fault caused by a use-after-free bug in "
"``frame_dealloc`` when the trashcan delays the deallocation of a "
"``PyFrameObject``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106092`: 修复了在垃圾回收延迟释放 ``PyFrameObject`` 时，由于 use-after-free 错误导致的段错误。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1638
msgid ""
":gh:`106719`: No longer suppress arbitrary errors in the ``__annotations__``"
" getter and setter in the type and module types."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106719`: 不再在类型和模块类型的 ``__annotations__`` getter 和 setter 中抑制任意错误。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1641
msgid ""
":gh:`106723`: Propagate ``frozen_modules`` to multiprocessing spawned "
"process interpreters."
msgstr ":gh:`106723`: 将 ``frozen_modules`` 传播到多进程生成的进程解释器中。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1644
msgid ""
":gh:`105979`: Fix crash in :func:`!_imp.get_frozen_object` due to improper "
"exception handling."
msgstr ":gh:`105979`: 修复了 :func:`!_imp.get_frozen_object` 中由于异常处理不当导致的崩溃。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1647
msgid ""
":gh:`105840`: Fix possible crashes when specializing function calls with too"
" many ``__defaults__``."
msgstr ":gh:`105840`: 修复了在专门化函数调用时 ``__defaults__`` 过多可能导致崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1650
msgid ""
":gh:`105588`: Fix an issue that could result in crashes when compiling "
"malformed :mod:`ast` nodes."
msgstr ":gh:`105588`: 修复了一个在编译格式错误的 :mod:`ast` 节点时可能导致崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1653
msgid ""
":gh:`105375`: Fix bugs in the :mod:`builtins` module where exceptions could "
