msgstr ":gh:`105375`: 修复了 :mod:`builtins` 模块中的错误，其中异常可能被覆盖。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1656
msgid ""
":gh:`105375`: Fix bug in the compiler where an exception could end up being "
"overwritten."
msgstr ":gh:`105375`: 修复了编译器中的一个错误，其中异常可能被覆盖。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1659
msgid ""
":gh:`105375`: Improve error handling in :c:func:`PyUnicode_BuildEncodingMap`"
" where an exception could end up being overwritten."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105375`: 改进了 :c:func:`PyUnicode_BuildEncodingMap` 中的错误处理，其中异常可能被覆盖。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1662
msgid ""
":gh:`105235`: Prevent out-of-bounds memory access during ``mmap.find()`` "
"calls."
msgstr ":gh:`105235`: 防止在 ``mmap.find()`` 调用期间发生越界内存访问。"

