msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1693
msgid ""
":gh:`107077`: Seems that in some conditions, OpenSSL will return "
"``SSL_ERROR_SYSCALL`` instead of ``SSL_ERROR_SSL`` when a certification "
"verification has failed, but the error parameters will still contain "
