msgstr ""
":gh:`106881`: 在 ``Modules/posixmodule.c`` 中包含 ``linux/limits.h`` 之前先检查其是否存在。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1855
msgid ""
":gh:`104692`: Include ``commoninstall`` as a prerequisite for ``bininstall``"
msgstr ":gh:`104692`: 将 ``commoninstall`` 作为 ``bininstall`` 的先决条件包含在内"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1857
msgid ""
"This ensures that ``commoninstall`` is completed before ``bininstall`` is "
"started when parallel builds are used (``make -j install``), and so the "
"``python3`` symlink is only installed after all standard library modules are"
" installed."
msgstr ""
"这确保了在使用并行构建（``make -j install``）时，``commoninstall`` 会在 ``bininstall`` "
"开始之前完成，因此 ``python3`` 符号链接只会在所有标准库模块安装完成后才被安装。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1862
