msgstr ":gh:`102700`: 允许内置模块成为子模块。这允许子模块静态链接到 CPython 二进制文件中。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:1988
msgid ""
":gh:`101857`: Fix xattr support detection on Linux systems by widening the "
