"IPv6 或 IPvFuture 格式。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:2060
msgid ":gh:`103872`: Update the bundled copy of pip to version 23.1.2."
msgstr ":gh:`103872`: 将捆绑的 pip 更新至版本 23.1.2。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:2062
msgid ""
