msgstr ""
":gh:`102947`: 当在非数据类上调用 :func:`dataclasses.fields` 时，改进回溯。由Alex Waygood提交补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:2282
msgid ""
":gh:`102780`: The :class:`asyncio.Timeout` context manager now works "
"reliably even when performing cleanup due to task cancellation.  Previously "
"it could raise a :exc:`~asyncio.CancelledError` instead of an "
":exc:`~asyncio.TimeoutError` in such cases."
msgstr ""
