msgstr ":gh:`96268`: 加载包含无效 UTF-8 编码的文件现在会在正确的位置报告损坏的字符。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3427
msgid ""
":gh:`96187`: Fixed a bug that caused ``_PyCode_GetExtra`` to return garbage "
"for negative indexes. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`96187`: 修复了一个导致 ``_PyCode_GetExtra`` 对于负索引返回垃圾值的 bug。由 Pablo Galindo "
"提供补丁"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3430
msgid ""
":gh:`96071`: Fix a deadlock in :c:func:`PyGILState_Ensure` when allocating "
"new thread state. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96071`: 修复了在分配新线程状态时 :c:func:`PyGILState_Ensure` 中的死锁问题。由 Kumar Aditya "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3433
msgid ""
":gh:`96046`: :c:func:`PyType_Ready` now initializes ``ht_cached_keys`` and "
"performs additional checks to ensure that type objects are properly "
"configured. This avoids crashes in 3rd party packages that don't use regular"
" API to create new types."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96046`: :c:func:`PyType_Ready` 现在初始化 ``ht_cached_keys`` "
"并执行额外检查以确保类型对象正确配置。这避免了不使用常规 API 创建新类型的第三方包中的崩溃。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3438
msgid ""
":gh:`95818`: Skip over incomplete frames in "
":c:func:`PyThreadState_GetFrame`."
msgstr ":gh:`95818`: 在 :c:func:`PyThreadState_GetFrame` 中跳过不完整的帧。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3440
msgid ""
":gh:`95876`: Fix format string in ``_PyPegen_raise_error_known_location`` "
"that can lead to memory corruption on some 64bit systems. The function was "
"building a tuple with ``i`` (int) instead of ``n`` (Py_ssize_t) for "
"Py_ssize_t arguments."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95876`: 修复 ``_PyPegen_raise_error_known_location`` "
"中的格式字符串，该字符串在某些64位系统上可能导致内存损坏。该函数在为Py_ssize_t参数构建元组时使用了 ``i`` (int) 而不是 "
"``n`` (Py_ssize_t) 。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3445
msgid ""
":gh:`95605`: Fix misleading contents of error message when converting an "
"all-whitespace string to :class:`float`."
msgstr ":gh:`95605`: 修复将全空白字符串转换为 :class:`float` 时错误消息内容误导性的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3448
msgid ""
":gh:`94996`: :func:`ast.parse` will no longer parse function definitions "
"with positional-only params when passed ``feature_version`` less than ``(3, "
"8)``. Patch by Shantanu Jain."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94996`: :func:`ast.parse` 在传递的 ``feature_version`` 小于 ``(3, 8)`` "
"时，将不再解析带有位置唯一参数（positional-only params）的函数定义。由 Shantanu Jain 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3455
msgid ":gh:`96700`: Fix incorrect error message in the :mod:`io` module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3457
msgid ""
":gh:`96652`: Fix the faulthandler implementation of "
"``faulthandler.register(signal, chain=True)`` if the ``sigaction()`` "
"function is not available: don't call the previous signal handler if it's "
"NULL. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96652`: 如果 ``sigaction()`` 函数不可用，则修复 ``faulthandler.register(signal, "
"chain=True)`` 的 faulthandler 实现：如果之前的信号处理器为 NULL，则不调用它。由 Victor Stinner "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3462
msgid ""
":gh:`68163`: Correct conversion of :class:`numbers.Rational`'s to "
":class:`float`."
msgstr ":gh:`68163`: 修正 :class:`numbers.Rational` 到 :class:`float` 的转换。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3465
msgid ""
":gh:`96385`: Fix ``TypeVarTuple.__typing_prepare_subst__``. ``TypeError`` "
"was not raised when using more than one ``TypeVarTuple``, like ``[*T, *V]`` "
"in type alias substitutions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96385`: 修复 ``TypeVarTuple.__typing_prepare_subst__``。在使用多个 "
"``TypeVarTuple`` 时，如类型别名替换中的 ``[*T, *V]``，未引发 ``TypeError``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3469
msgid ""
":gh:`90467`: Fix :class:`asyncio.streams.StreamReaderProtocol` to keep a "
"strong reference to the created task, so that it's not garbage collected"
msgstr ""
":gh:`90467`: 修复 :class:`asyncio.streams.StreamReaderProtocol` "
"以保持对创建的任务的强引用，从而避免被垃圾回收。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3472
msgid ""
":gh:`96159`: Fix a performance regression in logging "
"TimedRotatingFileHandler. Only check for special files when the rollover "
"time has passed."
msgstr ":gh:`96159`: 修复日志 TimedRotatingFileHandler 中的性能回归问题。仅在滚动时间过去时检查特殊文件。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3476
msgid ""
":gh:`96175`: Fix unused ``localName`` parameter in the ``Attr`` class in "
":mod:`xml.dom.minidom`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96175`: 修复 :mod:`xml.dom.minidom` 中 ``Attr`` 类未使用的 ``localName`` 参数。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3479
msgid ""
":gh:`96125`: Fix incorrect condition that causes ``sys.thread_info.name`` to"
" be wrong on pthread platforms."
msgstr ":gh:`96125`: 修复导致 ``sys.thread_info.name`` 在 pthread 平台上错误的错误条件。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3482
msgid ""
":gh:`95463`: Remove an incompatible change from :issue:`28080` that caused a"
" regression that ignored the utf8 in ``ZipInfo.flag_bits``. Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95463`: 移除来自 :issue:`28080` 的不兼容更改，该更改导致了一个回归问题，即忽略了 "
"``ZipInfo.flag_bits`` 中的 utf8。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3486
msgid ""
":gh:`95899`: Fix :class:`asyncio.Runner` to call "
":func:`asyncio.set_event_loop` only once to avoid calling "
":meth:`~asyncio.AbstractChildWatcher.attach_loop` multiple times on child "
"watchers. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95899`: 修复 :class:`asyncio.Runner` 使其只调用 :func:`asyncio.set_event_loop`"
" 一次，以避免在子监视器上多次调用 :meth:`~asyncio.AbstractChildWatcher.attach_loop`。由 Kumar "
"Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3491
msgid ""
":gh:`95736`: Fix :class:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` to set event loop"
" before calling setup functions. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95736`: 修复 :class:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` 在调用设置函数之前设置事件循环。由 "
"Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3494
msgid ""
":gh:`95704`: When a task catches :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` and raises "
"some other error, the other error should generally not silently be "
"suppressed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95704`: 当一个任务捕获 :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` 并引发其他错误时，其他错误通常不应被静默抑制。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3498
msgid ""
":gh:`95231`: Fail gracefully if :data:`~errno.EPERM` or "
":data:`~errno.ENOSYS` is raised when loading :mod:`crypt` methods. This may "
"happen when trying to load ``MD5`` on a Linux kernel with :abbr:`FIPS "
"(Federal Information Processing Standard)` enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3503
msgid ""
":gh:`74116`: Allow :meth:`asyncio.StreamWriter.drain` to be awaited "
"concurrently by multiple tasks. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`74116`: 允许 :meth:`asyncio.StreamWriter.drain` 被多个任务并发等待。由 Kumar Aditya "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3506
msgid ":gh:`92986`: Fix :func:`ast.unparse` when ``ImportFrom.level`` is None"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3511
msgid ""
":gh:`96098`: Improve discoverability of the higher level concurrent.futures "
"module by providing clearer links from the lower level threading and "
"multiprocessing modules."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96098`: 通过从较低级别的 threading 和 multiprocessing 模块提供更清晰的链接，提高了较高层次 "
"concurrent.futures 模块的可发现性。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3515
msgid ""
":gh:`95957`: What's New 3.11 now has instructions for how to provide "
"compiler and linker flags for Tcl/Tk and OpenSSL on RHEL 7 and CentOS 7."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95957`: What's New 3.11 现在提供了关于如何在 RHEL 7 和 CentOS 7 上为 Tcl/Tk 和 "
"OpenSSL 提供编译器和链接器标志的说明。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3521
msgid ""
":gh:`95243`: Mitigate the inherent race condition from using "
"find_unused_port() in testSockName() by trying to find an unused port a few "
"times before failing. Patch by Ross Burton."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95243`: 通过在失败前尝试多次找到未使用的端口，缓解了在 testSockName() 中使用 find_unused_port() "
"固有的竞态条件。由 Ross Burton 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3528
msgid ":gh:`94682`: Build and test with OpenSSL 1.1.1q"
msgstr ":gh:`94682`: 使用 OpenSSL 1.1.1q 进行构建和测试"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3533
msgid ":gh:`96577`: Fixes a potential buffer overrun in :mod:`msilib`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3535
msgid ""
":gh:`96559`: Fixes the Windows launcher not using the compatible "
"interpretation of default tags found in configuration files when no tag was "
"passed to the command."
msgstr ":gh:`96559`: 修复了当没有向命令传递标签时，Windows启动器不使用配置文件中找到的默认标签的兼容性解释的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3541
msgid "Python 3.11.0 release candidate 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3543
msgid "*Release date: 2022-08-05*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3548
msgid ""
":gh:`95150`: Update code object hashing and equality to consider all "
"debugging and exception handling tables. This fixes an issue where certain "
"non-identical code objects could be \"deduplicated\" during compilation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95150`: 更新代码对象的哈希和相等性考虑，以考虑所有调试和异常处理表。这修复了在编译过程中某些非相同代码对象可能被\"去重\"的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3552
msgid ""
":gh:`95355`: ``_PyPegen_Parser_New`` now properly detects token memory "
"allocation errors. Patch by Honglin Zhu."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95355`: ``_PyPegen_Parser_New`` 现在能正确检测令牌内存分配错误。补丁由Honglin Zhu提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3555
msgid ""
":gh:`90081`: Run Python code in tracer/profiler function at full speed. "
"Fixes slowdown in earlier versions of 3.11."
msgstr ":gh:`90081`: 在追踪器/分析器函数中以全速运行Python代码。修复了早期3.11版本中的速度下降问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3558
msgid ""
":gh:`95324`: Emit a warning in debug mode if an object does not call "
":c:func:`PyObject_GC_UnTrack` before deallocation. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95324`: 在调试模式下，如果对象在释放前未调用 :c:func:`PyObject_GC_UnTrack`，则发出警告。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3561
msgid ""
":gh:`95185`: Prevented crashes in the AST constructor when compiling some "
"absurdly long expressions like ``\"+0\"*1000000``. :exc:`RecursionError` is "
"now raised instead. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`95185`: 防止在编译一些极长表达式如 ``\"+0\"*1000000`` 时AST构造器崩溃。现在会改为抛出 "
":exc:`RecursionError`。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3565 ../../../build/NEWS:3726
msgid ""
":gh:`93351`: :class:`ast.AST` node positions are now validated when provided"
" to :func:`compile` and other related functions. If invalid positions are "
"detected, a :exc:`ValueError` will be raised."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93351`: 现在，当向 :func:`compile` 和其他相关函数提供 :class:`ast.AST` "
"节点位置时，会验证这些位置。如果检测到无效位置，将抛出 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3569
msgid ""
":gh:`94938`: Fix error detection in some builtin functions when keyword "
"argument name is an instance of a str subclass with overloaded ``__eq__`` "
"and ``__hash__``. Previously it could cause SystemError or other undesired "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94938`: 修复当关键字参数名称是重载了 ``__eq__`` 和 ``__hash__`` 的 str "
"子类实例时，某些内置函数中的错误检测。之前这可能导致 SystemError 或其他不希望的行为。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3577
msgid ":gh:`95609`: Update bundled pip to 22.2.2."
msgstr ":gh:`95609`: 更新捆绑的 pip 到 22.2.2 版本。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3579
msgid ""
":gh:`95289`: Fix :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` to propagate exception when "
":exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` was replaced with another exception by a "
"context manger. Patch by Kumar Aditya and Guido van Rossum."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3583
msgid ":gh:`95339`: Update bundled pip to 22.2.1."
msgstr ":gh:`95339`: 更新捆绑的 pip 到 22.2.1。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3585
msgid ""
":gh:`95045`: Fix GC crash when deallocating ``_lsprof.Profiler`` by "
"untracking it before calling any callbacks. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95045`: 通过在调用任何回调之前取消跟踪，修复在释放 ``_lsprof.Profiler`` 时的 GC 崩溃。由 Kumar "
"Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3588
msgid ""
":gh:`95097`: Fix :func:`asyncio.run` for :class:`asyncio.Task` "
"implementations without :meth:`~asyncio.Task.uncancel` method. Patch by "
"Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95097`: 为没有 :meth:`~asyncio.Task.uncancel` 方法的 :class:`asyncio.Task` "
"实现修复 :func:`asyncio.run`。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3592
msgid ""
":gh:`93899`: Fix check for existence of :data:`os.EFD_CLOEXEC`, "
":data:`os.EFD_NONBLOCK` and :data:`os.EFD_SEMAPHORE` flags on older kernel "
"versions where these flags are not present. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3596
msgid ""
":gh:`95166`: Fix :meth:`concurrent.futures.Executor.map` to cancel the "
"currently waiting on future on an error - e.g. TimeoutError or "
"KeyboardInterrupt."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95166`: 修复 :meth:`concurrent.futures.Executor.map`，使其在错误（例如 "
"TimeoutError 或 KeyboardInterrupt）时取消当前等待的 future。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3600
msgid ""
":gh:`95109`: Ensure that timeouts scheduled with :class:`asyncio.Timeout` "
"that have already expired are delivered promptly."
msgstr ":gh:`95109`: 确保已过期的时间调度（使用 :class:`asyncio.Timeout`）能够被及时传递。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3603
msgid ""
":gh:`91810`: Suppress writing an XML declaration in open files in "
"``ElementTree.write()`` with ``encoding='unicode'`` and "
"``xml_declaration=None``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91810`: 在使用 ``encoding='unicode'`` 和 ``xml_declaration=None`` 的 "
"``ElementTree.write()`` 中，抑制在打开的文件中写入 XML 声明。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3607
msgid ""
":gh:`91447`: Fix findtext in the xml module to only give an empty string "
"when the text attribute is set to None."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3613
msgid ""
":gh:`91207`: Fix stylesheet not working in Windows CHM htmlhelp docs and add"
" warning that they are deprecated. Contributed by C.A.M. Gerlach."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91207`: 修复了 Windows CHM htmlhelp 文档中样式表不起作用的问题，并添加了它们已被弃用的警告。由 C.A.M. "
"Gerlach 贡献。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3616
msgid ""
":gh:`95451`: Update library documentation with :ref:`availability "
"information <wasm-availability>` on WebAssembly platforms "
"``wasm32-emscripten`` and ``wasm32-wasi``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95451`: 更新了库文档，添加了关于 WebAssembly 平台 ``wasm32-emscripten`` 和 "
"``wasm32-wasi`` 的 :ref:`availability information <wasm-availability>`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3620
msgid ""
":gh:`95415`: Use consistent syntax for platform availability. The directive "
"now supports a content body and emits a warning when it encounters an "
"unknown platform."
msgstr ":gh:`95415`: 对平台可用性使用一致的语法。该指令现在支持内容体，并在遇到未知平台时发出警告。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3624
msgid ""
":gh:`86128`: Document a limitation in ThreadPoolExecutor where its exit "
"handler is executed before any handlers in atexit."
msgstr ""
":gh:`86128`: 文档化 ThreadPoolExecutor 中的一个限制，即其退出处理程序在任何 atexit 处理程序之前执行。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3630
msgid ""
":gh:`95573`: :source:`Lib/test/test_asyncio/test_ssl.py` exposed a bug in "
"the macOS kernel where intense concurrent load on non-blocking sockets "
"occasionally causes :const:`errno.ENOBUFS` (\"No buffer space available\") "
"to be emitted. FB11063974 filed with Apple, in the mean time as a workaround"
" buffer size used in tests on macOS is decreased to avoid intermittent "
"failures.  Patch by Fantix King."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95573`: :source:`Lib/test/test_asyncio/test_ssl.py` 暴露了 macOS 内核中的一个 "
"bug，其中非阻塞套接字上的高强度并发负载偶尔会导致 :const:`errno.ENOBUFS` (“无缓冲区空间可用”) 被发出。已向 Apple "
"提交 FB11063974，同时作为一种临时解决方案，减少在 macOS 上测试中使用的缓冲区大小以避免间歇性失败。由 Fantix King "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3637
msgid ""
":gh:`95280`: Fix problem with ``test_ssl`` ``test_get_ciphers`` on systems "
"that require perfect forward secrecy (PFS) ciphers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95280`: 修复了在需要完美前向保密（PFS）密码的系统上 ``test_ssl`` ``test_get_ciphers`` 的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3640
msgid ""
":gh:`94675`: Add a regression test for :mod:`re` exponentional slowdown when"
" using rjsmin."
msgstr ":gh:`94675`: 为 :mod:`re` 在使用 rjsmin 时的指数级减速添加了一个回归测试。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3646
msgid ""
":gh:`94801`: Fix a regression in ``configure`` script that caused some "
"header checks to ignore custom ``CPPFLAGS``. The regression was introduced "
"in :gh:`94802`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94801`: 修复 ``configure`` 脚本中的一个回归，该回归导致某些头文件检查忽略自定义的 ``CPPFLAGS``。该回归在 "
":gh:`94802` 中引入。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3650
msgid ""
":gh:`95145`: wasm32-wasi builds no longer depend on WASIX's pthread stubs. "
"Python now has its own stubbed pthread API."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95145`: wasm32-wasi 构建不再依赖 WASIX 的 pthread 存根。Python 现在有自己的存根 pthread "
"API。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3653
msgid ""
":gh:`95174`: Python now detects missing ``dup`` function in WASI and works "
"around some missing :mod:`errno`, :mod:`select`, and :mod:`socket` "
"constants."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95174`: Python 现在检测 WASI 中缺失的 ``dup`` 函数，并解决一些缺失的 "
":mod:`errno`，:mod:`select`，和 :mod:`socket` 常量。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3657
msgid ""
":gh:`95174`: Python now skips missing :mod:`socket` functions and methods on"
" WASI. WASI can only create sockets from existing fd / accept and has no "
"netdb."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95174`: Python 现在在 WASI 上跳过缺失的 :mod:`socket` 函数和方法。WASI 只能从现有的 fd 创建套接字"
" / accept 并且没有 netdb。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3661
msgid ""
":gh:`95085`: Platforms ``wasm32-unknown-emscripten`` and ``wasm32-unknown-"
"wasi`` have been promoted to :pep:`11` tier 3 platform support."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95085`: 平台 ``wasm32-unknown-emscripten`` 和 ``wasm32-unknown-wasi`` "
"已被提升为 :pep:`11` 第3层平台支持。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3668
msgid ""
":gh:`95656`: Enable the :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.enable_load_extension` "
":mod:`sqlite3` API."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95656`: 启用 :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.enable_load_extension` "
":mod:`sqlite3` API。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3671
msgid ""
":gh:`95587`: Fixes some issues where the Windows installer would incorrectly"
" detect certain features of an existing install when upgrading."
msgstr ":gh:`95587`: 修复了 Windows 安装程序在升级时错误检测现有安装的某些功能的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3674
msgid ""
":gh:`94399`: Restores the behaviour of :ref:`launcher` for ``/usr/bin/env`` "
"shebang lines, which will now search :envvar:`PATH` for an executable "
"matching the given command. If none is found, the usual search process is "
"used."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94399`: 恢复了 :ref:`launcher` 对于 ``/usr/bin/env`` shebang 行的行为，现在将在 "
":envvar:`PATH` 中搜索与给定命令匹配的可执行文件。如果没有找到，则使用通常的搜索过程。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3679
msgid ""
":gh:`95445`: Fixes the unsuccessful removal of the HTML document directory "
"when uninstalling with Windows msi."
msgstr ":gh:`95445`: 修复了在使用 Windows msi 卸载时未能成功删除 HTML 文档目录的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3682
msgid ""
":gh:`95359`: Fix :ref:`launcher` handling of :file:`py.ini` commands (it was"
" incorrectly expecting a ``py_`` prefix on keys) and crashes when reading "
"per-user configuration file."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95359`: 修复 :ref:`launcher` 对 :file:`py.ini` 命令的处理（它错误地期望键上有 ``py_`` "
"前缀）以及在读取每用户配置文件时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3686
msgid ""
":gh:`95285`: Fix :ref:`launcher` handling of command lines where it is only "
"passed a short executable name."
msgstr ":gh:`95285`: 修复 :ref:`launcher` 处理仅传递短可执行名称的命令行的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3692
msgid ":gh:`65802`: Document handling of extensions in Save As dialogs."
msgstr ":gh:`65802`: 记录在另存为对话框中处理扩展名的方法。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3694
msgid ""
":gh:`95191`: Include prompts when saving Shell (interactive input and "
"output)."
msgstr ":gh:`95191`: 保存 Shell（交互式输入和输出）时包括提示。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3697
msgid ""
":gh:`95511`: Fix the Shell context menu copy-with-prompts bug of copying an "
"extra line when one selects whole lines."
msgstr ":gh:`95511`: 修复 Shell 上下文菜单复制带提示的 bug，即当选择整行时会复制额外的行。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3700
msgid ""
":gh:`95471`: In the Edit menu, move ``Select All`` and add a new separator."
msgstr ":gh:`95471`: 在编辑菜单中，移动 ``Select All`` 并添加一个新的分隔符。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3702
msgid ":gh:`95411`: Enable using IDLE's module browser with .pyw files."
msgstr ":gh:`95411`: 启用IDLE的模块浏览器以支持.pyw文件。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3704
msgid ""
":gh:`89610`: Add .pyi as a recognized extension for IDLE on macOS.    This "
"allows opening stub files by double clicking on them in the Finder."
msgstr ":gh:`89610`: 在macOS上为IDLE添加.pyi作为已识别的扩展名。这允许通过双击Finder中的存根文件来打开它们。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3710
msgid ""
":gh:`92678`: Restore the 3.10 behavior for multiple inheritance of C "
"extension classes that store their dictionary at the end of the struct."
msgstr ":gh:`92678`: 恢复了 3.10 的行为，对于在结构体末尾存储字典的 C 扩展类支持多重继承。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3713
msgid ""
":gh:`94936`: Added :c:func:`PyCode_GetVarnames`, "
":c:func:`PyCode_GetCellvars` and :c:func:`PyCode_GetFreevars` for accessing "
"``co_varnames``, ``co_cellvars`` and ``co_freevars`` respectively via the C "
"API."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94936`: 添加了 :c:func:`PyCode_GetVarnames`、:c:func:`PyCode_GetCellvars` 和"
" :c:func:`PyCode_GetFreevars`，用于通过 C API 分别访问 "
"``co_varnames``、``co_cellvars`` 和 ``co_freevars``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3719
msgid "Python 3.11.0 beta 5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3721
msgid "*Release date: 2022-07-25*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3730
msgid ""
":gh:`94438`: Fix an issue that caused extended opcode arguments and some "
"conditional pops to be ignored when calculating valid jump targets for "
"assignments to the ``f_lineno`` attribute of frame objects. In some cases, "
"this could cause inconsistent internal state, resulting in a hard crash of "
"the interpreter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94438`: 修复了一个问题，该问题导致在计算对帧对象的 ``f_lineno`` "
"属性赋值的有效跳转目标时，忽略扩展操作码参数和一些条件弹出。在某些情况下，这可能导致内部状态不一致，导致解释器硬崩溃。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3736
msgid ""
":gh:`95060`: Undocumented ``PyCode_Addr2Location`` function now properly "
"returns when ``addrq`` argument is less than zero."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95060`: 未记录的 ``PyCode_Addr2Location`` 函数现在在 ``addrq`` 参数小于零时正确返回。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3739
msgid ""
":gh:`95113`: Replace all ``EXTENDED_ARG_QUICK`` instructions with basic "
":opcode:`EXTENDED_ARG` instructions in unquickened code. Consumers of non-"
"adaptive bytecode should be able to handle extended arguments the same way "
"they were handled in CPython 3.10 and older."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95113`: 在非快速化代码中，将所有 ``EXTENDED_ARG_QUICK`` 指令替换为基本的 "
":opcode:`EXTENDED_ARG` 指令。非自适应字节码的使用者应该能够以与CPython 3.10及更早版本相同的方式处理扩展参数。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3744
msgid ""
":gh:`91409`: Fix incorrect source location info caused by certain "
"optimizations in the bytecode compiler."
msgstr ":gh:`91409`: 修复由字节码编译器中的某些优化引起的错误源代码位置信息。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3747
msgid ""
":gh:`94036`: Fix incorrect source location info for some multi-line "
"attribute accesses and method calls."
msgstr ":gh:`94036`: 修复一些多行属性访问和方法调用的错误源代码位置信息。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3750
msgid ""
":gh:`94739`: Allow jumping within, out of, and across exception handlers in "
"the debugger."
msgstr ":gh:`94739`: 允许在调试器中跳入、跳出以及跨异常处理器跳转。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3753
msgid ""
":gh:`94949`: :func:`ast.parse` will no longer parse parenthesized context "
"managers when passed ``feature_version`` less than ``(3, 9)``. Patch by "
"Shantanu Jain."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94949`: :func:`ast.parse` 在传递的 ``feature_version`` 小于 ``(3, 9)`` "
"时，将不再解析带括号的上下文管理器。由 Shantanu Jain 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3757
msgid ""
":gh:`94947`: :func:`ast.parse` will no longer parse assignment expressions "
"when passed ``feature_version`` less than ``(3, 8)``. Patch by Shantanu "
"Jain."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94947`: :func:`ast.parse` 在传递的 ``feature_version`` 小于 ``(3, 8)`` "
"时，将不再解析赋值表达式。由 Shantanu Jain 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3761
msgid ""
":gh:`91256`: Ensures the program name is known for help text during "
"interpreter startup."
msgstr ":gh:`91256`: 确保解释器启动期间帮助文本的程序名称是已知的。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3764
msgid ""
":gh:`94869`: Fix the column offsets for some expressions in multi-line "
"f-strings :mod:`ast` nodes. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":gh:`94869`: 修复多行 f-字符串 :mod:`ast` 节点中某些表达式的列偏移。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3767
msgid ""
":gh:`94822`: Fix an issue where lookups of metaclass descriptors may be "
"ignored when an identically-named attribute also exists on the class itself."
msgstr ":gh:`94822`: 修复当类本身也存在同名属性时，元类描述符的查找可能被忽略的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3771
msgid ""
":gh:`91153`: Fix an issue where a :class:`bytearray` item assignment could "
"crash if it's resized by the new value's :meth:`__index__` method."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91153`: 修复 :class:`bytearray` 项赋值在通过新值的 :meth:`__index__` "
"方法调整大小时可能崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3774
msgid ""
":gh:`90699`: Fix reference counting bug in :meth:`bool.__repr__`. Patch by "
"Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":gh:`90699`: 修复 :meth:`bool.__repr__` 中的引用计数错误。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3780
msgid ""
":gh:`95087`: Fix IndexError in parsing invalid date in the :mod:`email` "
"module."
msgstr ":gh:`95087`: 修复 :mod:`email` 模块中解析无效日期时的 IndexError。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3783
msgid ":gh:`95199`: Upgrade bundled setuptools to 63.2.0."
msgstr ":gh:`95199`: 更新捆绑的 setuptools 到 63.2.0。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3785
msgid ":gh:`95194`: Upgrade bundled pip to 22.2."
msgstr ":gh:`95194`: 更新捆绑的 pip 到 22.2。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3787
msgid ""
":gh:`95132`: Fix a :mod:`sqlite3` regression where ``*args`` and ``**kwds`` "
"were incorrectly relayed from :py:func:`~sqlite3.connect` to the "
":class:`~sqlite3.Connection` factory. The regression was introduced in "
"3.11a1 with PR 24421 (:gh:`85128`). Patch by Erlend E. Aasland.`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3792
msgid ""
":gh:`93157`: Fix :mod:`fileinput` module didn't support ``errors`` option "
"when ``inplace`` is true."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93157`: 修复 :mod:`fileinput` 模块在 ``inplace`` 为 true 时不支持 ``errors`` "
"选项的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3795
msgid ""
":gh:`95105`: :meth:`wsgiref.types.InputStream.__iter__` should return "
"``Iterator[bytes]``, not ``Iterable[bytes]``. Patch by Shantanu Jain."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95105`: :meth:`wsgiref.types.InputStream.__iter__` 应返回 "
"``Iterator[bytes]``，而不是 ``Iterable[bytes]``。由 Shantanu Jain 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3798
msgid ""
":gh:`94857`: Fix refleak in ``_io.TextIOWrapper.reconfigure``. Patch by "
"Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94857`: 修复 ``_io.TextIOWrapper.reconfigure`` 中的内存泄漏。补丁由 Kumar Aditya "
"提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3801
msgid ""
":gh:`94821`: Fix binding of unix socket to empty address on Linux to use an "
"available address from the abstract namespace, instead of \"\\0\"."
msgstr ":gh:`94821`: 修复 Linux 上 Unix 套接字绑定到空地址时使用抽象命名空间中的可用地址，而不是 \"\\0\"。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3804
msgid ""
":gh:`89988`: Fix memory leak in :class:`pickle.Pickler` when looking up "
":attr:`dispatch_table`. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89988`: 修复 :class:`pickle.Pickler` 在查找 :attr:`dispatch_table` "
"时的内存泄漏。补丁由 Kumar Aditya 提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3807
msgid ":issue:`47025`: Drop support for :class:`bytes` on :attr:`sys.path`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3812
msgid ""
":gh:`95212`: Make multiprocessing test case ``test_shared_memory_recreate`` "
"parallel-safe."
msgstr ":gh:`95212`: 使多进程测试用例 ``test_shared_memory_recreate`` 并行安全。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3818
msgid ""
":gh:`94847`: Fixed ``_decimal`` module build issue on GCC when compiling "
"with LTO and pydebug. Debug builds no longer force inlining of functions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94847`: 修复了在 GCC 使用 LTO 和 pydebug 编译时 ``_decimal`` "
"模块的构建问题。调试构建不再强制内联函数。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3821
msgid ""
":gh:`94841`: Fix the possible performance regression of "
":c:func:`PyObject_Free` compiled with MSVC version 1932."
msgstr ":gh:`94841`: 修复了使用 MSVC 版本 1932 编译的 :c:func:`PyObject_Free` 可能的性能回归。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3824
msgid ""
":gh:`94801`: ``configure`` now uses custom flags like ``ZLIB_CFLAGS`` and "
"``ZLIB_LIBS`` when searching for headers and libraries."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94801`: ``configure`` 现在在搜索头文件和库时使用自定义标志如 ``ZLIB_CFLAGS`` 和 "
"``ZLIB_LIBS``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3827
msgid ""
":gh:`94773`: ``deepfreeze.py`` now supports code object with frozensets that"
" contain incompatible, unsortable types."
msgstr ":gh:`94773`: ``deepfreeze.py`` 现在支持包含不兼容、不可排序类型的 frozensets 的代码对象。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3833
msgid ""
":gh:`90844`: Allow virtual environments to correctly launch when they have "
"spaces in the path."
msgstr ":gh:`90844`: 允许虚拟环境在路径中有空格时正确启动。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3836
msgid ""
":gh:`94772`: Fix incorrect handling of shebang lines in py.exe launcher"
msgstr ":gh:`94772`: 修复 py.exe 启动器中 shebang 行的错误处理"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3841
msgid ""
":gh:`92678`: Adds unstable C-API functions ``_PyObject_VisitManagedDict`` "
"and ``_PyObject_ClearManagedDict`` to allow C extensions to allow the VM to "
"manage their object's dictionaries."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92678`: 添加了不稳定的 C-API 函数 ``_PyObject_VisitManagedDict`` 和 "
"``_PyObject_ClearManagedDict``，允许 C 扩展让虚拟机管理它们的对象字典。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3845
msgid ""
":gh:`94930`: Fix ``SystemError`` raised when "
":c:func:`PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords` is used with ``#`` in ``(...)`` but "
"without ``PY_SSIZE_T_CLEAN`` defined."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94930`: 修复了当 :c:func:`PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords` 与 ``#`` 在 ``(...)`` "
"中一起使用但未定义 ``PY_SSIZE_T_CLEAN`` 时引发的 ``SystemError``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3849
msgid ""
":gh:`94864`: Fix ``PyArg_Parse*`` with deprecated format units \"u\" and "
"\"Z\". It returned 1 (success) when warnings are turned into exceptions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3852
msgid ""
":gh:`94731`: Python again uses C-style casts for most casting operations "
"when compiled with C++. This may trigger compiler warnings, if they are "
"enabled with e.g. ``-Wold-style-cast`` or ``-Wzero-as-null-pointer-"
"constant`` options for ``g++``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94731`: Python 在使用 C++ 编译时，再次对大多数类型转换操作使用 C 风格的转换。这可能会触发编译器警告，如果它们是通过例如"
" ``g++`` 的 ``-Wold-style-cast`` 或 ``-Wzero-as-null-pointer-constant`` 选项启用的。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3859
msgid "Python 3.11.0 beta 4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3861
msgid "*Release date: 2022-07-11*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3866
msgid ""
":gh:`87389`: :mod:`http.server`: Fix an open redirection vulnerability in "
"the HTTP server when an URI path starts with ``//``.  Vulnerability "
"discovered, and initial fix proposed, by Hamza Avvan."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87389`: :mod:`http.server`: 修复了HTTP服务器中当URI路径以 ``//`` "
"开头时的开放重定向漏洞。漏洞由Hamza Avvan发现并提出了初步修复方案。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3870
msgid ""
":gh:`79096`: LWPCookieJar and MozillaCookieJar create files with file mode "
"600 instead of 644 (Microsoft Windows is not affected)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`79096`: LWPCookieJar和MozillaCookieJar创建的文件模式改为600而非644（Microsoft "
"Windows不受影响）"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3873
msgid ""
":gh:`92888`: Fix ``memoryview`` use after free when accessing the backing "
"buffer in certain cases."
msgstr ":gh:`92888`: 修复了在某些情况下访问底层缓冲区时的 ``memoryview`` 释放后使用问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3876
msgid ""
":gh:`68966`: The deprecated mailcap module now refuses to inject unsafe text"
" (filenames, MIME types, parameters) into shell commands. Instead of using "
"such text, it will warn and act as if a match was not found (or for test "
"commands, as if the test failed)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`68966`: "
"已弃用的mailcap模块现在拒绝将不安全的文本（文件名、MIME类型、参数）注入到shell命令中。它将发出警告并视为未找到匹配（或对于测试命令，视为测试失败），而不是使用此类文本。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3884
msgid ""
":gh:`94694`: Fix an issue that could cause code with multi-line method "
"lookups to have misleading or incorrect column offset information. In some "
"cases (when compiling a hand-built AST) this could have resulted in a hard "
"crash of the interpreter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94694`: 修复可能导致具有多行方法查找的代码具有误导性或错误的列偏移信息的问题。在某些情况下（当编译手动构建的 AST "
"时），这可能导致解释器硬崩溃。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3889
msgid ""
":gh:`93252`: Fix an issue that caused internal frames to outlive failed "
"Python function calls, possibly resulting in memory leaks or hard "
"interpreter crashes."
msgstr ":gh:`93252`: 修复导致内部帧在失败的 Python 函数调用后仍然存活的问题，可能导致内存泄漏或解释器硬崩溃。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3893
msgid ""
":gh:`94215`: Fix an issue where exceptions raised by line-tracing events "
"would cause frames to be left in an invalid state, possibly resulting in a "
"hard crash of the interpreter."
msgstr ":gh:`94215`: 修复了一个问题，即由行追踪事件引发的异常会导致帧处于无效状态，可能导致解释器硬崩溃。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3897
msgid ""
":gh:`92228`: Disable the compiler's inline-small-exit-blocks optimization "
"for exit blocks that are associated with source code lines. This fixes a bug"
" where the debugger cannot tell where an exception handler ends and the "
"following code block begins."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92228`: "
"对于与源代码行相关联的退出块，禁用编译器的内联小退出块优化。这修复了一个bug，即调试器无法区分异常处理器的结束和后续代码块的开始。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3902
msgid ""
":gh:`94485`: Line number of a module's ``RESUME`` instruction is set to 0 as"
" specified in :pep:`626`."
msgstr ":gh:`94485`: 根据 :pep:`626` 的规定，模块的 ``RESUME`` 指令的行号被设置为0。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3905
msgid ""
":gh:`94438`: Account for instructions that can push NULL to the stack when "
"setting line number in a frame. Prevents some (unlikely) crashes."
msgstr ":gh:`94438`: 在设置帧中的行号时，考虑可以推NULL到堆栈的指令。防止一些（不太可能的）崩溃。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3908
msgid ""
":gh:`91719`: Reload ``opcode`` when raising ``unknown opcode error`` in the "
"interpreter main loop, for C compilers to generate dispatching code "
"independently."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91719`: 在解释器主循环中引发 ``unknown opcode error`` 时重新加载 "
"``opcode``，以便C编译器独立生成调度代码。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3912
msgid ""
":gh:`94329`: Compile and run code with unpacking of extremely large "
"sequences (1000s of elements). Such code failed to compile. It now compiles "
"and runs correctly."
msgstr ":gh:`94329`: 编译并运行具有极大序列（1000多个元素）解包的代码。此类代码之前无法编译。现在可以正确编译并运行。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3916
msgid ""
":gh:`94360`: Fixed a tokenizer crash when reading encoded files with syntax "
"errors from ``stdin`` with non utf-8 encoded text. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`94360`: 修复了当从 ``stdin`` 读取带有语法错误的非utf-8编码文本文件时，分词器崩溃的问题。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3919
msgid ""
":gh:`88116`: Fix an issue when reading line numbers from code objects if the"
" encoded line numbers are close to ``INT_MIN``. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`88116`: 修复了当从代码对象读取行号时，如果编码的行号接近 ``INT_MIN`` 时的问题。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3922
msgid ""
":gh:`94262`: Don't create frame objects for incomplete frames. Prevents the "
"creation of generators and closures from being observable to Python and C "
"extensions, restoring the behavior of 3.10 and earlier."
msgstr ":gh:`94262`: 不为不完整的帧创建帧对象。防止Python和C扩展可以观察到生成器和闭包的创建，恢复了3.10及更早版本的行为。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3926
msgid ""
":gh:`94192`: Fix error for dictionary literals with invalid expression as "
"value."
msgstr ":gh:`94192`: 修复了字典字面量中值表达式无效时的错误。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3929
msgid ""
":gh:`93883`: Revise the display strategy of traceback enhanced error "
"locations.  The indicators are only shown when the location doesn't span the"
" whole line."
msgstr ":gh:`93883`: 修订了回溯增强错误位置的显示策略。指示器仅在位置不跨越整行时显示。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3933
msgid ":gh:`94021`: Fix unreachable code warning in ``Python/specialize.c``."
msgstr ":gh:`94021`: 修复 ``Python/specialize.c`` 中不可达代码的警告。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3935
msgid ""
":gh:`93516`: Store offset of first traceable instruction in code object to "
"avoid having to recompute it for each instruction when tracing."
msgstr ":gh:`93516`: 在代码对象中存储第一个可跟踪指令的偏移量，以避免在跟踪时对每个指令重新计算。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3938
msgid ""
":gh:`93516`: Lazily create a table mapping bytecode offsets to line numbers "
"to speed up calculation of line numbers when tracing."
msgstr ":gh:`93516`: 延迟创建将字节码偏移量映射到行号的表，以加快跟踪时行号的计算速度。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3941
msgid ""
":gh:`89828`: :class:`types.GenericAlias` no longer relays the ``__class__`` "
"attribute. For example, ``isinstance(list[int], type)`` no longer returns "
"``True``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89828`: :class:`types.GenericAlias` 不再中继 ``__class__`` "
"属性。例如，``isinstance(list[int], type)`` 不再返回 ``True``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3945
msgid ""
":gh:`93671`: Fix some exponential backtrace case happening with deeply "
"nested sequence patterns in match statements. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`93671`: 修复在匹配语句中深度嵌套序列模式时发生的一些指数回溯情况。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3948
msgid ""
":gh:`93662`: Make sure that the end column offsets are correct in multi-line"
" method calls. Previously, the end column could precede the column offset."
msgstr ":gh:`93662`: 确保在多行方法调用中结束列偏移是正确的。以前，结束列可能会在列偏移之前。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3951
msgid ""
":gh:`93461`: :func:`importlib.invalidate_caches` now drops entries from "
":data:`sys.path_importer_cache` with a relative path as name. This solves a "
"caching issue when a process changes its current working directory."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93461`: :func:`importlib.invalidate_caches` 现在会从 "
":data:`sys.path_importer_cache` 中删除以相对路径为名称的条目。这解决了进程改变其当前工作目录时的缓存问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3955
msgid ""
"``FileFinder`` no longer inserts a dot in the path, e.g. ``/egg/./spam`` is "
"now ``/egg/spam``."
msgstr "``FileFinder`` 不再在路径中插入点，例如 ``/egg/./spam`` 现在是 ``/egg/spam``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3958
msgid ""
":gh:`93418`: Fixed an assert where an f-string has an equal sign '=' "
"following an expression, but there's no trailing brace. For example, "
"f\"{i=\"."
msgstr ":gh:`93418`: 修复了一个断言错误，其中 f-string 在表达式后有一个等号 '='，但没有尾随的大括号。例如，f\"{i=\"。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3962
msgid ""
":gh:`93382`: Cache the result of :c:func:`PyCode_GetCode` function to "
"restore the O(1) lookup of the :attr:`~types.CodeType.co_code` attribute."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3965
msgid ""
":gh:`93354`: Use exponential backoff for specialization counters in the "
"interpreter. Can reduce the number of failed specializations significantly "
"and avoid slowdown for those parts of a program that are not suitable for "
"specialization."
msgstr ":gh:`93354`: 在解释器中对专门化计数器使用指数退避。可以显著减少失败专门化的数量，并避免对程序中不适合专门化的部分造成减速。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3970
msgid ""
":gh:`93021`: Fix the :attr:`__text_signature__` for :meth:`__get__` methods "
"implemented in C. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93021`: 修复了在 C 中实现的 :meth:`__get__` 方法的 :attr:`__text_signature__`。补丁由 "
"Jelle Zijlstra 提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3973
msgid ""
":gh:`92930`: Fixed a crash in ``_pickle.c`` from mutating collections during"
" ``__reduce__`` or ``persistent_id``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92930`: 修复了在 ``__reduce__`` 或 ``persistent_id`` 期间修改集合导致的 ``_pickle.c``"
" 崩溃。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3976
msgid ""
":gh:`92914`: Always round the allocated size for lists up to the nearest "
"even number."
msgstr ":gh:`92914`: 总是将列表的分配大小向上舍入到最近的偶数。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3979
msgid ""
":gh:`92858`: Improve error message for some suites with syntax error before "
"':'"
msgstr ":gh:`92858`: 改进在 ':' 之前有语法错误的某些套件的错误消息。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3982
msgid ""
":issue:`46142`: Make ``--help`` output shorter by moving some info to the "
"new ``--help-env`` and ``--help-xoptions`` command-line options. Also add "
"``--help-all`` option to print complete usage."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46142`: 通过将一些信息移至新的命令行选项 ``--help-env`` 和 ``--help-xoptions``，使 "
"``--help`` 输出更简短。同时添加 ``--help-all`` 选项以打印完整用法。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3989
msgid ""
":gh:`94736`: Fix crash when deallocating an instance of a subclass of "
"``_multiprocessing.SemLock``. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94736`: 修复在释放 ``_multiprocessing.SemLock`` 子类实例时的崩溃问题。由 Kumar Aditya "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3992
msgid ""
":gh:`94637`: :meth:`SSLContext.set_default_verify_paths` now releases the "
"GIL around ``SSL_CTX_set_default_verify_paths`` call. The function call "
"performs I/O and CPU intensive work."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94637`: :meth:`SSLContext.set_default_verify_paths` 现在在 "
"``SSL_CTX_set_default_verify_paths`` 调用周围释放 GIL。该函数调用执行 I/O 和 CPU 密集型工作。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:3996
msgid ""
":gh:`94607`: Fix subclassing complex generics with type variables in "
":mod:`typing`. Previously an error message saying ``Some type variables ... "
"are not listed in Generic[...]`` was shown. :mod:`typing` no longer "
"populates ``__parameters__`` with the ``__parameters__`` of a Python class."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94607`: 修复在 :mod:`typing` 中使用类型变量子类化复杂泛型的问题。之前会显示错误消息 ``Some type "
"variables ... are not listed in Generic[...]``。:mod:`typing` 不再用 Python 类的 "
"``__parameters__`` 填充 ``__parameters__``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4002
msgid ""
":gh:`93910`: The ability to access the other values of an enum on an enum "
"(e.g. ``Color.RED.BLUE``) has been restored in order to fix a performance "
"regression."
msgstr ":gh:`93910`: 恢复了访问枚举上其他值的能力（例如 ``Color.RED.BLUE``），以修复性能回归问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4006
msgid ""
":gh:`93896`: Fix :func:`asyncio.run` and "
":class:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` to always the set event loop as it"
" was done in Python 3.10 and earlier. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93896`: 修复 :func:`asyncio.run` 和 "
":class:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` 以始终设置事件循环，如同在 Python 3.10 "
"及更早版本中所做的那样。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4010
msgid ""
":gh:`94510`: Re-entrant calls to :func:`sys.setprofile` and "
":func:`sys.settrace` now raise :exc:`RuntimeError`. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94510`: 对 :func:`sys.setprofile` 和 :func:`sys.settrace` 的重新进入调用现在会引发 "
":exc:`RuntimeError`。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4014
msgid ""
":gh:`92336`: Fix bug where :meth:`linecache.getline` fails on bad files with"
" :exc:`UnicodeDecodeError` or :exc:`SyntaxError`. It now returns an empty "
"string as per the documentation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92336`: 修复了 :meth:`linecache.getline` 在坏文件上因 :exc:`UnicodeDecodeError` "
"或 :exc:`SyntaxError` 而失败的错误。根据文档，现在它返回一个空字符串。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4018
msgid ""
":gh:`94398`: Once a :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` has started shutting down "
"(i.e., at least one task has failed and the task group has started "
"cancelling the remaining tasks), it should not be possible to add new tasks "
"to the task group."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94398`: 一旦 :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` "
"开始关闭（即，至少一个任务失败并且任务组开始取消剩余任务），就不应再向任务组添加新任务。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4023
msgid ""
":gh:`94254`: Fixed types of :mod:`struct` module to be immutable. Patch by "
"Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":gh:`94254`: 修正 :mod:`struct` 模块的类型为不可变。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4026
msgid ""
":gh:`94207`: Made :class:`_struct.Struct` GC-tracked in order to fix a "
"reference leak in the :mod:`_struct` module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4029
msgid ""
":gh:`91742`: Fix :mod:`pdb` crash after jump caused by a null pointer "
"dereference. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":gh:`91742`: 修复 :mod:`pdb` 因空指针解引用导致的跳转后崩溃问题。补丁由 Kumar Aditya 提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4032
msgid ""
":gh:`94101`: Manual instantiation of :class:`ssl.SSLSession` objects is no "
"longer allowed as it lead to misconfigured instances that crashed the "
"interpreter when attributes where accessed on them."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94101`: 不再允许手动实例化 :class:`ssl.SSLSession` "
"对象，因为这会导致配置错误的实例，在访问其属性时解释器崩溃。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4036
msgid ""
":gh:`84753`: :func:`inspect.iscoroutinefunction`, "
":func:`inspect.isgeneratorfunction`, and :func:`inspect.isasyncgenfunction` "
"now properly return ``True`` for duck-typed function-like objects like "
"instances of :class:`unittest.mock.AsyncMock`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`84753`: "
":func:`inspect.iscoroutinefunction`、:func:`inspect.isgeneratorfunction` 和 "
":func:`inspect.isasyncgenfunction` 现在能正确地为鸭子类型的函数式对象（如 "
":class:`unittest.mock.AsyncMock` 的实例）返回 ``True``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4042
msgid ""
"This makes :func:`inspect.iscoroutinefunction` consistent with the behavior "
"of :func:`asyncio.iscoroutinefunction`.  Patch by Mehdi ABAAKOUK."
msgstr ""
"这使得 :func:`inspect.iscoroutinefunction` 的行为与 "
":func:`asyncio.iscoroutinefunction` 保持一致。由 Mehdi ABAAKOUK 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4045
msgid ""
":gh:`94028`: Fix a regression in the :mod:`sqlite3` where statement objects "
"were not properly cleared and reset after use in cursor iters. The "
"regression was introduced by PR 27884 in Python 3.11a1. Patch by Erlend E. "
"Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94028`: 修复 :mod:`sqlite3` 中的一个回归问题，其中语句对象在游标迭代器使用后未被正确清除和重置。该回归问题由 "
"Python 3.11a1 中的 PR 27884 引入。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4050
msgid ":gh:`93820`: Pickle :class:`enum.Flag` by name."
msgstr ":gh:`93820`: 通过名称 Pickle :class:`enum.Flag`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4052
msgid ":gh:`93847`: Fix repr of enum of generic aliases."
msgstr ":gh:`93847`: 修复泛型别名枚举的 repr。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4054
msgid ""
":gh:`91404`: Revert the :mod:`re` memory leak when a match is terminated by "
"a signal or memory allocation failure as the implemented fix caused a major "
"performance regression."
msgstr ":gh:`91404`: 恢复 :mod:`re` 在匹配被信号或内存分配失败终止时的内存泄漏，因为已实现的修复导致了严重的性能回归。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4058
msgid ""
":gh:`83499`: Fix double closing of file description in :mod:`tempfile`."
msgstr ":gh:`83499`: 修复 :mod:`tempfile` 中文件描述符的双重关闭问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4060
msgid ""
":gh:`93820`: Fixed a regression when :func:`copy.copy`-ing "
":class:`enum.Flag` with multiple flag members."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93820`: 修复了一个回归问题，当 :func:`copy.copy`-ing 带有多个标志成员的 :class:`enum.Flag` "
"时。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4063
msgid ""
":gh:`79512`: Fixed names and ``__module__`` value of :mod:`weakref` classes "
":class:`~weakref.ReferenceType`, :class:`~weakref.ProxyType`, "
":class:`~weakref.CallableProxyType`. It makes them pickleable."
msgstr ""
":gh:`79512`: 修复了 :mod:`weakref` 模块中 "
":class:`~weakref.ReferenceType`、:class:`~weakref.ProxyType`、:class:`~weakref.CallableProxyType`"
" 类的名称和 ``__module__`` 值，使它们可以被 pickle。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4067
msgid ""
":gh:`91389`: Fix an issue where :mod:`dis` utilities could report missing or"
" incorrect position information in the presence of ``CACHE`` entries."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91389`: 修复了一个问题，其中 :mod:`dis` 工具在存在 ``CACHE`` 条目时可能会报告缺失或不正确的位置信息。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4070
msgid ""
":gh:`93626`: Set ``__future__.annotations`` to have a ``None`` "
"mandatoryRelease to indicate that it is currently 'TBD'."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93626`: 将 ``__future__.annotations`` 的 ``None`` mandatoryRelease "
"设置为表示当前为“待定”。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4073
msgid ""
":gh:`90473`: Emscripten and WASI have no home directory and cannot provide "
":pep:`370` user site directory."
msgstr ":gh:`90473`: Emscripten 和 WASI 没有主目录，无法提供 :pep:`370` 用户站点目录。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4076
msgid ""
":gh:`90494`: :func:`copy.copy` and :func:`copy.deepcopy` now always raise a "
"TypeError if ``__reduce__()`` returns a tuple with length 6 instead of "
"silently ignore the 6th item or produce incorrect result."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90494`: 如果 ``__reduce__()`` 返回长度为6的元组，:func:`copy.copy` 和 "
":func:`copy.deepcopy` 现在总是会引发 TypeError，而不是静默忽略第6项或产生不正确的结果。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4080
msgid ""
":gh:`90549`: Fix a multiprocessing bug where a global named resource (such "
"as a semaphore) could leak when a child process is spawned (as opposed to "
"forked)."
msgstr ":gh:`90549`: 修复了一个多进程错误，其中在创建子进程（与 fork 相对）时，全局命名资源（如信号量）可能会泄漏。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4084
msgid ""
":gh:`93521`: Fixed a case where dataclasses would try to add ``__weakref__``"
" into the ``__slots__`` for a dataclass that specified ``weakref_slot=True``"
" when it was already defined in one of its bases. This resulted in a "
"``TypeError`` upon the new class being created."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93521`: 修复了一个情况，其中数据类会尝试将 ``__weakref__`` 添加到已经在其基类中定义了 "
"``weakref_slot=True`` 的数据类的 ``__slots__`` 中。这会导致在创建新类时引发 ``TypeError``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4089
msgid ""
":gh:`79579`: :mod:`sqlite3` now correctly detects DML queries with leading "
"comments. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`79579`: :mod:`sqlite3` 现在能正确检测带有前导注释的 DML 查询。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4092
msgid ""
":gh:`93421`: Update :data:`sqlite3.Cursor.rowcount` when a DML statement has"
" run to completion. This fixes the row count for SQL queries like ``UPDATE "
"... RETURNING``. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93421`: 当 DML 语句运行完成时更新 :data:`sqlite3.Cursor.rowcount`。这修复了像 ``UPDATE "
"... RETURNING`` 这样的 SQL 查询的行计数。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4096
msgid ""
":gh:`91162`: Support splitting of unpacked arbitrary-length tuple over "
"``TypeVar`` and ``TypeVarTuple`` parameters. For example:"
msgstr ":gh:`91162`: 支持在 ``TypeVar`` 和 ``TypeVarTuple`` 参数上解包任意长度的元组拆分。例如："

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4099
msgid "``A[T, *Ts][*tuple[int, ...]]`` -> ``A[int, *tuple[int, ...]]``"
msgstr "``A[T, *Ts][*tuple[int, ...]]`` -> ``A[int, *tuple[int, ...]]``"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4100
msgid "``A[*Ts, T][*tuple[int, ...]]`` -> ``A[*tuple[int, ...], int]``"
msgstr "``A[*Ts, T][*tuple[int, ...]]`` -> ``A[*tuple[int, ...], int]``"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4102
msgid ""
":gh:`93353`: Fix the :func:`importlib.resources.as_file` context manager to "
"remove the temporary file if destroyed late during Python finalization: keep"
" a local reference to the :func:`os.remove` function. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93353`: 修复 :func:`importlib.resources.as_file` "
"上下文管理器，在Python最终化过程中如果被延迟销毁则删除临时文件：保留对 :func:`os.remove` 函数的本地引用。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4107
msgid ""
":gh:`83658`: Make :class:`multiprocessing.Pool` raise an exception if "
"``maxtasksperchild`` is not ``None`` or a positive int."
msgstr ""
":gh:`83658`: 如果 ``maxtasksperchild`` 不是 ``None`` 或正整数，则使 "
":class:`multiprocessing.Pool` 抛出异常。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4110
msgid ""
":gh:`93156`: Accessing the :attr:`pathlib.PurePath.parents` sequence of an "
"absolute path using negative index values produced incorrect results."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93156`: 使用负索引值访问绝对路径的 :attr:`pathlib.PurePath.parents` 序列会产生不正确的结果。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4113
msgid ""
":gh:`74696`: :func:`shutil.make_archive` no longer temporarily changes the "
"current working directory during creation of standard ``.zip`` or tar "
"archives."
msgstr ""
":gh:`74696`: :func:`shutil.make_archive` 在创建标准 ``.zip`` 或 tar "
"归档文件时不再临时更改当前工作目录。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4117
msgid ""
":gh:`89973`: Fix :exc:`re.error` raised in :mod:`fnmatch` if the pattern "
"contains a character range with upper bound lower than lower bound (e.g. "
"``[c-a]``). Now such ranges are interpreted as empty ranges."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89973`: 修复了如果在模式中包含上限低于下限的字符范围（例如 ``[c-a]``）时 :mod:`fnmatch` 中引发的 "
":exc:`re.error`。现在这样的范围被解释为空范围。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4121
msgid ""
":gh:`92932`: Now :func:`~dis.dis` and :func:`~dis.get_instructions` handle "
"operand values for instructions prefixed by ``EXTENDED_ARG_QUICK``. Patch by"
" Sam Gross and Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92932`: 现在 :func:`~dis.dis` 和 :func:`~dis.get_instructions` 处理以 "
"``EXTENDED_ARG_QUICK`` 为前缀的指令的操作数值。补丁由 Sam Gross 和 Donghee Na 提交。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4125
msgid ""
":gh:`91577`: Move imports in :class:`~multiprocessing.SharedMemory` methods "
"to module level so that they can be executed late in python finalization."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91577`: 将 :class:`~multiprocessing.SharedMemory` "
"方法中的导入移动到模块级别，以便它们可以在Python终止的后期执行。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4128
msgid ""
":gh:`91456`: Deprecate current default auto() behavior:  In 3.13 the default"
" will be for for auto() to always return the largest member value "
"incremented by 1, and to raise if incompatible value types are used."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91456`: "
"弃用当前的默认auto()行为：在3.13版本中，auto()的默认行为将始终返回最大成员值加1，并在使用不兼容的值类型时引发错误。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4132
msgid ""
":issue:`47231`: Fixed an issue with inconsistent trailing slashes in tarfile"
" longname directories."
msgstr ":issue:`47231`: 修复了tarfile长名字目录中不一致的尾部斜杠问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4135
msgid ""
":issue:`46755`: In :class:`QueueHandler`, clear ``stack_info`` from "
":class:`LogRecord` to prevent stack trace from being written twice."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46755`: 在 :class:`QueueHandler` 中，清除 :class:`LogRecord` 中的 "
"``stack_info`` 以防止堆栈跟踪被写入两次。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4138
msgid ""
":issue:`46197`: Fix :mod:`ensurepip` environment isolation for subprocess "
"running ``pip``."
msgstr ":issue:`46197`: 修复了 :mod:`ensurepip` 对运行 ``pip`` 的子进程的环境隔离。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4141
msgid ""
":issue:`45924`: Fix :mod:`asyncio` incorrect traceback when future's "
"exception is raised multiple times. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45924`: 修复了 :mod:`asyncio` 在多次引发 future 的异常时的错误回溯。由 Kumar Aditya "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4144
msgid ""
":issue:`34828`: :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.iterdump` now handles databases "
"that use ``AUTOINCREMENT`` in one or more tables."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34828`: :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.iterdump` 现在可以处理在一个或多个表中使用 "
"``AUTOINCREMENT`` 的数据库。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4150
msgid ""
":gh:`94321`: Document the :pep:`246` style protocol type "
":class:`sqlite3.PrepareProtocol`."
msgstr ":gh:`94321`: 文档化 :pep:`246` 风格的协议类型 :class:`sqlite3.PrepareProtocol`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4153
msgid ""
":gh:`61162`: Clarify :mod:`sqlite3` behavior when :ref:`sqlite3-connection-"
"context-manager`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`61162`: 澄清 :mod:`sqlite3` 在 :ref:`sqlite3-connection-context-manager` "
"时的行为。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4156
msgid ""
":gh:`87260`: Align :mod:`sqlite3` argument specs with the actual "
"implementation."
msgstr ":gh:`87260`: 将 :mod:`sqlite3` 的参数规范与实际实现对齐。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4159
msgid ""
":gh:`86986`: The minimum Sphinx version required to build the documentation "
"is now 3.2."
msgstr ":gh:`86986`: 构建文档所需的最低 Sphinx 版本现在是 3.2。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4162
msgid ""
":gh:`88831`: Augmented documentation of asyncio.create_task(). Clarified the"
" need to keep strong references to tasks and added a code snippet detailing "
"how to to this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4166
msgid ""
":issue:`47161`: Document that :class:`pathlib.PurePath` does not collapse "
"initial double slashes because they denote UNC paths."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47161`: 文档说明 :class:`pathlib.PurePath` 不会合并开头的双斜杠，因为它们表示 UNC 路径。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4172
msgid ""
":gh:`91330`: Added more tests for :mod:`dataclasses` to cover behavior with "
"data descriptor-based fields."
msgstr ":gh:`91330`: 为 :mod:`dataclasses` 添加了更多测试，以覆盖基于数据描述符的字段的行为。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4175
msgid ""
":gh:`94208`: ``test_ssl`` is now checking for supported TLS version and "
"protocols in more tests."
msgstr ":gh:`94208`: ``test_ssl`` 现在在更多测试中检查支持的 TLS 版本和协议。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4178
msgid ""
":gh:`94315`: Tests now check for DAC override capability instead of relying "
"on :func:`os.geteuid`."
msgstr ":gh:`94315`: 测试现在检查 DAC 覆盖能力，而不是依赖于 :func:`os.geteuid`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4181
msgid ""
":gh:`93951`: In test_bdb.StateTestCase.test_skip, avoid including auxiliary "
"importers."
msgstr ":gh:`93951`: 在 test_bdb.StateTestCase.test_skip 中，避免包括辅助导入器。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4184
msgid ""
":gh:`93957`: Provide nicer error reporting from subprocesses in "
"test_venv.EnsurePipTest.test_with_pip."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93957`: 在 test_venv.EnsurePipTest.test_with_pip 中提供来自子进程的更友好的错误报告。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4187
msgid ""
":gh:`84461`: ``run_tests.py`` now handles cross compiling env vars correctly"
" and pass ``HOSTRUNNER`` to regression tests."
msgstr ""
":gh:`84461`: ``run_tests.py`` 现在正确处理交叉编译环境变量，并将 ``HOSTRUNNER`` 传递给回归测试。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4190
msgid ""
":gh:`93616`: ``test_modulefinder`` now creates a temporary directory in "
"``ModuleFinderTest.setUp()`` instead of module scope."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93616`: ``test_modulefinder`` 现在在 ``ModuleFinderTest.setUp()`` "
"中创建临时目录，而不是在模块范围内。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4193
msgid ""
":gh:`93575`: Fix issue with test_unicode test_raiseMemError. The test case "
"now use ``test.support.calcobjsize`` to calculate size of PyUnicode structs."
