"``test.support.calcobjsize`` 来计算 PyUnicode 结构的大小。:func:`sys.getsizeof` "
"在字符串具有 UTF-8 内存时可能返回不同的大小。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4198
msgid ""
":gh:`90473`: WASI does not have a ``chmod(2)`` syscall. :func:`os.chmod` is "
"now a dummy function on WASI. Skip all tests that depend on working "
":func:`os.chmod`."
