":meth:`calendar.LocaleTextCalendar.formatweekday`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`57539`: 增加 :meth:`calendar.LocaleTextCalendar.formatweekday` 的日历测试覆盖率。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4207
msgid ""
":gh:`90473`: Skip symlink tests on WASI. wasmtime uses ``openat2(2)`` with "
"``RESOLVE_BENEATH`` flag, which prevents symlinks with absolute paths."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90473`: 在 WASI 上跳过符号链接测试。wasmtime 使用 ``openat2(2)`` 和 "
"``RESOLVE_BENEATH`` 标志，这阻止了具有绝对路径的符号链接。"

