#: ../../../build/NEWS:4834
msgid ""
":gh:`90623`: :func:`signal.raise_signal` and :func:`os.kill` now check "
"immediately for pending signals. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90623`: :func:`signal.raise_signal` 和 :func:`os.kill` "
"现在会立即检查挂起的信号。由Victor Stinner提交的补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:4837
