#: ../../../build/NEWS:4884
msgid ""
":gh:`74166`: Add option to raise all errors from "
":meth:`~socket.create_connection` in an :exc:`ExceptionGroup` when it fails "
"to create a connection. The default remains to raise only the last error "
"that had occurred when multiple addresses were tried."
msgstr ""
