":opcode:`CACHE` instruction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5927
msgid ":issue:`45107`: Specialize ``LOAD_METHOD`` for instances with a dict."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5929
msgid ""
":issue:`44337`: Reduce the memory usage of specialized :opcode:`LOAD_ATTR` "
"and :opcode:`STORE_ATTR` instructions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5932
msgid ""
":issue:`46729`: Add number of sub-exceptions to "
":meth:`BaseException.__str__`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5934
msgid ""
":issue:`45885`: Don't un-adapt :opcode:`COMPARE_OP` when collecting "
"specialization stats."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5937
msgid ""
":issue:`46329`: Fix specialization stats gathering for :opcode:`PRECALL` "
"instructions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5940
msgid ":issue:`46794`: Bump up the libexpat version into 2.4.6"
msgstr ":issue:`46794`: 将 libexpat 版本提升至 2.4.6。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5942
msgid ""
":issue:`46823`: Implement a specialized combined opcode "
"``LOAD_FAST__LOAD_ATTR_INSTANCE_VALUE``.  Patch by Dennis Sweeney."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46823`: 实现一个专门的组合操作码 ``LOAD_FAST__LOAD_ATTR_INSTANCE_VALUE``。由 "
"Dennis Sweeney 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5945
msgid ""
":issue:`46820`: Fix parsing a numeric literal immediately (without spaces) "
"followed by \"not in\" keywords, like in ``1not in x``. Now the parser only "
"emits a warning, not a syntax error."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46820`: 修复在数字字面量后紧跟着（无空格）\"not in\" 关键字时的解析问题，例如 ``1not in "
"x``。现在解析器仅发出警告，而非语法错误。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5949
msgid ""
":issue:`46329`: Move ``KW_NAMES`` before ``PRECALL`` instruction in call "
"sequence. Change ``operand`` of ``CALL`` to match ``PRECALL`` for easier "
"specialization."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46329`: 在调用序列中将 ``KW_NAMES`` 移动到 ``PRECALL`` 指令之前。更改 ``CALL`` 的 "
"``operand`` 以匹配 ``PRECALL``，便于专门化。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5953
msgid ""
":issue:`46808`: Remove the ``NEXT_BLOCK`` macro from compile.c, and make the"
" compiler automatically generate implicit blocks when they are needed."
msgstr ":issue:`46808`: 从 compile.c 中移除 ``NEXT_BLOCK`` 宏，并使编译器在需要时自动生成隐式块。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5956
msgid ""
":issue:`46329`: Add ``PUSH_NULL`` instruction. This is used as a prefix when"
" evaluating a callable, so that the stack has the same shape for methods and"
" other calls. ``PRECALL_FUNCTION`` and ``PRECALL_METHOD`` are merged into a "
"single ``PRECALL`` instruction."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46329`: 添加 ``PUSH_NULL`` "
"指令。这在评估可调用对象时用作前缀，以便堆栈对于方法和其他调用具有相同的形状。``PRECALL_FUNCTION`` 和 "
"``PRECALL_METHOD`` 被合并为单一的 ``PRECALL`` 指令。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5961 ../../../build/NEWS:6344
msgid "There is no change in semantics."
msgstr "语义上没有变化。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5963
msgid ""
":issue:`46762`: Fix an assert failure in debug builds when a '<', '>', or "
"'=' is the last character in an f-string that's missing a closing right "
"brace."
msgstr ":issue:`46762`: 修复在调试版本中，当 '<'、'>' 或 '=' 是 f 字符串中缺失右大括号的最后一个字符时的断言失败。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5966
msgid ""
":issue:`46730`: Message of AttributeError caused by getting, setting or "
"deleting a property without the corresponding function now mentions that the"
" attribute is in fact a property and also specifies type of the class that "
"it belongs to."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46730`: 由于获取、设置或删除没有相应函数的属性而导致的 AttributeError "
"消息现在会提到该属性实际上是一个属性，并且还指定了它所属的类的类型。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5971
msgid ""
":issue:`46724`: Make sure that all backwards jumps use the ``JUMP_ABSOLUTE``"
" instruction, rather than ``JUMP_FORWARD`` with an argument of "
"``(2**32)+offset``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46724`: 确保所有向后跳转都使用 ``JUMP_ABSOLUTE`` 指令，而不是使用参数为 ``(2**32)+offset``"
" 的 ``JUMP_FORWARD``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5975
msgid ""
":issue:`46732`: Correct the docstring for the :meth:`~object.__bool__` "
"method. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46732`: 更正 :meth:`~object.__bool__` 方法的文档字符串。补丁由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5978
msgid ""
":issue:`46072`: Add more detailed specialization failure statistics for "
":opcode:`BINARY_OP`."
msgstr ":issue:`46072`: 为 :opcode:`BINARY_OP` 添加更详细的特化失败统计信息。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5981
msgid ""
":issue:`46707`: Avoid potential exponential backtracking when producing some"
" syntax errors involving lots of brackets. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`46707`: 避免在产生涉及大量括号的某些语法错误时可能出现的指数级回溯。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5984
msgid ""
":issue:`46323`: :mod:`ctypes` now allocates memory on the stack instead of "
"on the heap to pass arguments while calling a Python callback function. "
"Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46323`: :mod:`ctypes` 现在在调用 Python 回调函数时在栈上而非堆上分配内存以传递参数。由 Donghee "
"Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5988
msgid ""
":issue:`45923`: Add a quickened form of :opcode:`RESUME` that skips "
"quickening checks."
msgstr ":issue:`45923`: 添加一种跳过快速检查的 :opcode:`RESUME` 快速形式。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5991
msgid ""
":issue:`46702`: Specialize :opcode:`UNPACK_SEQUENCE` for :class:`tuple` and "
":class:`list` unpackings."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46702`: 为 :class:`tuple` 和 :class:`list` 解包特化 "
":opcode:`UNPACK_SEQUENCE`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5994
msgid ""
":issue:`46072`: Opcode pair stats are now gathered with ``--enable-"
"pystats``. Defining ``DYNAMIC_EXECUTION_PROFILE`` or  ``DXPAIRS`` no longer "
"has any effect."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46072`: 现在使用 ``--enable-pystats`` 收集操作码对统计信息。定义 "
"``DYNAMIC_EXECUTION_PROFILE`` 或 ``DXPAIRS`` 不再有任何效果。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:5998
msgid ""
":issue:`46675`: Allow more than 16 items in a split dict before it is "
"combined. The limit is now 254."
msgstr ":issue:`46675`: 允许拆分字典在合并前包含超过 16 个项目。现在限制为 254 个。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6001
msgid ""
":issue:`40479`: Add a missing call to ``va_end()`` in "
"``Modules/_hashopenssl.c``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40479`: 在 ``Modules/_hashopenssl.c`` 中添加一个遗漏的 ``va_end()`` 调用。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6004
msgid ""
":issue:`46323`: Use :c:func:`PyObject_Vectorcall` while calling ctypes "
"callback function. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46323`: 调用 ctypes 回调函数时使用 :c:func:`PyObject_Vectorcall`。由 Donghee Na"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6007
msgid ""
":issue:`46615`: When iterating over sets internally in ``setobject.c``, "
"acquire strong references to the resulting items from the set.  This "
"prevents crashes in corner-cases of various set operations where the set "
"gets mutated."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46615`: 在 ``setobject.c`` "
"中内部迭代集合时，对集合中的结果项获取强引用。这防止了在各种集合操作的边角情况下集合被修改导致的崩溃。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6012
msgid ""
":issue:`45828`: The bytecode compiler now attempts to apply runtime stack "
"manipulations at compile-time (whenever it is feasible to do so)."
msgstr ":issue:`45828`: 字节码编译器现在尝试在编译时应用运行时栈操作（只要这样做是可行的）。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6015
msgid ""
":issue:`30496`: Fixed a minor portability issue in the implementation of "
":c:func:`PyLong_FromLong`, and added a fast path for single-digit integers "
"to :c:func:`PyLong_FromLongLong`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30496`: 修复了 :c:func:`PyLong_FromLong` 实现中的一个小的可移植性问题，并为 "
":c:func:`PyLong_FromLongLong` 添加了单数字整数的快速路径。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6022
msgid ""
":issue:`25707`: Fixed a file leak in :func:`xml.etree.ElementTree.iterparse`"
" when the iterator is not exhausted. Patch by Jacob Walls."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25707`: 修复了 :func:`xml.etree.ElementTree.iterparse` "
"中当迭代器未被耗尽时的文件泄露问题。由 Jacob Walls 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6025
msgid ""
":issue:`46877`: Export :func:`unittest.doModuleCleanups` in :mod:`unittest`."
" Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46877`: 在 :mod:`unittest` 中导出 :func:`unittest.doModuleCleanups`。由 "
"Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6028
msgid ""
":issue:`46848`: For performance, use the optimized string-searching "
"implementations from :meth:`~bytes.find` and :meth:`~bytes.rfind` for "
":meth:`~mmap.find` and :meth:`~mmap.rfind`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46848`: 出于性能考虑，使用来自 :meth:`~bytes.find` 和 :meth:`~bytes.rfind` "
"的优化字符串搜索实现替代 :meth:`~mmap.find` 和 :meth:`~mmap.rfind`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6032
msgid ""
":issue:`46736`: :class:`~http.server.SimpleHTTPRequestHandler` now uses "
"HTML5 grammar. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46736`: :class:`~http.server.SimpleHTTPRequestHandler` 现在使用 HTML5 "
"语法。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6035
msgid ""
":issue:`44886`: Inherit asyncio proactor datagram transport from "
":class:`asyncio.DatagramTransport`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44886`: 将 asyncio proactor 数据报传输继承自 "
":class:`asyncio.DatagramTransport`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6038
msgid ""
":issue:`46827`: Support UDP sockets in  :meth:`asyncio.loop.sock_connect` "
"for selector-based event loops.  Patch by Thomas Grainger."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46827`: 在基于选择器的事件循环中支持 :meth:`asyncio.loop.sock_connect` 的 UDP 套接字。由"
" Thomas Grainger 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6041
msgid ":issue:`46811`: Make test suite support Expat >=2.4.5"
msgstr ":issue:`46811`: 使测试套件支持 Expat >=2.4.5。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6043
msgid ""
":issue:`46252`: Raise :exc:`TypeError` if :class:`ssl.SSLSocket` is passed "
"to transport-based APIs."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46252`: 如果 :class:`ssl.SSLSocket` 被传递给基于传输的 API，则抛出 "
":exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6046
msgid ""
":issue:`46784`: Fix libexpat symbols collisions with user dynamically loaded"
" or statically linked libexpat in embedded Python."
msgstr ":issue:`46784`: 修复了在嵌入式 Python 中与用户动态加载或静态链接的 libexpat 库的符号冲突。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6049
msgid ""
":issue:`46786`: The HTML serialisation in xml.etree.ElementTree now writes "
"``embed``, ``source``, ``track`` and ``wbr`` as empty tags, as defined in "
"HTML 5."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46786`: xml.etree.ElementTree 中的 HTML 序列化现在将 "
"``embed``、``source``、``track`` 和 ``wbr`` 写为空标签，符合 HTML5 的定义。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6053
msgid ""
":issue:`39327`: :func:`shutil.rmtree` can now work with VirtualBox shared "
"folders when running from the guest operating-system."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39327`: :func:`shutil.rmtree` 现在可以在客户操作系统中运行时与 VirtualBox 共享文件夹一起工作。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6056
msgid ""
":issue:`45390`: Propagate :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` message from inner "
"task to outer awaiter."
msgstr ":issue:`45390`: 将 :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` 消息从内部任务传播到外部等待者。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6059
msgid ""
":issue:`46756`: Fix a bug in "
":meth:`urllib.request.HTTPPasswordMgr.find_user_password` and "
":meth:`urllib.request.HTTPPasswordMgrWithPriorAuth.is_authenticated` which "
"allowed to bypass authorization. For example, access to URI "
"``example.org/foobar`` was allowed if the user was authorized for URI "
"``example.org/foo``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46756`: 修复了 "
":meth:`urllib.request.HTTPPasswordMgr.find_user_password` 和 "
":meth:`urllib.request.HTTPPasswordMgrWithPriorAuth.is_authenticated` "
"中的一个漏洞，该漏洞允许绕过授权。例如，如果用户被授权访问 URI ``example.org/foo``，则允许访问 URI "
"``example.org/foobar``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6066
msgid ""
":issue:`46737`: :func:`random.gauss` and :func:`random.normalvariate` now "
"have default arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46737`: :func:`random.gauss` 和 :func:`random.normalvariate` 现在有默认参数。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6069
msgid ""
":issue:`46752`: Add task groups to asyncio (structured concurrency, inspired"
" by Trio's nurseries). This also introduces a change to task cancellation, "
"where a cancelled task can't be cancelled again until it calls .uncancel()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46752`: 向 asyncio 添加任务组（结构化并发，灵感来自 Trio 的 "
"nurseries）。这也引入了任务取消的变化，其中被取消的任务在调用 .uncancel() 之前不能被再次取消。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6074
msgid ":issue:`46724`: Fix :mod:`dis` behavior on negative jump offsets."
msgstr ":issue:`46724`: 修复 :mod:`dis` 在负跳转偏移上的行为。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6076
msgid ""
":issue:`46333`: The :meth:`__repr__` method of :class:`typing.ForwardRef` "
"now includes the ``module`` parameter of :class:`typing.ForwardRef` when it "
"is set."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46333`: 当设置 ``module`` 参数时，:class:`typing.ForwardRef` 的 "
":meth:`__repr__` 方法现在会包含 :class:`typing.ForwardRef` 的 ``module`` 参数。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6080
msgid ""
":issue:`46643`: In :func:`typing.get_type_hints`, support evaluating "
"stringified ``ParamSpecArgs`` and ``ParamSpecKwargs`` annotations. Patch by "
"Gregory Beauregard."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46643`: 在 :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 中，支持评估字符串化的 "
"``ParamSpecArgs`` 和 ``ParamSpecKwargs`` 注解。由 Gregory Beauregard 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6084
msgid ""
":issue:`45863`: When the :mod:`tarfile` module creates a pax format archive,"
" it will put an integer representation of timestamps in the ustar header (if"
" possible) for the benefit of older unarchivers, in addition to the existing"
" full-precision timestamps in the pax extended header."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45863`: 当 :mod:`tarfile` 模块创建 pax 格式的存档时，它会在 ustar "
"头中放置时间戳的整数表示（如果可能的话），以便于旧的解档工具使用，此外还会在 pax 扩展头中放置现有的全精度时间戳。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6089
msgid ""
":issue:`46066`: Deprecate kwargs-based syntax for :class:`typing.TypedDict` "
"definitions. It had confusing semantics when specifying totality, and was "
"largely unused. Patch by Jingchen Ye."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46066`: 弃用基于 kwargs 的 :class:`typing.TypedDict` "
"定义语法。在指定完全性时它有着令人困惑的语义，并且很大程度上未被使用。由 Jingchen Ye 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6093
msgid ""
":issue:`46676`: Make :data:`typing.ParamSpec` args and kwargs equal to "
"themselves. Patch by Gregory Beauregard."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46676`: 使 :data:`typing.ParamSpec` 的 args 和 kwargs 等于它们自己。由 Gregory "
"Beauregard 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6096
msgid ""
":issue:`46323`: ``ctypes.CFUNCTYPE()`` and ``ctypes.WINFUNCTYPE()`` now fail"
" to create the type if its ``_argtypes_`` member contains too many "
"arguments. Previously, the error was only raised when calling a function. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46323`: ``ctypes.CFUNCTYPE()`` 和 ``ctypes.WINFUNCTYPE()`` 现在会在其 "
"``_argtypes_`` 成员包含太多参数时创建类型失败。以前，错误仅在调用函数时引发。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6101
msgid ""
":issue:`46672`: Fix ``NameError`` in :func:`asyncio.gather` when initial "
"type check fails."
msgstr ":issue:`46672`: 修复 :func:`asyncio.gather` 中初始类型检查失败时的 ``NameError``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6104
msgid ""
":issue:`46659`: The :class:`calendar.LocaleTextCalendar` and "
":class:`calendar.LocaleHTMLCalendar` classes now use "
":func:`locale.getlocale`, instead of using :func:`locale.getdefaultlocale`, "
"if no locale is specified. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46659`: 如果未指定区域设置，:class:`calendar.LocaleTextCalendar` 和 "
":class:`calendar.LocaleHTMLCalendar` 类现在会使用 :func:`locale.getlocale`，而不是使用 "
":func:`locale.getdefaultlocale`。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6110
msgid ""
":issue:`46659`: The :func:`locale.getdefaultlocale` function is deprecated "
"and will be removed in Python 3.13. Use :func:`locale.setlocale`, "
":func:`locale.getpreferredencoding(False) <locale.getpreferredencoding>` and"
" :func:`locale.getlocale` functions instead.  Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46659`: :func:`locale.getdefaultlocale` 函数已被弃用，并将在 Python 3.13 "
"中移除。请使用 :func:`locale.setlocale`、:func:`locale.getpreferredencoding(False) "
"<locale.getpreferredencoding>` 和 :func:`locale.getlocale` 函数代替。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6115
msgid ""
":issue:`46655`: In :func:`typing.get_type_hints`, support evaluating bare "
"stringified ``TypeAlias`` annotations. Patch by Gregory Beauregard."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46655`: 在 :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 中，支持评估裸字符串化的 ``TypeAlias`` "
"注解。由 Gregory Beauregard 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6118
msgid ""
":issue:`45948`: Fixed a discrepancy in the C implementation of the "
":mod:`xml.etree.ElementTree` module. Now, instantiating an "
":class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.XMLParser` with a ``target=None`` keyword "
"provides a default :class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.TreeBuilder` target as the "
"Python implementation does."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45948`: 修复了 :mod:`xml.etree.ElementTree` 模块 C 实现中的一个不一致之处。现在，实例化 "
":class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.XMLParser` 时使用 ``target=None`` 关键字参数会像 Python "
"实现一样提供一个默认的 :class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.TreeBuilder` 目标。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6124
msgid ""
":issue:`46626`: Expose Linux's ``IP_BIND_ADDRESS_NO_PORT`` option in "
":mod:`socket`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46626`: 在 :mod:`socket` 中公开了 Linux 的 ``IP_BIND_ADDRESS_NO_PORT`` 选项。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6127
msgid ""
":issue:`46521`: Fix a bug in the :mod:`codeop` module that was incorrectly "
"identifying invalid code involving string quotes as valid code."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46521`: 修复了 :mod:`codeop` 模块中的一个 bug，该 bug 错误地将涉及字符串引号的无效代码识别为有效代码。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6130
msgid ":issue:`46571`: Improve :func:`typing.no_type_check`."
msgstr ":issue:`46571`: 改进了 :func:`typing.no_type_check`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6132
msgid ""
"Now it does not modify external classes and functions. We also now correctly"
" mark classmethods as not to be type checked."
msgstr "现在它不会修改外部的类和函数。我们还正确地标记了类方法为不被类型检查。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6135
msgid ":issue:`46400`: expat: Update libexpat from 2.4.1 to 2.4.4"
msgstr ":issue:`46400`: expat: 将 libexpat 从 2.4.1 更新至 2.4.4"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6137
msgid ""
":issue:`46556`: Deprecate undocumented support for using a "
":class:`pathlib.Path` object as a context manager."
msgstr ":issue:`46556`: 弃用将 :class:`pathlib.Path` 对象用作上下文管理器的未文档化支持。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6140
msgid ""
":issue:`46534`: Implement :pep:`673` :class:`typing.Self`. Patch by James "
"Hilton-Balfe."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46534`: 实现了 :pep:`673` :class:`typing.Self`。由 James Hilton-Balfe "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6143
msgid ""
":issue:`46522`: Make various module ``__getattr__`` AttributeErrors more "
"closely match a typical AttributeError"
msgstr ""
":issue:`46522`: 使多个模块的 ``__getattr__`` AttributeErrors 更接近典型的 AttributeError"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6146
msgid ""
":issue:`46475`: Add :data:`typing.Never` and :func:`typing.assert_never`. "
"Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46475`: 添加了 :data:`typing.Never` 和 :func:`typing.assert_never`。由 "
"Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6149
msgid ""
":issue:`46333`: The :meth:`__eq__` and :meth:`__hash__` methods of "
":class:`typing.ForwardRef` now honor the ``module`` parameter of "
":class:`typing.ForwardRef`. Forward references from different modules are "
"now differentiated."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46333`: :class:`typing.ForwardRef` 的 :meth:`__eq__` 和 "
":meth:`__hash__` 方法现在尊重 :class:`typing.ForwardRef` 的 ``module`` "
"参数。现在可以区分来自不同模块的前向引用。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6154
msgid ""
":issue:`46246`: Add missing ``__slots__`` to "
"``importlib.metadata.DeprecatedList``. Patch by Arie Bovenberg."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46246`: 为 ``importlib.metadata.DeprecatedList`` 添加了缺失的 "
"``__slots__``。由 Arie Bovenberg 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6157
msgid ""
":issue:`46232`: The :mod:`ssl` module now handles certificates with bit "
"strings in DN correctly."
msgstr ":issue:`46232`: :mod:`ssl` 模块现在能正确处理 DN 中包含位字符串的证书。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6160
msgid ""
":issue:`46195`: :func:`typing.get_type_hints` no longer adds ``Optional`` to"
" parameters with ``None`` as a default. This aligns to changes to PEP 484 in"
" https://github.com/python/peps/pull/689"
msgstr ""
":issue:`46195`: :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 不再为默认值为 ``None`` 的参数添加 "
"``Optional``。这与 PEP 484 在 https://github.com/python/peps/pull/689 中的更改一致。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6164
msgid ""
":issue:`31369`: Add :class:`~re.RegexFlag` to ``re.__all__`` and documented "
"it. Add :data:`~re.RegexFlag.NOFLAG` to indicate no flags being set."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31369`: 将 :class:`~re.RegexFlag` 添加到 ``re.__all__`` 并进行了文档化。添加 "
":data:`~re.RegexFlag.NOFLAG` 以表示没有设置任何标志。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6167
msgid ""
":issue:`45898`: :mod:`ctypes` no longer defines ``ffi_type_*`` symbols in "
"``cfield.c``. The symbols have been provided by libffi for over a decade."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45898`: :mod:`ctypes` 不再在 ``cfield.c`` 中定义 ``ffi_type_*`` 符号。这些符号由 "
"libffi 提供已有十余年。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6170
msgid ""
":issue:`44953`: Calling ``operator.itemgetter`` objects and "
"``operator.attrgetter`` objects is now faster due to use of the vectorcall "
"calling convention."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44953`: 调用 ``operator.itemgetter`` 对象和 ``operator.attrgetter`` "
"对象现在更快，因为使用了 vectorcall 调用约定。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6174
msgid ""
":issue:`44289`: Fix an issue with :meth:`~tarfile.is_tarfile` method when "
"using *fileobj* argument: position in the *fileobj* was advanced forward "
"which made it unreadable with :meth:`tarfile.TarFile.open`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44289`: 修复了 :meth:`~tarfile.is_tarfile` 方法在使用 *fileobj* "
"参数时的一个问题：*fileobj* 中的位置被向前推进，使得它无法通过 :meth:`tarfile.TarFile.open` 读取。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6178
msgid ""
":issue:`44011`: Reimplement SSL/TLS support in asyncio, borrow the "
"implementation from uvloop library."
msgstr ":issue:`44011`: 在 asyncio 中重新实现 SSL/TLS 支持，借用 uvloop 库的实现。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6181
msgid ""
":issue:`41086`: Make the :class:`configparser.ConfigParser` constructor "
"raise :exc:`TypeError` if the ``interpolation`` parameter is not of type "
":class:`!configparser.Interpolation`"
msgstr ""
":issue:`41086`: 如果 ``interpolation`` 参数不是 "
":class:`!configparser.Interpolation` 类型，:class:`configparser.ConfigParser` "
"构造函数将引发 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6185
msgid ""
":issue:`29418`: Implement :func:`inspect.ismethodwrapper` and fix "
":func:`inspect.isroutine` for cases where methodwrapper is given. Patch by "
"Hakan Çelik."
msgstr ""
":issue:`29418`: 实现 :func:`inspect.ismethodwrapper` 并修复 "
":func:`inspect.isroutine` 对于给定 methodwrapper 的情况。由 Hakan Çelik 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6189
msgid ""
":issue:`14156`: argparse.FileType now supports an argument of '-' in binary "
"mode, returning the .buffer attribute of sys.stdin/sys.stdout as "
"appropriate. Modes including 'x' and 'a' are treated equivalently to 'w' "
"when argument is '-'. Patch contributed by Josh Rosenberg"
msgstr ""
":issue:`14156`: argparse.FileType 现在支持二进制模式下的 '-' 参数，根据情况返回 "
"sys.stdin/sys.stdout 的 .buffer 属性。当参数为 '-' 时，包含 'x' 和 'a' 的模式被视为等同于 'w'。补丁由 "
"Josh Rosenberg 贡献"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6197
msgid ""
":issue:`42238`: ``Doc/tools/rstlint.py`` has moved to its own repository and"
" is now packaged on PyPI as ``sphinx-lint``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42238`: ``Doc/tools/rstlint.py`` 已移至其自己的仓库，现在在 PyPI 上打包为 ``sphinx-"
"lint``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6203
msgid ""
":issue:`46913`: Fix test_faulthandler.test_sigfpe() if Python is built with "
"undefined behavior sanitizer (UBSAN): disable UBSAN on the "
"faulthandler_sigfpe() function. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46913`: 如果 Python 是用未定义行为消毒剂 (UBSAN) 构建的，修复 "
"test_faulthandler.test_sigfpe()：在 faulthandler_sigfpe() 函数上禁用 UBSAN。由 Victor"
" Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6207
msgid ""
":issue:`46760`: Remove bytecode offsets from expected values in "
"test.test_dis module. Reduces the obstacles to modifying the VM or compiler."
msgstr ":issue:`46760`: 从 test.test_dis 模块中的期望值中移除字节码偏移。减少修改虚拟机或编译器的障碍。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6210
msgid ""
":issue:`46708`: Prevent default asyncio event loop policy modification "
"warning after ``test_asyncio`` execution."
msgstr ":issue:`46708`: 防止 ``test_asyncio`` 执行后默认 asyncio 事件循环策略修改警告。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6213
msgid ""
":issue:`46678`: The function ``make_legacy_pyc`` in "
"``Lib/test/support/import_helper.py`` no longer fails when "
"``PYTHONPYCACHEPREFIX`` is set to a directory on a different device from "
"where tempfiles are stored."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46678`: ``Lib/test/support/import_helper.py`` 中的函数 "
"``make_legacy_pyc`` 不再在 ``PYTHONPYCACHEPREFIX`` 设置为与存储临时文件不同的设备上的目录时失败。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6218
msgid ""
":issue:`46623`: Skip test_pair() and test_speech128() of test_zlib on s390x "
"since they fail if zlib uses the s390x hardware accelerator. Patch by Victor"
" Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46623`: "
"在s390x上跳过test_zlib的test_pair()和test_speech128()测试，因为如果zlib使用s390x硬件加速器，这些测试会失败。由Victor"
" Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6225
msgid ""
":issue:`46860`: Respect ``--with-suffix`` when building on case-insensitive "
"file systems."
msgstr ":issue:`46860`: 在大小写不敏感的文件系统上构建时，尊重 ``--with-suffix`` 选项。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6228
msgid ""
":issue:`46656`: Building Python now requires a C11 compiler. Optional C11 "
"features are not required. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ":issue:`46656`: 现在构建Python需要一个C11编译器。不需要可选C11功能。补丁由Victor Stinner提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6231
msgid ""
":issue:`46656`: Building Python now requires support for floating point Not-"
"a-Number (NaN): remove the ``Py_NO_NAN`` macro. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6235
msgid ""
":issue:`46640`: Building Python now requires a C99 ``<math.h>`` header file "
"providing a ``NAN`` constant, or the ``__builtin_nan()`` built-in function. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46640`: 现在构建Python需要一个提供 ``NAN`` 常量的C99 ``<math.h>`` "
"头文件，或者``__builtin_nan()``内置函数。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6239
msgid ""
":issue:`46608`: Exclude marshalled-frozen data if deep-freezing to save 300 "
"KB disk space. This includes adding a new ``is_package`` field to "
":c:struct:`_frozen`. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46608`: 如果深度冻结，排除已封装的冻结数据以节省300 KB磁盘空间。这包括向 :c:struct:`_frozen` "
"添加一个新的 ``is_package`` 字段。由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6243
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: Fix wasm32-emscripten test failures and platform issues. - "
"Disable syscalls that are not supported or don't work, e.g.   wait, "
"getrusage, prlimit, mkfifo, mknod, setres[gu]id, setgroups. - Use fd_count "
"to cound open fds. - Add more checks for subprocess and fork. - Add "
"workarounds for missing _multiprocessing and failing socket.accept(). - "
"Enable bzip2. - Disable large file support. - Disable signal.alarm."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6250
msgid ""
":issue:`46430`: Intern strings in deep-frozen modules. Patch by Kumar "
"Aditya."
msgstr ":issue:`46430`: 在深度冻结的模块中内部化字符串。由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6255
msgid ""
":issue:`46744`: The default all users install directory for ARM64 is now "
"under the native ``Program Files`` folder, rather than ``Program Files "
"(Arm)`` which is intended for ARM (32-bit) files."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46744`: ARM64的默认所有用户安装目录现在位于原生的 ``Program Files`` "
"文件夹下，而不是用于ARM（32位）文件的 ``Program Files (Arm)``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6259
msgid ""
":issue:`46567`: Adds Tcl and Tk support for Windows ARM64. This also adds "
"IDLE to the installation."
msgstr ":issue:`46567`: 为Windows ARM64添加Tcl和Tk支持。这也将IDLE添加到安装中。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6262
msgid ""
":issue:`46638`: Ensures registry virtualization is consistently disabled. "
"For 3.10 and earlier, it remains enabled (some registry writes are "
"protected), while for 3.11 and later it is disabled (registry modifications "
"affect all applications)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46638`: "
"确保注册表虚拟化一致禁用。对于3.10及更早版本，它保持启用（某些注册表写入受到保护），而对于3.11及更高版本，它被禁用（注册表修改影响所有应用程序）。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6270
msgid ""
":issue:`46630`: Make query dialogs on Windows start with a cursor in the "
"entry box."
msgstr ":issue:`46630`: 使 Windows 上的查询对话框开始时光标在输入框中。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6273
msgid ""
":issue:`45447`: Apply IDLE syntax highlighting to ``.pyi`` files. Patch by "
"Alex Waygood and Terry Jan Reedy."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45447`: 将 IDLE 语法高亮应用到 ``.pyi`` 文件。由 Alex Waygood 和 Terry Jan Reedy "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6279
msgid ""
":issue:`46748`: Python's public headers no longer import ``<stdbool.h>``, "
"leaving code that embedd/extends Python free to define ``bool``, ``true`` "
"and ``false``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6283
msgid ""
":issue:`46836`: Move the :c:type:`PyFrameObject` type definition (``struct "
"_frame``) to the internal C API ``pycore_frame.h`` header file. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46836`: 将 :c:type:`PyFrameObject` 类型定义（``struct _frame``）移动到内部 C API"
" ``pycore_frame.h`` 头文件中。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6287
msgid ""
":issue:`45459`: Rename ``Include/buffer.h`` header file to "
"``Include/pybuffer.h`` to avoid conflits with projects having an existing "
"``buffer.h`` header file. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6291
msgid ""
":issue:`45412`: Remove the ``HAVE_PY_SET_53BIT_PRECISION`` macro (moved to "
"the internal C API). Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45412`: 移除 ``HAVE_PY_SET_53BIT_PRECISION`` 宏（已移至内部 C API）。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6294
msgid ""
":issue:`46613`: Added function :c:func:`PyType_GetModuleByDef`, which allows"
" accesss to module state when a method's defining class is not available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6299
msgid "Python 3.11.0 alpha 5"
msgstr "Python 3.11.0 第 5 个 alpha 版本"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6301
msgid "*Release date: 2022-02-03*"
msgstr "*发布日期：2022-02-03*"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6306
msgid ""
":issue:`45773`: Remove two invalid \"peephole\" optimizations from the "
"bytecode compiler."
msgstr ":issue:`45773`: 从字节码编译器中移除两个无效的 \"peephole\" 优化。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6309
msgid ""
":issue:`46564`: Do not create frame objects when creating :class:`super` "
"object. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":issue:`46564`: 创建 :class:`super` 对象时不创建帧对象。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6312
msgid ""
":issue:`45885`: Added more fined-grained specialization failure stats "
"regarding the ``COMPARE_OP`` bytecode."
msgstr ":issue:`45885`: 关于 ``COMPARE_OP`` 字节码，添加了更细粒度的特化失败统计。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6315
msgid ""
":issue:`44977`: The delegation of :func:`int` to :meth:`__trunc__` is now "
"deprecated. Calling ``int(a)`` when ``type(a)`` implements :meth:`__trunc__`"
" but not :meth:`__int__` or :meth:`__index__` now raises a "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44977`: :func:`int` 委托给 :meth:`__trunc__` 的做法现在已被弃用。当 ``type(a)`` "
"实现了 :meth:`__trunc__` 但没有实现 :meth:`__int__` 或 :meth:`__index__` 时，调用 "
"``int(a)`` 现在会引发 :exc:`DeprecationWarning`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6320
msgid ""
":issue:`46458`: Reorder code emitted by the compiler for a "
":keyword:`try`-:keyword:`except` block so that the :keyword:`else` block's "
"code immediately follows the :keyword:`try` body (without a jump). This is "
"more optimal for the happy path."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46458`: 重新排序编译器为 :keyword:`try`-:keyword:`except` 块生成的代码，使得 "
":keyword:`else` 块的代码紧随 :keyword:`try` 体之后（无需跳转）。这对快乐路径更优。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6325
msgid ""
":issue:`46527`: Allow passing ``iterable`` as a keyword argument to "
":func:`enumerate` again. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46527`: 再次允许将 ``iterable`` 作为关键字参数传递给 :func:`enumerate`。由 Jelle "
"Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6328
msgid ""
":issue:`46528`: Replace several stack manipulation instructions "
"(``DUP_TOP``, ``DUP_TOP_TWO``, ``ROT_TWO``, ``ROT_THREE``, ``ROT_FOUR``, and"
" ``ROT_N``) with new :opcode:`COPY` and :opcode:`SWAP` instructions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46528`: 用新的 :opcode:`COPY` 和 :opcode:`SWAP` "
"指令替换多个堆栈操作指令（``DUP_TOP``、``DUP_TOP_TWO``、``ROT_TWO``、``ROT_THREE``、``ROT_FOUR``"
" 和 ``ROT_N``）。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6332
msgid ":issue:`46329`: Use two or three bytecodes to implement most calls."
msgstr ":issue:`46329`: 使用两个或三个字节码来实现大多数调用。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6334
msgid ""
"Calls without named arguments are implemented as a sequence of two "
"instructions: ``PRECALL; CALL``. Calls with named arguments are implemented "
"as a sequence of three instructions: ``PRECALL; KW_NAMES; CALL``. There are "
"two different ``PRECALL`` instructions: ``PRECALL_FUNTION`` and "
"``PRECALL_METHOD``. The latter pairs with ``LOAD_METHOD``."
msgstr ""
"没有命名参数的调用作为两个指令的序列实现：``PRECALL; CALL``。有命名参数的调用作为三个指令的序列实现：``PRECALL; "
"KW_NAMES; CALL``。有两种不同的 ``PRECALL`` 指令：``PRECALL_FUNTION`` 和 "
"``PRECALL_METHOD``。后者与 ``LOAD_METHOD`` 配对使用。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6341
msgid ""
"This partition into pre-call and call allows better specialization, and thus"
" better performance ultimately."
msgstr "这种将调用分为预调用和调用的分区允许更好的专门化，从而最终获得更好的性能。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6346
msgid ""
":issue:`46503`: Fix an assert when parsing some invalid \\N escape sequences"
" in f-strings."
msgstr ":issue:`46503`: 修复在解析 f-strings 中一些无效的 \\N 转义序列时的断言。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6349
msgid ""
":issue:`46431`: Improve error message on invalid calls to "
":meth:`BaseExceptionGroup.__new__`."
msgstr ":issue:`46431`: 改进对无效调用 :meth:`BaseExceptionGroup.__new__` 时的错误消息。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6352
msgid ""
":issue:`46476`: Fix memory leak in code objects generated by deepfreeze. "
"Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":issue:`46476`: 修复由 deepfreeze 生成的代码对象中的内存泄漏。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6355
msgid ""
":issue:`46481`: Speed up calls to :meth:`weakref.ref.__call__` by using the "
":pep:`590` ``vectorcall`` calling convention. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46481`: 通过使用 :pep:`590` ``vectorcall`` 调用约定加速对 "
":meth:`weakref.ref.__call__` 的调用。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6358
msgid ""
":issue:`46417`: Fix a race condition on setting a type ``__bases__`` "
"attribute: the internal function ``add_subclass()`` now gets the "
"``PyTypeObject.tp_subclasses`` member after calling "
":c:func:`PyWeakref_NewRef` which can trigger a garbage collection which can "
"indirectly modify ``PyTypeObject.tp_subclasses``. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46417`: 修复设置类型 ``__bases__`` 属性时的竞争条件：内部函数 ``add_subclass()`` 现在在调用 "
":c:func:`PyWeakref_NewRef` 后获取 ``PyTypeObject.tp_subclasses`` "
"成员，这可以触发垃圾回收，间接修改 ``PyTypeObject.tp_subclasses``。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6365
msgid ""
":issue:`46417`: ``python -X showrefcount`` now shows the total reference "
"count after clearing and destroyed the main Python interpreter. Previously, "
"it was shown before. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46417`: ``python -X showrefcount`` 现在在清除并销毁主 Python "
"解释器后显示总引用计数。之前是在之前显示的。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6369
msgid ""
":issue:`43683`: Add ASYNC_GEN_WRAP opcode to wrap the value to be yielded in"
" async generators. Removes the need to special case async generators in the "
"``YIELD_VALUE`` instruction."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43683`: 添加 ASYNC_GEN_WRAP 操作码来包装异步生成器中要产生的值。移除了在 ``YIELD_VALUE`` "
"指令中特殊处理异步生成器的需要。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6373
msgid ""
":issue:`46407`: Optimize some modulo operations in ``Objects/longobject.c``."
" Patch by Jeremiah Vivian."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46407`: 优化 ``Objects/longobject.c`` 中的一些模运算。补丁由 Jeremiah Vivian 提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6376
msgid ""
":issue:`46409`: Add new ``RETURN_GENERATOR`` bytecode to make generators. "
"Simplifies calling Python functions in the VM, as they no longer any need to"
" special case generator functions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46409`: 添加新的 ``RETURN_GENERATOR`` "
"字节码以生成器。简化了在虚拟机中调用Python函数的过程，因为它们不再需要特别处理生成器函数。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6380
msgid ""
"Also add ``JUMP_NO_INTERRUPT`` bytecode that acts like ``JUMP_ABSOLUTE``, "
"but does not check for interrupts."
msgstr "同时添加 ``JUMP_NO_INTERRUPT`` 字节码，其行为类似于 ``JUMP_ABSOLUTE``，但不检查中断。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6383
msgid ""
":issue:`46406`: The integer division ``//`` implementation has been "
"optimized to better let the compiler understand its constraints. It can be "
"20% faster on the amd64 platform when dividing an int by a value smaller "
"than ``2**30``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46406`: 整数除法 ``//`` 的实现已优化，以便编译器更好地理解其约束。在amd64平台上，当除以小于 ``2**30`` "
"的值时，速度可以提高20%。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6388
msgid ""
":issue:`46383`: Fix invalid signature of ``_zoneinfo``'s ``module_free`` "
"function to resolve a crash on wasm32-emscripten platform."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46383`: 修复 ``_zoneinfo`` 的 ``module_free`` "
"函数的无效签名，以解决wasm32-emscripten平台上的崩溃问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6391
msgid ""
":issue:`46361`: Ensure that \"small\" integers created by "
":meth:`int.from_bytes` and :class:`decimal.Decimal` are properly cached."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46361`: 确保通过 :meth:`int.from_bytes` 和 :class:`decimal.Decimal` "
"创建的“小”整数被正确缓存。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6394
msgid ""
":issue:`46161`: Fix the class building error when the arguments are "
"constants and CALL_FUNCTION_EX is used."
msgstr ":issue:`46161`: 修复当参数为常量且使用 CALL_FUNCTION_EX 时的类构建错误。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6397
msgid ""
":issue:`46028`: Fixes calculation of :data:`sys._base_executable` when "
"inside a virtual environment that uses symlinks with different binary names "
"than the base environment provides."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46028`: 修复在虚拟环境中使用与基础环境提供的不同二进制名称的符号链接时 :data:`sys._base_executable`"
" 的计算。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6401
msgid ""
":issue:`46091`: Correctly calculate indentation levels for lines with "
"whitespace character that are ended by line continuation characters. Patch "
"by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`46091`: 正确计算以行继续字符结尾的带有空白字符的行的缩进级别。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6405
msgid ":issue:`30512`: Add CAN Socket support for NetBSD."
msgstr ":issue:`30512`: 为NetBSD添加CAN Socket支持。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6409
msgid ""
":issue:`44024`: Improve the :exc:`TypeError` message for non-string second "
"arguments passed to the built-in functions :func:`getattr` and "
":func:`hasattr`. Patch by Géry Ogam."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44024`: 改进内置函数 :func:`getattr` 和 :func:`hasattr` 传递非字符串第二个参数时的 "
":exc:`TypeError` 消息。由Géry Ogam提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6416
msgid ""
":issue:`46624`: Restore support for non-integer arguments of "
":func:`random.randrange` and :func:`random.randint`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46624`: 恢复对 :func:`random.randrange` 和 :func:`random.randint` "
"非整数参数的支持。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6419
msgid ""
