msgstr ""
":issue:`46510`: 添加 :class:`types.TracebackType` 和 :class:`types.FrameType` "
"的缺失测试。直接从捕获的异常中计算它们，而不调用 :func:`sys.exc_info`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6448
msgid ""
":issue:`46491`: Allow :data:`typing.Annotated` to wrap :data:`typing.Final` "
"and :data:`typing.ClassVar`. Patch by Gregory Beauregard."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46491`: 允许 :data:`typing.Annotated` 包装 :data:`typing.Final` 和 "
":data:`typing.ClassVar`。由 Gregory Beauregard 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6451
msgid ""
":issue:`46483`: Remove :meth:`~object.__class_getitem__` from "
":class:`pathlib.PurePath` as this class was not supposed to be generic."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46483`: 从 :class:`pathlib.PurePath` 中移除 "
":meth:`~object.__class_getitem__`，因为该类不应是泛型的。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6454
msgid ""
":issue:`46436`: Fix command-line option ``-d``/``--directory`` in module "
":mod:`http.server` which is ignored when combined with command-line option "
"``--cgi``. Patch by Géry Ogam."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46436`: 修复模块 :mod:`http.server` 中的命令行选项 "
"``-d``/``--directory``，当与命令行选项 ``--cgi`` 结合使用时被忽略的问题。由 Géry Ogam 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6458
msgid ""
":issue:`41403`: Make :meth:`mock.patch` raise a :exc:`TypeError` with a "
"relevant error message on invalid arg. Previously it allowed a cryptic "
":exc:`AttributeError` to escape."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41403`: 使 :meth:`mock.patch` 在无效参数上引发带有相关错误信息的 "
":exc:`TypeError`。之前它允许一个难以理解的 :exc:`AttributeError` 逃逸。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6462
msgid ""
":issue:`46474`: In ``importlib.metadata.EntryPoint.pattern``, avoid "
"potential REDoS by limiting ambiguity in consecutive whitespace."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46474`: 在 ``importlib.metadata.EntryPoint.pattern`` "
"中，通过限制连续空白字符的歧义性来避免潜在的 REDoS。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6465
msgid ""
":issue:`46474`: Removed private method from ``importlib.metadata.Path``. "
"Sync with importlib_metadata 4.10.0."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46474`: 从 ``importlib.metadata.Path`` 中移除了私有方法。与 importlib_metadata "
"4.10.0 同步。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6468
msgid ""
":issue:`46470`: Remove unused branch from ``typing._remove_dups_flatten``"
msgstr ":issue:`46470`: 从 ``typing._remove_dups_flatten`` 中移除未使用的分支。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6470
msgid ""
":issue:`46469`: :mod:`asyncio` generic classes now return "
":class:`types.GenericAlias` in ``__class_getitem__`` instead of the same "
"class."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46469`: :mod:`asyncio` 泛型类现在在 ``__class_getitem__`` 中返回 "
":class:`types.GenericAlias` 而不是同一个类。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6474
msgid ""
":issue:`41906`: Support passing filter instances in the ``filters`` values "
"of ``handlers`` and ``loggers`` in the dictionary passed to "
":func:`logging.config.dictConfig`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41906`: 支持在传递给 :func:`logging.config.dictConfig` 的字典中的 ``handlers`` "
"和 ``loggers`` 的 ``filters`` 值中传递过滤器实例。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6478
msgid ""
":issue:`46422`: Use ``dis.Positions`` in ``dis.Instruction`` instead of a "
"regular ``tuple``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46422`: 在 ``dis.Instruction`` 中使用 ``dis.Positions`` 而不是常规的 "
"``tuple``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6481
msgid ""
":issue:`46434`: :mod:`pdb` now gracefully handles ``help`` when "
":attr:`__doc__` is missing, for example when run with pregenerated optimized"
" ``.pyc`` files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6485
msgid ""
":issue:`43869`: Python uses the same time Epoch on all platforms. Add an "
"explicit unit test to ensure that it's the case. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43869`: Python 在所有平台上使用相同的时间纪元。添加一个明确的单元测试以确保这一点。由 Victor Stinner "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6488
msgid ""
":issue:`46414`: Add :func:`typing.reveal_type`. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ":issue:`46414`: 添加 :func:`typing.reveal_type`。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6490
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: :mod:`subprocess` now imports Windows-specific imports when "
"``msvcrt`` module is available, and POSIX-specific imports on all other "
"platforms. This gives a clean exception when ``_posixsubprocess`` is not "
"available (e.g. Emscripten browser target)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40280`: :mod:`subprocess` 现在在有 ``msvcrt`` 模块可用时导入特定于 Windows "
"的导入，在所有其他平台上导入特定于 POSIX 的导入。这提供了一个干净的异常当 ``_posixsubprocess`` 不可用时（例如 "
"Emscripten 浏览器目标）。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6495
msgid ""
":issue:`40066`: ``IntEnum``, ``IntFlag``, and ``StrEnum`` use the mixed-in "
"type for their ``str()`` and ``format()`` output."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40066`: ``IntEnum``, ``IntFlag``, 和 ``StrEnum`` 使用混合类型作为它们的 "
"``str()`` 和 ``format()`` 输出。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6498
msgid ""
":issue:`46316`: Optimize :meth:`pathlib.Path.iterdir` by removing an "
"unnecessary check for special entries."
msgstr ":issue:`46316`: 通过移除对特殊条目不必要的检查来优化 :meth:`pathlib.Path.iterdir`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6501
msgid ""
":issue:`29688`: Document :meth:`pathlib.Path.absolute` (which has always "
"existed)."
msgstr ":issue:`29688`: 记录 :meth:`pathlib.Path.absolute` (一直存在) 。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6504
msgid ""
":issue:`43012`: The pathlib module's obsolete and internal ``_Accessor`` "
"class has been removed to prepare the terrain for upcoming enhancements to "
"the module."
msgstr ":issue:`43012`: pathlib 模块中过时且内部的 ``_Accessor`` 类已被移除，为模块即将到来的增强做准备。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6508
msgid ""
":issue:`46258`: Speed up :func:`math.isqrt` for small positive integers by "
"replacing two division steps with a lookup table."
msgstr ":issue:`46258`: 通过用查找表替换两个除法步骤来加速小正整数的 :func:`math.isqrt`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6511
msgid ""
":issue:`46242`: Improve error message when creating a new :class:`enum.Enum`"
" type subclassing an existing ``Enum`` with ``_member_names_`` using "
":meth:`enum.Enum.__call__`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46242`: 当使用 :meth:`enum.Enum.__call__` 创建一个新的 :class:`enum.Enum` "
"类型，该类型继承了一个带有 ``_member_names_`` 的现有 ``Enum`` 时，改进错误消息。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6515
msgid ""
":issue:`43118`: Fix a bug in :func:`inspect.signature` that was causing it "
"to fail on some subclasses of classes with a ``__text_signature__`` "
"referencing module globals. Patch by Weipeng Hong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43118`: 修复 :func:`inspect.signature` 中的一个 bug，该 bug 导致它在某些引用模块全局的 "
"``__text_signature__`` 的类的子类上失败。由 Weipeng Hong 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6519
msgid ""
":issue:`26552`: Fixed case where failing :func:`asyncio.ensure_future` did "
"not close the coroutine. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26552`: 修复了 :func:`asyncio.ensure_future` 失败时未关闭协程的情况。由 Kumar Aditya"
" 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6522
msgid ""
":issue:`21987`: Fix an issue with :meth:`tarfile.TarFile.getmember` getting "
"a directory name with a trailing slash."
msgstr ":issue:`21987`: 修复 :meth:`tarfile.TarFile.getmember` 获取带有尾随斜杠的目录名的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6525
msgid ""
":issue:`46124`: Update :mod:`zoneinfo` to rely on importlib.resources "
"traversable API."
msgstr ":issue:`46124`: 更新 :mod:`zoneinfo` 以依赖 importlib.resources 的可遍历 API。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6528
msgid ""
":issue:`46103`: Now :func:`inspect.getmembers` only gets :attr:`__bases__` "
"attribute from class type. Patch by Weipeng Hong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46103`: 现在 :func:`inspect.getmembers` 仅从类类型获取 :attr:`__bases__` "
"属性。补丁由 Weipeng Hong 提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6531
msgid ""
":issue:`46080`: Fix exception in argparse help text generation if a "
":class:`argparse.BooleanOptionalAction` argument's default is "
"``argparse.SUPPRESS`` and it has ``help`` specified.  Patch by Felix "
"Fontein."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46080`: 修复了如果 :class:`argparse.BooleanOptionalAction` 参数的默认值为 "
"``argparse.SUPPRESS`` 并且指定了 ``help`` 时，在 argparse 帮助文本生成中出现的异常。补丁由 Felix "
"Fontein 提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6536
msgid ""
":issue:`44791`: Fix substitution of :class:`~typing.ParamSpec` in "
":data:`~typing.Concatenate` with different parameter expressions. "
"Substitution with a list of types returns now a tuple of types. Substitution"
" with ``Concatenate`` returns now a ``Concatenate`` with concatenated lists "
"of arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44791`: 修复了在不同参数表达式中 :class:`~typing.ParamSpec` 在 "
":data:`~typing.Concatenate` 中的替换问题。现在用类型列表替换会返回一个类型元组。用 ``Concatenate`` "
"替换现在会返回一个带有连接参数列表的 ``Concatenate``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6545
msgid ""
":issue:`46463`: Fixes :file:`escape4chm.py` script used when building the "
"CHM documentation file"
msgstr ":issue:`46463`: 修复了构建 CHM 文档文件时使用的 :file:`escape4chm.py` 脚本。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6551
msgid ""
":issue:`43478`: Mocks can no longer be provided as the specs for other "
"Mocks. As a result, an already-mocked object cannot be passed to "
"``mock.Mock()``. This can uncover bugs in tests since these Mock-derived "
"Mocks will always pass certain tests (e.g. isinstance) and builtin assert "
"functions (e.g. assert_called_once_with) will unconditionally pass."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43478`: Mock 不能再作为其他 Mock 的规范提供。因此，已经 mock 的对象不能传递给 "
"``mock.Mock()``。这可以揭示测试中的错误，因为这些 Mock 派生的 Mock 总是会通过某些测试（例如 "
"isinstance），并且内置的断言函数（例如 assert_called_once_with）将无条件通过。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6557
msgid ""
":issue:`46616`: Ensures ``test_importlib.test_windows`` cleans up registry "
"keys after completion."
msgstr ":issue:`46616`: 确保 ``test_importlib.test_windows`` 在完成后清理注册表键。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6560
msgid ""
":issue:`44359`: test_ftplib now silently ignores socket errors to prevent "
"logging unhandled threading exceptions. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44359`: test_ftplib 现在默默地忽略套接字错误，以防止记录未处理的线程异常。由 Victor Stinner "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6563
msgid ""
":issue:`46600`: Fix test_gdb.test_pycfunction() for Python built with "
"``clang -Og``. Tolerate inlined functions in the gdb traceback. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46600`: 修复了使用 ``clang -Og`` 构建的 Python 的 "
"test_gdb.test_pycfunction()。在 gdb 回溯中容忍内联函数。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6567
msgid ""
":issue:`46542`: Fix a Python crash in test_lib2to3 when using Python built "
"in debug mode: limit the recursion limit. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46542`: 修复了在使用调试模式构建的 Python 中 test_lib2to3 的 Python 崩溃：限制递归限制。由 "
"Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6570
msgid ""
":issue:`46576`: test_peg_generator now disables compiler optimization when "
"testing compilation of its own C extensions to significantly speed up the "
"testing on non-debug builds of CPython."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46576`: test_peg_generator 现在在测试其自己的 C 扩展的编译时禁用编译器优化，以显著加快在 CPython "
"的非调试构建上的测试速度。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6574
msgid ""
":issue:`46542`: Fix ``test_json`` tests checking for :exc:`RecursionError`: "
"modify these tests to use ``support.infinite_recursion()``. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46542`: 修复 ``test_json`` 测试中对 :exc:`RecursionError` 的检查：修改这些测试以使用 "
"``support.infinite_recursion()``。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6578
msgid ""
":issue:`13886`: Skip test_builtin PTY tests on non-ASCII characters if the "
"readline module is loaded. The readline module changes input() behavior, but"
" test_builtin is not intented to test the readline module. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6583
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: Add :func:`test.support.requires_fork` decorators to mark "
"tests that require a working :func:`os.fork`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40280`: 添加 :func:`test.support.requires_fork` 装饰器以标记需要 "
":func:`os.fork` 正常工作的测试。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6586
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: Add :func:`test.support.requires_subprocess` decorator to "
"mark tests which require working :mod:`subprocess` module or ``os.spawn*``. "
"The wasm32-emscripten platform has no support for processes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40280`: 添加 :func:`test.support.requires_subprocess` 装饰器以标记需要 "
":mod:`subprocess` 模块或 ``os.spawn*`` 正常工作的测试。wasm32-emscripten 平台不支持进程。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6590
msgid ":issue:`46126`: Disable 'descriptions' when running tests internally."
msgstr ":issue:`46126`: 在内部运行测试时禁用 'descriptions'。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6595
msgid ""
":issue:`46602`: Tidied up configure.ac so that conftest.c is truncated "
"rather than appended. This assists in the case where the 'rm' of conftest.c "
"fails to happen between tests.  Downstream issues such as a clobbered SOABI "
"can result."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46602`: 整理 configure.ac 使得 conftest.c 被截断而非追加。这在 'rm' conftest.c "
"在测试之间未能发生时有所帮助。可能导致诸如 SOABI 被破坏的下游问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6600
msgid ""
":issue:`46600`: Fix the test checking if the C compiler supports ``-Og`` "
"option in the ``./configure`` script to also use ``-Og`` on clang which "
"supports it. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46600`: 修复 ``./configure`` 脚本中检查 C 编译器是否支持 ``-Og`` 选项的测试，以同样在支持 "
"``-Og`` 的 clang 上使用该选项。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6604
msgid ""
":issue:`38472`: Fix GCC detection in setup.py when cross-compiling. The C "
"compiler is now run with LC_ALL=C. Previously, the detection failed with a "
"German locale."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38472`: 修复交叉编译时 setup.py 中的 GCC 检测。现在 C 编译器以 LC_ALL=C "
"运行。之前，检测在德语环境下会失败。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6608
msgid ""
":issue:`46513`: :program:`configure` no longer uses ``AC_C_CHAR_UNSIGNED`` "
"macro and ``pyconfig.h`` no longer defines reserved symbol "
"``__CHAR_UNSIGNED__``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46513`: :program:`configure` 不再使用 ``AC_C_CHAR_UNSIGNED`` 宏，且 "
"``pyconfig.h`` 不再定义保留符号 ``__CHAR_UNSIGNED__``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6612
msgid ""
":issue:`46471`: Use global singletons for single byte bytes objects in "
"deepfreeze."
msgstr ":issue:`46471`: 在 deepfreeze 中使用全局单例作为单字节 bytes 对象。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6615
msgid ""
":issue:`46443`: Deepfreeze now uses cached small integers as it saves some "
"space for common small integers."
msgstr ":issue:`46443`: Deepfreeze 现在使用缓存的小整数，因为它为常见的小整数节省了一些空间。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6618
msgid ""
":issue:`46429`: Merge all deep-frozen files into one for space savings. "
"Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":issue:`46429`: 将所有深度冻结文件合并为一个以节省空间。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6621
msgid ""
":issue:`45569`: The build now defaults to using 30-bit digits for Python "
"integers. Previously either 15-bit or 30-bit digits would be selected, "
"depending on the platform. 15-bit digits may still be selected using the "
"``--enable-big-digits=15`` option to the ``configure`` script, or by "
"defining ``PYLONG_BITS_IN_DIGIT`` in ``pyconfig.h``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45569`: Python 整数的构建现在默认使用 30 位数字。之前会根据平台选择 15 位或 30 位数字。仍然可以通过在 "
"``configure`` 脚本中使用 ``--enable-big-digits=15`` 选项，或在 ``pyconfig.h`` 中定义 "
"``PYLONG_BITS_IN_DIGIT`` 来选择 15 位数字。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6627
msgid ":issue:`45925`: Update Windows installer to use SQLite 3.37.2."
msgstr ":issue:`45925`: 更新 Windows 安装程序以使用 SQLite 3.37.2。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6629
msgid ""
":issue:`43112`: Detect musl libc as a separate SOABI (tagged as ``linux-"
"musl``)."
msgstr ":issue:`43112`: 检测 musl libc 作为一个单独的 SOABI（标记为 ``linux-musl``）。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6635
msgid ""
":issue:`33125`: The traditional EXE/MSI based installer for Windows is now "
"available for ARM64"
msgstr ":issue:`33125`: 传统的基于 EXE/MSI 的 Windows 安装程序现在可用于 ARM64。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6638
msgid ""
":issue:`46362`: os.path.abspath(\"C:\\CON\") is now fixed to return "
"\"\\\\.\\CON\", not the same path. The regression was true of all legacy DOS"
" devices such as COM1, LPT1, or NUL."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46362`: os.path.abspath(\"C:\\CON\") 现在修正为返回 "
"\"\\\\.\\CON\"，而不是相同的路径。这个回归问题存在于所有遗留的 DOS 设备如 COM1、LPT1 或 NUL。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6642
msgid ""
":issue:`44934`: The installer now offers a command-line only option to add "
"the installation directory to the end of :envvar:`PATH` instead of at the "
"start."
msgstr ":issue:`44934`: 安装程序现在提供了一个仅限命令行的选项，将安装目录添加到 :envvar:`PATH` 的末尾而不是开头。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6649
msgid ":issue:`45925`: Update macOS installer to SQLite 3.37.2."
msgstr ":issue:`45925`: 更新 macOS 安装程序到 SQLite 3.37.2。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6654
msgid ""
":issue:`45296`: Clarify close, quit, and exit in IDLE.  In the File menu, "
"'Close' and 'Exit' are now 'Close Window' (the current one) and 'Exit' is "
"now 'Exit IDLE' (by closing all windows).  In Shell, 'quit()' and 'exit()' "
"mean 'close Shell'. If there are no other windows, this also exits IDLE."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45296`: 在 IDLE 中明确了关闭、退出和退出的区别。在文件菜单中，'关闭' 和 '退出' 现在是 '关闭窗口'（当前窗口）和 "
"'退出 IDLE'（通过关闭所有窗口）。在 Shell 中，'quit()' 和 'exit()' 意思是 '关闭 "
"Shell'。如果没有其他窗口，这也将退出 IDLE。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6662
msgid ""
":issue:`40170`: Remove the ``PyHeapType_GET_MEMBERS()`` macro. It was "
"exposed in the public C API by mistake, it must only be used by Python "
"internally. Use the ``PyTypeObject.tp_members`` member instead. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40170`: 移除了 ``PyHeapType_GET_MEMBERS()`` 宏。它被错误地暴露在公共 C API 中，必须仅由 "
"Python 内部使用。使用 ``PyTypeObject.tp_members`` 成员代替。由 Victor Stinner 提供的补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6667
msgid ""
":issue:`40170`: Move _Py_GetAllocatedBlocks() and "
"_PyObject_DebugMallocStats() private functions to the internal C API. Patch "
"by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40170`: 将 _Py_GetAllocatedBlocks() 和 _PyObject_DebugMallocStats() "
"私有函数移动到内部 C API。由 Victor Stinner 提供的补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6670
msgid ""
":issue:`46433`: The internal function _PyType_GetModuleByDef now correctly "
"handles inheritance patterns involving static types."
msgstr ":issue:`46433`: 内部函数 _PyType_GetModuleByDef 现在正确处理涉及静态类型的继承模式。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6673
msgid ""
":issue:`45459`: :c:type:`Py_buffer` and various ``Py_buffer`` related "
"functions are now part of the limited API and stable ABI."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45459`: :c:type:`Py_buffer` 和各种 ``Py_buffer`` 相关函数现在是有限 API 和稳定 ABI "
"的一部分。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6676
msgid ""
":issue:`14916`: Fixed bug in the tokenizer that prevented "
"``PyRun_InteractiveOne`` from parsing from the provided FD."
msgstr ""
":issue:`14916`: 修复了 tokenizer 中的一个错误，该错误阻止了 ``PyRun_InteractiveOne`` 从提供的 FD"
" 解析。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6681
msgid "Python 3.11.0 alpha 4"
msgstr "Python 3.11.0 alpha 4"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6683
msgid "*Release date: 2022-01-13*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2022-01-13*"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6688
msgid ""
":issue:`46070`: :c:func:`Py_EndInterpreter` now explicitly untracks all "
"objects currently tracked by the GC. Previously, if an object was used later"
" by another interpreter, calling :c:func:`PyObject_GC_UnTrack` on the object"
" crashed if the previous or the next object of the :c:type:`PyGC_Head` "
"structure became a dangling pointer. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6694
msgid ":issue:`46347`: Fix memory leak in PyEval_EvalCodeEx."
msgstr ":issue:`46347`: 修复PyEval_EvalCodeEx中的内存泄漏。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6696
msgid ""
":issue:`46339`: Fix a crash in the parser when retrieving the error text for"
" multi-line f-strings expressions that do not start in the first line of the"
" string. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`46339`: 修复解析器在检索多行f-strings表达式的错误文本时崩溃的问题，这些表达式不在字符串的第一行开始。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6700
msgid ""
":issue:`46331`: Do not set line number of instruction storing doc-string. "
"Fixes regression introduced in 3.11 alpha."
msgstr ":issue:`46331`: 不要设置存储文档字符串的指令的行号。修复了在3.11 alpha中引入的回归问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6703
msgid ""
":issue:`46314`: Remove spurious \"call\" event when creating a lambda "
"function that was accidentally introduced in 3.11a4."
msgstr ":issue:`46314`: 移除在创建lambda函数时意外引入的虚假“call”事件，该事件是在3.11a4中意外引入的。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6706
msgid ""
":issue:`46289`: ASDL declaration of ``FormattedValue`` has changed to "
"reflect ``conversion`` field is not optional."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46289`: ``FormattedValue`` 的ASDL声明已更改，以反映 ``conversion`` 字段不是可选的。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6709
msgid ""
":issue:`46297`: Fixed an interpreter crash on bootup with multiple "
"PythonPaths set in the Windows registry. Patch by Derzsi Dániel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46297`: 修复了在启动时在Windows注册表中设置多个PythonPaths时解释器崩溃的问题。补丁由Derzsi "
"Dániel提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6712
msgid ""
":issue:`46237`: Fix the line number of tokenizer errors inside f-strings. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`46237`: 修复f-strings内部标记器错误的行号。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6715
msgid ""
":issue:`46263`: We always expect the \"use_frozen_modules\" config to be "
"set, now that getpath.c was rewritten in pure Python and the logic improved."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46263`: "
"我们现在总是期望“use_frozen_modules”配置被设置，因为getpath.c已经在纯Python中重写并且逻辑得到了改进。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6718
msgid ""
":issue:`46006`: Fix a regression when a type method like ``__init__()`` is "
"modified in a subinterpreter. Fix a regression in "
"``_PyUnicode_EqualToASCIIId()`` and type ``update_slot()``. Revert the "
"change which made the Unicode dictionary of interned strings compatible with"
" subinterpreters: the internal interned dictionary is shared again by all "
"interpreters. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46006`: 修复当类型方法如 ``__init__()`` 在子解释器中被修改时的回归问题。修复 "
"``_PyUnicode_EqualToASCIIId()`` 和类型 ``update_slot()`` "
"中的回归问题。恢复使Unicode内部字符串字典与子解释器兼容的更改：内部内部字符串字典再次由所有解释器共享。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6725
msgid ""
":issue:`45923`: Add RESUME opcode. This is a logical no-op. It is emitted by"
" the compiler anywhere a Python function can be entered. It is used by the "
"interpreter to perform tracing and optimizer checks."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45923`: "
"添加RESUME操作码。这是一个逻辑上的无操作。它由编译器在可以进入Python函数的任何地方发出。它被解释器用于执行跟踪和优化器检查。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6729
msgid ""
":issue:`46208`: Fix the regression of os.path.normpath(\"A/../../B\") not "
"returning expected \"../B\" but \"B\"."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46208`: 修复 os.path.normpath(\"A/../../B\") 未返回预期的 \"../B\" 而是返回 "
"\"B\" 的回归问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6732
msgid ""
":issue:`46240`: Correct the error message for unclosed parentheses when the "
"tokenizer doesn't reach the end of the source when the error is reported. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`46240`: 当错误报告时，如果标记器未到达源代码的末尾，则修正未闭合括号的错误消息。补丁由 Pablo Galindo 提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6736
msgid ":issue:`46009`: Remove the ``GEN_START`` opcode."
msgstr ":issue:`46009`: 移除 ``GEN_START`` 操作码。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6738
msgid ""
":issue:`46235`: Certain sequence multiplication operations like ``[0] * "
"1_000`` are now faster due to reference-counting optimizations. Patch by "
"Dennis Sweeney."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46235`: 由于引用计数优化，现在某些序列乘法操作如 ``[0] * 1_000`` 更快了。由 Dennis Sweeney "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6742
msgid ""
":issue:`46221`: :opcode:`PREP_RERAISE_STAR` no longer pushes ``lasti`` to "
"the stack."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6745
msgid ""
":issue:`46202`: Remove :opcode:`!POP_EXCEPT_AND_RERAISE` and replace it by "
"an equivalent sequence of other opcodes."
msgstr ":issue:`46202`: 移除 :opcode:`!POP_EXCEPT_AND_RERAISE` 并用其他操作码的等价序列替代。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6748
msgid ":issue:`46085`: Fix iterator cache mechanism of :class:`OrderedDict`."
msgstr ":issue:`46085`: 修复 :class:`OrderedDict` 的迭代器缓存机制。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6750
msgid ""
":issue:`46055`: Speed up shifting operation involving integers less than "
":c:macro:`PyLong_BASE`. Patch by Xinhang Xu."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46055`: 加速涉及小于 :c:macro:`PyLong_BASE` 的整数的移位操作。补丁由 Xinhang Xu 提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6753
msgid ""
":issue:`46110`: Add a maximum recursion check to the PEG parser to avoid "
"stack overflow. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`46110`: 向 PEG 解析器添加最大递归检查以避免堆栈溢出。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6756
msgid ""
":issue:`46107`: Fix bug where :meth:`ExceptionGroup.split` and "
":meth:`ExceptionGroup.subgroup` did not copy the exception group's "
"``__note__`` field to the parts."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46107`: 修复 :meth:`ExceptionGroup.split` 和 "
":meth:`ExceptionGroup.subgroup` 未将异常组的 ``__note__`` 字段复制到部分的错误。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6760
msgid ""
":issue:`45711`: The interpreter state's representation of handled exceptions"
" (a.k.a exc_info, or _PyErr_StackItem) now has only the ``exc_value`` field,"
" ``exc_type`` and ``exc_traceback`` have been removed as their values can be"
" derived from ``exc_value``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45711`: 解释器状态的处理异常表示（又称 exc_info 或 _PyErr_StackItem）现在只有 "
"``exc_value`` 字段，``exc_type`` 和 ``exc_traceback`` 已被移除，因为它们的值可以从 "
"``exc_value`` 派生。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6765
msgid ""
":issue:`44525`: Replace the four call bytecode instructions which one pre-"
"call instruction and two call instructions."
msgstr ":issue:`44525`: 用一个预调用指令和两个调用指令替换四个调用字节码指令。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6768
msgid ""
"Removes ``CALL_FUNCTION``, ``CALL_FUNCTION_KW``, ``CALL_METHOD`` and "
"``CALL_METHOD_KW``."
msgstr ""
"移除 ``CALL_FUNCTION``, ``CALL_FUNCTION_KW``, ``CALL_METHOD`` 和 "
"``CALL_METHOD_KW``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6771
msgid ""
"Adds ``CALL_NO_KW`` and ``CALL_KW`` call instructions, and "
"``PRECALL_METHOD`` prefix for pairing with ``LOAD_METHOD``."
msgstr ""
"添加 ``CALL_NO_KW`` 和 ``CALL_KW`` 调用指令，以及 ``PRECALL_METHOD`` 前缀与 "
"``LOAD_METHOD`` 配对。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6774
msgid ""
":issue:`46039`: Remove the ``YIELD_FROM`` instruction and replace it with "
"the ``SEND`` instruction which performs the same operation, but without the "
"loop."
msgstr ":issue:`46039`: 移除 ``YIELD_FROM`` 指令并用执行相同操作但不带循环的 ``SEND`` 指令替代。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6778
msgid ""
":issue:`45635`: The code called from :c:func:`_PyErr_Display` was refactored"
" to improve error handling. It now exits immediately upon an unrecoverable "
"error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6782
msgid ""
":issue:`46054`: Fix parser error when parsing non-utf8 characters in source "
"files. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`46054`: 修复解析源文件中非utf8字符时的解析器错误。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6785
msgid ""
":issue:`46042`: Improve the location of the caret in :exc:`SyntaxError` "
"exceptions emitted by the symbol table. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46042`: 改进符号表发出的 :exc:`SyntaxError` 异常中插入符号的位置。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6788
msgid ""
":issue:`46049`: Ensure :file:`._pth` files work as intended on platforms "
"other than Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`46049`: 确保 :file:`._pth` 文件在非Windows平台上按预期工作。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6791
msgid ""
":issue:`46048`: Fixes parsing of :file:`._pth` files on startup so that "
"single-character paths are correctly read."
msgstr ":issue:`46048`: 修复启动时 :file:`._pth` 文件的解析，以便正确读取单字符路径。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6794
msgid ""
":issue:`37971`: Fix a bug where the line numbers given in a traceback when a"
" decorator application raised an exception were wrong."
msgstr ":issue:`37971`: 修复一个错误，该错误导致装饰器应用引发异常时，回溯中给出的行号错误。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6797
msgid ""
":issue:`46031`: Add :opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_NOT_NONE` and "
":opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_NONE` opcodes to speed up conditional jumps."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46031`: 添加 :opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_NOT_NONE` 和 "
":opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_NONE` 操作码以加速条件跳转。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6800
msgid ":issue:`45654`: Deepfreeze :mod:`runpy`, patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":issue:`45654`: 深度冻结 :mod:`runpy`，由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6802
msgid ""
":issue:`46025`: Fix a crash in the :mod:`atexit` module involving functions "
"that unregister themselves before raising exceptions. Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46025`: 修复 :mod:`atexit` 模块中的一个崩溃问题，涉及在引发异常前自行注销的函数。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6806
msgid ""
":issue:`46000`: Improve compatibility of the :mod:`curses` module with "
"NetBSD curses."
msgstr ":issue:`46000`: 提高 :mod:`curses` 模块与NetBSD curses的兼容性。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6809
msgid ""
":issue:`44525`: Specialize the CALL_FUNCTION instruction for calls to "
"builtin types with a single argument. Speeds up ``range(x)``, ``list(x)``, "
"and specifically ``type(obj)``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44525`: 为调用带单一参数的内置类型专门化CALL_FUNCTION指令。加速 ``range(x)``, "
"``list(x)``，特别是 ``type(obj)``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6813
msgid ""
":issue:`42918`: Fix bug where the built-in :func:`compile` function did not "
"always raise a :exc:`SyntaxError` when passed multiple statements in "
"'single' mode. Patch by Weipeng Hong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42918`: 修复内置 :func:`compile` 函数在'single'模式下传递多个语句时并不总是引发 "
":exc:`SyntaxError` 的错误。由Weipeng Hong提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6817
msgid ""
":issue:`45953`: The main interpreter in _PyRuntimeState.interpreters is now "
"statically allocated (as part of _PyRuntime).  Likewise for the initial "
"thread state of each interpreter.  This means less allocation during runtime"
" init, as well as better memory locality for these key state objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45953`: "
"_PyRuntimeState.interpreters中的主解释器现在是静态分配的（作为_PyRuntime的一部分）。每个解释器的初始线程状态也是如此。这意味着运行时初始化期间分配更少，以及这些关键状态对象更好的内存局部性。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6823
msgid ""
":issue:`45292`: Complete the :pep:`654` implementation: add ``except*``."
msgstr ":issue:`45292`: 完成 :pep:`654` 实现：添加 ``except*``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6825
msgid ""
":issue:`43413`: Revert changes in ``set.__init__``. Subclass of :class:`set`"
" needs to define a ``__init__()`` method if it defines a ``__new__()`` "
"method with additional keyword parameters."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43413`: 恢复 ``set.__init__`` 中的更改。:class:`set` 的子类如果定义了带有额外关键字参数的 "
"``__new__()`` 方法，那么它需要定义一个 ``__init__()`` 方法。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6829
msgid ""
":issue:`43931`: Added the :c:data:`Py_Version` constant which bears the same"
" value as :c:macro:`PY_VERSION_HEX`. Patch by Gabriele N. Tornetta."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43931`: 添加了 :c:data:`Py_Version` 常量，其值与 :c:macro:`PY_VERSION_HEX` "
"相同。由 Gabriele N. Tornetta 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6835
msgid ""
":issue:`46342`: The ``@typing.final`` decorator now sets the ``__final__`` "
"attribute on the decorated object to allow runtime introspection. Patch by "
"Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46342`: ``@typing.final`` 装饰器现在会在被装饰的对象上设置 ``__final__`` "
"属性，以允许运行时内省。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6839
msgid ""
":issue:`46328`: Added the :meth:`sys.exception` method which returns the "
"active exception instance."
msgstr ":issue:`46328`: 添加了 :meth:`sys.exception` 方法，该方法返回活动的异常实例。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6842
msgid ""
":issue:`46307`: Add :meth:`string.Template.is_valid` and "
":meth:`string.Template.get_identifiers` methods."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46307`: 添加 :meth:`string.Template.is_valid` 和 "
":meth:`string.Template.get_identifiers` 方法。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6845
msgid ""
":issue:`46306`: Assume that :class:`types.CodeType` always has "
":attr:`types.CodeType.co_firstlineno` in :mod:`doctest`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46306`: 在 :mod:`doctest` 中假设 :class:`types.CodeType` 总是有 "
":attr:`types.CodeType.co_firstlineno`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6848
msgid ""
":issue:`40479`: Fix :mod:`hashlib` *usedforsecurity* option to work "
"correctly with OpenSSL 3.0.0 in FIPS mode."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40479`: 修复 :mod:`hashlib` *usedforsecurity* 选项，使其在 FIPS 模式下与 OpenSSL"
" 3.0.0 正确工作。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6851
msgid ""
":issue:`46070`: Fix possible segfault when importing the :mod:`asyncio` "
"module from different sub-interpreters in parallel. Patch by Erlend E. "
"Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46070`: 修复了从不同的子解释器并行导入 :mod:`asyncio` 模块时可能出现的段错误。补丁由 Erlend E. "
"Aasland 提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6854
msgid ""
":issue:`46244`: Removed ``__slots__`` from :class:`typing.ParamSpec` and "
":class:`typing.TypeVar`. They served no purpose. Patch by Arie Bovenberg."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46244`: 从 :class:`typing.ParamSpec` 和 :class:`typing.TypeVar` 中移除了 "
"``__slots__``。它们没有任何作用。由 Arie Bovenberg 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6857
msgid ""
":issue:`46278`: Reflect ``context`` argument in "
"``AbstractEventLoop.call_*()`` methods. Loop implementations already support"
" it."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46278`: 在 ``AbstractEventLoop.call_*()`` 方法中反映 ``context`` "
"参数。循环实现已经支持它。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6860
msgid ""
":issue:`46269`: Remove special-casing of ``__new__`` in "
":meth:`enum.Enum.__dir__`."
msgstr ":issue:`46269`: 在 :meth:`enum.Enum.__dir__` 中移除了对 ``__new__`` 的特殊处理。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6863
msgid ":issue:`46266`: Improve day constants in :mod:`calendar`."
msgstr ":issue:`46266`: 改进 :mod:`calendar` 中的日常量。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6865
msgid ""
"Now all constants (``MONDAY`` ... ``SUNDAY``) are documented, tested, and "
"added to ``__all__``."
msgstr "现在所有常量（``MONDAY`` ... ``SUNDAY``）都已文档化、测试并添加到 ``__all__`` 中。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6868
msgid ""
":issue:`46257`: Optimized the mean, variance, and stdev functions in the "
"statistics module. If the input is an iterator, it is consumed in a single "
"pass rather than eating memory by conversion to a list.  The single pass "
"algorithm is about twice as fast as the previous two pass code."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46257`: 优化了 statistics 模块中的 mean、variance 和 stdev "
"函数。如果输入是一个迭代器，它将在单次遍历中被消耗，而不是通过转换为列表来消耗内存。单次遍历算法比之前的两遍代码快大约两倍。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6873
msgid ""
":issue:`41011`: Added two new variables to *pyvenv.cfg* which is generated "
"by :mod:`venv` module: *executable* for the executable and *command* for the"
" command line used to create the environment."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41011`: 在由 :mod:`venv` 模块生成的 *pyvenv.cfg* 中新增了两个变量：*executable* "
"用于可执行文件，*command* 用于创建环境时使用的命令行。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6877
msgid ""
":issue:`46239`: Improve error message when importing "
":mod:`asyncio.windows_events` on non-Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46239`: 在非 Windows 系统上导入 :mod:`asyncio.windows_events` 时改进了错误消息。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6880
msgid ""
":issue:`46238`: Reuse ``_winapi`` constants in ``asyncio.windows_events``."
msgstr ":issue:`46238`: 在 ``asyncio.windows_events`` 中重用 ``_winapi`` 常量。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6882
msgid ""
":issue:`46222`: Adding ``SF_NOCACHE`` sendfile constant for FreeBSD for the "
"posixmodule."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46222`: 为 posixmodule 添加 FreeBSD 的 ``SF_NOCACHE`` sendfile 常量。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6885
msgid ""
":issue:`37295`: Add fast path for ``0 <= k <= n <= 67`` for "
":func:`math.comb`."
msgstr ":issue:`37295`: 为 :func:`math.comb` 添加 ``0 <= k <= n <= 67`` 的快速路径。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6887
msgid ":issue:`46176`: Adding the ``MAP_STACK`` constant for the mmap module."
msgstr ":issue:`46176`: 为 mmap 模块添加 ``MAP_STACK`` 常量。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6889
msgid ""
":issue:`43424`: Deprecate :attr:`webbrowser.MacOSXOSAScript._name` and use "
"``name`` instead."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43424`: 弃用 :attr:`webbrowser.MacOSXOSAScript._name`，改用 ``name``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6892
msgid ""
":issue:`45321`: Added missing error codes to module "
"``xml.parsers.expat.errors``."
msgstr ":issue:`45321`: 向模块 ``xml.parsers.expat.errors`` 添加了缺失的错误代码。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6895
msgid ""
":issue:`46125`: Refactor tests to test traversable API directly. Includes "
"changes from importlib 5.4.0."
msgstr ":issue:`46125`: 重构测试以直接测试可遍历 API。包括来自 importlib 5.4.0 的更改。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6898
msgid ""
":issue:`46118`: Moved importlib.resources and its related functionality to a"
" package."
msgstr ":issue:`46118`: 将 importlib.resources 及其相关功能移动到一个包中。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6901
msgid ""
":issue:`37578`: Add *include_hidden* parameter to :func:`~glob.glob` and "
":func:`~glob.iglob` to match hidden files and directories when using special"
" characters like ``*``, ``**``, ``?`` and ``[]``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37578`: 向 :func:`~glob.glob` 和 :func:`~glob.iglob` 添加 "
"*include_hidden* 参数，以在使用特殊字符如 ``*``, ``**``, ``?`` 和 ``[]`` 时匹配隐藏文件和目录。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6905
msgid ""
":issue:`20369`: :func:`concurrent.futures.wait` no longer blocks forever "
"when given duplicate Futures. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20369`: 当给定重复的 Futures 时，:func:`concurrent.futures.wait` 不再永远阻塞。由 "
"Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6908
msgid ""
":issue:`46105`: Honor spec when generating requirement specs with urls and "
"extras (importlib_metadata 4.8.3)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46105`: 在使用 URL 和 extras 生成需求规范时遵循规范（importlib_metadata 4.8.3）。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6911
msgid ""
":issue:`44893`: EntryPoint objects are no longer tuples. Recommended means "
"to access is by attribute ('.name', '.group') or accessor ('.load()'). "
"Access by index is deprecated and will raise deprecation warning."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44893`: EntryPoint 对象不再是元组。推荐的访问方式是通过属性（'.name', "
"'.group'）或访问器（'.load()'）。通过索引访问已弃用，并将引发弃用警告。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6915
msgid ""
":issue:`22815`: Print unexpected successes together with failures and errors"
" in summary in :class:`unittest.TextTestResult`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22815`: 在 :class:`unittest.TextTestResult` 的摘要中打印未预期的成功与失败和错误。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6918
msgid ""
":issue:`22047`: Calling :meth:`add_argument_group` on an argument group is "
"deprecated. Calling :meth:`add_argument_group` or "
":meth:`add_mutually_exclusive_group` on a mutually exclusive group is "
"deprecated."
msgstr ""
":issue:`22047`: 弃用在参数组上调用 :meth:`add_argument_group`。弃用在互斥组上调用 "
":meth:`add_argument_group` 或 :meth:`add_mutually_exclusive_group`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6923
msgid ""
"These features were never supported and do not always work correctly. The "
"functions exist on the API by accident through inheritance and will be "
"removed in the future."
msgstr "这些功能从未被支持，且并不总是能正确工作。这些函数通过继承偶然存在于API中，将在未来被移除。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6927
msgid ""
":issue:`26952`: :mod:`argparse` raises :exc:`ValueError` with clear message "
"when trying to render usage for an empty mutually exclusive group. "
"Previously it raised a cryptic :exc:`IndexError`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26952`: :mod:`argparse` 在尝试为一个空的互斥组渲染用法时，会抛出一个带有清晰消息的 "
":exc:`ValueError`。之前它抛出一个难以理解的 :exc:`IndexError`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6931
msgid ""
":issue:`45615`: Functions in the :mod:`traceback` module raise "
":exc:`TypeError` rather than :exc:`AttributeError` when an exception "
"argument is not of type :exc:`BaseException`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45615`: 当异常参数不是 :exc:`BaseException` 类型时，:mod:`traceback` 模块中的函数会抛出 "
":exc:`TypeError` 而不是 :exc:`AttributeError`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6935
msgid ":issue:`16594`: Add allow allow_reuse_port flag in socketserver."
msgstr ":issue:`16594`: 在 socketserver 中添加 allow_reuse_port 标志。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6937
msgid ""
":issue:`27718`: Fix help for the :mod:`signal` module. Some functions (e.g. "
"``signal()`` and ``getsignal()``) were omitted."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27718`: 修复 :mod:`signal` 模块的帮助文档。一些函数（例如 ``signal()`` 和 "
"``getsignal()``）被遗漏了。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6940
msgid ""
":issue:`46032`: The ``registry()`` method of "
":func:`functools.singledispatch` functions checks now the first argument or "
"the first parameter annotation and raises a TypeError if it is not "
"supported. Previously unsupported \"types\" were ignored (e.g. "
"``typing.List[int]``) or caused an error at calling time (e.g. "
"``list[int]``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46032`: :func:`functools.singledispatch` 函数的 ``registry()`` "
"方法现在会检查第一个参数或第一个参数注解，并在不支持时抛出 TypeError。之前不支持的“类型”被忽略（例如 "
"``typing.List[int]``）或在调用时引发错误（例如 ``list[int]``）。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6946
msgid ""
":issue:`46014`: Add ability to use ``typing.Union`` and ``types.UnionType`` "
"as dispatch argument to ``functools.singledispatch``. Patch provided by "
"Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46014`: 添加使用 ``typing.Union`` 和 ``types.UnionType`` 作为 "
"``functools.singledispatch`` 的调度参数的能力。由 Yurii Karabas 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6950
msgid ""
":issue:`27062`: Add :attr:`__all__` to :mod:`inspect`, patch by Kumar "
"Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27062`: 向 :mod:`inspect` 添加 :attr:`__all__`，由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6952
msgid ""
":issue:`46018`: Ensure that :func:`math.expm1` does not raise on underflow."
msgstr ":issue:`46018`: 确保 :func:`math.expm1` 在下溢时不抛出异常。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6954
msgid ""
":issue:`46016`: Adding :attr:`F_DUP2FD` and :attr:`F_DUP2FD_CLOEXEC` "
"constants from FreeBSD into the fcntl module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6957
msgid ""
":issue:`45755`: :mod:`typing` generic aliases now reveal the class "
"attributes of the original generic class when passed to ``dir()``. This was "
"the behavior up to Python 3.6, but was changed in 3.7-3.9."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45755`: 现在，当传递给 ``dir()`` 时，:mod:`typing` 泛型别名会显示原始泛型类的类属性。这是 Python"
" 3.6 之前的行为，但在 3.7-3.9 中有所改变。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6961
msgid ""
":issue:`45874`: The empty query string, consisting of no query arguments, is"
" now handled correctly in ``urllib.parse.parse_qsl``. This caused problems "
"before when strict parsing was enabled."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45874`: 现在，``urllib.parse.parse_qsl`` "
"正确处理了不包含任何查询参数的空查询字符串。这在之前启用严格解析时会引发问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6965
msgid ""
":issue:`44674`: Change how dataclasses disallows mutable default values.  It"
" used to use a list of known types (list, dict, set).  Now it disallows "
"unhashable objects to be defaults.  It's using unhashability as a proxy for "
"mutability.  Patch by Eric V. Smith, idea by Raymond Hettinger."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44674`: "
"修改数据类如何禁止可变默认值的方式。过去是使用一系列已知类型（列表、字典、集合）。现在则禁止不可哈希的对象作为默认值。这是用不可哈希性作为可变性的代理。由Eric"
" V. Smith提供补丁，想法来自Raymond Hettinger。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6970
msgid ""
":issue:`23882`: Remove namespace package (PEP 420) support from unittest "
"discovery. It was introduced in Python 3.4 but has been broken since Python "
"3.7."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23882`: 从unittest发现中移除命名空间包（PEP 420）的支持。这一功能在Python 3.4中引入，但自Python "
"3.7以来已经损坏。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6974
msgid ""
":issue:`25066`: Added a :meth:`__repr__` method to "
":class:`multiprocessing.Event` objects, patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25066`: 为 :class:`multiprocessing.Event` 对象添加了 :meth:`__repr__` "
"方法，由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6977
msgid ""
":issue:`45643`: Added :const:`signal.SIGSTKFLT` on platforms where this "
"signal is defined."
msgstr ":issue:`45643`: 在定义了这个信号的平台上添加了 :const:`signal.SIGSTKFLT`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6980
msgid ""
":issue:`44092`: Fetch across rollback no longer raises "
":exc:`~sqlite3.InterfaceError`. Instead we leave it to the SQLite library to"
" handle these cases. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44092`: 跨回滚的获取不再引发 "
":exc:`~sqlite3.InterfaceError`。相反，我们让SQLite库来处理这些情况。由Erlend E. Aasland提供补丁。"

