msgstr ":meth:`turtle.RawTurtle.tiltangle` 之前被错误地标记为弃用，其文档字符串已被更正。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:7289 ../../../build/NEWS:7842 ../../../build/NEWS:8737
#: ../../../build/NEWS:8758 ../../../build/NEWS:8787 ../../../build/NEWS:8794
#: ../../../build/NEWS:8801
msgid "Patch by Hugo van Kemenade."
msgstr "由 Hugo van Kemenade 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:7291
msgid ""
":issue:`45831`: :mod:`faulthandler` can now write ASCII-only strings (like "
"filenames and function names) with a single write() syscall when dumping a "
"traceback. It reduces the risk of getting an unreadable dump when two "
"threads or two processes dump a traceback to the same file (like stderr) at "
"the same time. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45831`: :mod:`faulthandler` 现在可以在转储回溯时，通过一次 write() 系统调用写入仅包含 ASCII "
"的字符串（如文件名和函数名）。这减少了当两个线程或两个进程同时向同一文件（如 stderr）转储回溯时，产生不可读转储的风险。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:7297
msgid ""
":issue:`45828`: :mod:`sqlite` C callbacks now use unraisable exceptions if "
"callback tracebacks are enabled. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45828`: :mod:`sqlite` 的 C 回调现在在启用回调回溯时使用不可引发异常。由 Erlend E. Aasland "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:7300
msgid ""
":issue:`41735`: Fix thread lock in ``zlib.Decompress.flush()`` method before"
" ``PyObject_GetBuffer``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41735`: 在 ``PyObject_GetBuffer`` 之前修复了 ``zlib.Decompress.flush()`` "
"方法中的线程锁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:7303
msgid ""
":issue:`45235`: Reverted an argparse bugfix that caused regression in the "
"handling of default arguments for subparsers.  This prevented leaf level "
"arguments from taking precedence over root level arguments."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45235`: 恢复了 argparse 的一个错误修复，该修复导致了处理子解析器默认参数时的回归。这防止了叶级参数优先于根级参数。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:7307
msgid ""
":issue:`45754`: Fix a regression in Python 3.11a1 and 3.11a2 where "
":mod:`sqlite3` incorrectly would use ``SQLITE_LIMIT_LENGTH`` when checking "
"SQL statement lengths. Now, ``SQLITE_LIMIT_SQL_LENGTH`` is used. Patch by "
"Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45754`: 修复了 Python 3.11a1 和 3.11a2 中的一个回归问题，其中 :mod:`sqlite3` 在检查 "
"SQL 语句长度时会错误地使用 ``SQLITE_LIMIT_LENGTH``。现在使用 ``SQLITE_LIMIT_SQL_LENGTH``。由 "
"Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:7312
msgid ""
":issue:`45766`: Added *proportional* option to "
":meth:`statistics.linear_regression`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45766`: 向 :meth:`statistics.linear_regression` 添加了 *proportional* "
"选项。"

