#: ../../../build/NEWS:7501 ../../../build/NEWS:9335 ../../../build/NEWS:9440
msgid "Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr "由 Erlend E. Aasland 提交的补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:7503
msgid ""
":issue:`45573`: Mandatory core modules, that are required to bootstrap "
