#: ../../../build/NEWS:7864
msgid ""
":issue:`44547`: Implement ``Fraction.__int__``, so that a "
":class:`fractions.Fraction` instance ``f`` passes an ``isinstance(f, "
"typing.SupportsInt)`` check."
