":issue:`39218`: Improve accuracy of variance calculations by using ``x*x`` "
"instead of ``x**2``."
msgstr ":issue:`39218`: 通过使用 ``x*x`` 而非 ``x**2`` 来提高方差计算的准确性。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8877
msgid ""
":issue:`43613`: Improve the speed of :func:`gzip.compress` and "
":func:`gzip.decompress` by compressing and decompressing at once in memory "
"instead of in a streamed fashion."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43613`: 通过一次性在内存中压缩和解压缩，而不是流式处理，提高了 :func:`gzip.compress` 和 "
":func:`gzip.decompress` 的速度。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8881
msgid ""
":issue:`37596`: Ensure that :class:`set` and :class:`frozenset` objects are "
"always :mod:`marshalled <marshal>` reproducibly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37596`: 确保 :class:`set` 和 :class:`frozenset` 对象总是可以重复 "
":mod:`marshalled <marshal>`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8884
msgid ""
":issue:`44019`: A new function ``operator.call`` has been added, such that "
"``operator.call(obj, *args, **kwargs) == obj(*args, **kwargs)``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44019`: 新增了一个函数 ``operator.call``，使得 ``operator.call(obj, *args, "
"**kwargs) == obj(*args, **kwargs)``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8887
msgid ""
":issue:`42255`: :class:`webbrowser.MacOSX` is deprecated and will be removed"
" in Python 3.13. It is untested and undocumented and also not used by "
"webbrowser itself. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8891
msgid ""
":issue:`44955`: Method :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.stopTestRun` is now "
"always called in pair with method :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.startTestRun` "
"for :class:`~unittest.TestResult` objects implicitly created in "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.run`. Previously it was not called for test "
"methods and classes decorated with a skipping decorator."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44955`: 对于 :meth:`~unittest.TestCase.run` 中隐式创建的 "
":class:`~unittest.TestResult` 对象，方法 :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.stopTestRun`"
" 现在总是与方法 :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.startTestRun` "
"成对调用。之前，对于使用跳过装饰器装饰的测试方法和类，它不会被调用。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8897
msgid ""
":issue:`39039`: tarfile.open raises :exc:`~tarfile.ReadError` when a zlib "
"error occurs during file extraction."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39039`: 当文件提取过程中发生 zlib 错误时，tarfile.open 会引发 "
":exc:`~tarfile.ReadError`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8900
msgid ""
":issue:`44935`: :mod:`subprocess` on Solaris now also uses "
":func:`os.posix_spawn()` for better performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8903
msgid ""
":issue:`44911`: :class:`~unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` will no longer "
"throw an exception while cancelling leaked tasks. Patch by Bar Harel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44911`: :class:`~unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` 在取消泄漏任务时将不再抛出异常。由"
" Bar Harel 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8906
msgid ""
":issue:`41322`: Added ``DeprecationWarning`` for tests and async tests that "
"return a value!=None (as this may indicate an improperly written test, for "
"example a test written as a generator function)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41322`: 为返回值!=None 的测试和异步测试添加了 ``DeprecationWarning`` "
"(因为这可能表明测试编写不当，例如将测试编写为生成器函数) 。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8910
msgid ""
":issue:`44524`: Make exception message more useful when subclass from typing"
" special form alias. Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ":issue:`44524`: 当从 typing 特殊形式别名子类化时，使异常消息更有用。由 Yurii Karabas 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8913
msgid ""
":issue:`38956`: :class:`argparse.BooleanOptionalAction`'s default value is "
"no longer printed twice when used with "
":class:`argparse.ArgumentDefaultsHelpFormatter`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38956`: 当与 :class:`argparse.ArgumentDefaultsHelpFormatter` "
"一起使用时，:class:`argparse.BooleanOptionalAction` 的默认值不再打印两次。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8917
msgid ""
":issue:`44860`: Fix the ``posix_user`` scheme in :mod:`sysconfig` to not "
"depend on :data:`sys.platlibdir`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44860`: 修复 :mod:`sysconfig` 中的 ``posix_user`` 方案，使其不依赖于 "
":data:`sys.platlibdir`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8920
msgid ""
":issue:`44859`: Improve error handling in :mod:`sqlite3` and raise more "
"accurate exceptions."
msgstr ":issue:`44859`: 改进 :mod:`sqlite3` 中的错误处理，并引发更准确的异常。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8923
msgid ""
":exc:`MemoryError` is now raised instead of :exc:`sqlite3.Warning` when "
"memory is not enough for encoding a statement to UTF-8 in "
"``Connection.__call__()`` and ``Cursor.execute()``."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Connection.__call__()`` 和 ``Cursor.execute()`` 中，当内存不足以将语句编码为 UTF-8 "
"时，现在会引发 :exc:`MemoryError` 而不是 :exc:`sqlite3.Warning`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8924
msgid ""
":exc:`UnicodEncodeError` is now raised instead of :exc:`sqlite3.Warning` "
"when the statement contains surrogate characters in "
"``Connection.__call__()`` and ``Cursor.execute()``."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Connection.__call__()`` 和 ``Cursor.execute()`` 中，当语句包含代理字符时，现在会引发 "
":exc:`UnicodEncodeError` 而不是 :exc:`sqlite3.Warning`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8925
msgid ""
":exc:`TypeError` is now raised instead of :exc:`ValueError` for non-string "
"script argument in ``Cursor.executescript()``."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Cursor.executescript()`` 中，对于非字符串脚本参数，现在会引发 :exc:`TypeError` 而不是 "
":exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8926
msgid ""
":exc:`ValueError` is now raised for script containing the null character "
"instead of truncating it in ``Cursor.executescript()``."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Cursor.executescript()`` 中，对于包含空字符的脚本，现在会引发 :exc:`ValueError` 而不是截断它。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8927
msgid ""
"Correctly handle exceptions raised when getting boolean value of the result "
"of the progress handler."
msgstr "正确处理获取进度处理器结果的布尔值时引发的异常。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8928
msgid "Add many tests covering different corner cases."
msgstr "添加了许多测试，覆盖了不同的边缘情况。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8930
msgid ":issue:`44581`: Upgrade bundled pip to 21.2.3 and setuptools to 57.4.0"
msgstr ":issue:`44581`: 将捆绑的 pip 升级到 21.2.3 和 setuptools 到 57.4.0。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8932
msgid ""
":issue:`44849`: Fix the :func:`os.set_inheritable` function on FreeBSD 14 "
"for file descriptor opened with the :const:`~os.O_PATH` flag: ignore the "
":const:`~errno.EBADF` error on ``ioctl()``, fallback on the ``fcntl()`` "
"implementation. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44849`: 修复 FreeBSD 14 上 :func:`os.set_inheritable` 函数对于以 "
":const:`~os.O_PATH` 标志打开的文件描述符的问题：忽略 ``ioctl()`` 上的 :const:`~errno.EBADF` "
"错误，回退到 ``fcntl()`` 实现。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8937
msgid ""
":issue:`44605`: The @functools.total_ordering() decorator now works with "
"metaclasses."
msgstr ":issue:`44605`: @functools.total_ordering() 装饰器现在可以与元类一起工作。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8940
msgid ""
":issue:`44524`: Fixed an issue wherein the ``__name__`` and ``__qualname__``"
" attributes of subscribed specialforms could be ``None``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44524`: 修复了一个问题，其中订阅的特殊形式的 ``__name__`` 和 ``__qualname__`` 属性可能是 "
"``None``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8943
msgid ""
":issue:`44839`: :class:`MemoryError` raised in user-defined functions will "
"now produce a ``MemoryError`` in :mod:`sqlite3`. :class:`OverflowError` will"
" now be converted to :class:`~sqlite3.DataError`. Previously "
":class:`~sqlite3.OperationalError` was produced in these cases."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44839`: 在用户定义函数中引发的 :class:`MemoryError` 现在会在 :mod:`sqlite3` 中产生一个 "
"``MemoryError``。:class:`OverflowError` 现在会被转换为 "
":class:`~sqlite3.DataError`。以前在这些情况下会产生 :class:`~sqlite3.OperationalError`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8948
msgid ""
":issue:`44822`: :mod:`sqlite3` user-defined functions and aggregators "
"returning :class:`strings <str>` with embedded NUL characters are no longer "
"truncated. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44822`: :mod:`sqlite3` 用户定义的函数和聚合器返回带有嵌入 NUL 字符的 :class:`strings "
"<str>` 不再被截断。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8952
msgid ""
":issue:`44801`: Ensure that the :class:`~typing.ParamSpec` variable in "
"Callable can only be substituted with a parameters expression (a list of "
"types, an ellipsis, ParamSpec or Concatenate)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44801`: 确保 Callable 中的 :class:`~typing.ParamSpec` "
"变量只能被参数表达式（类型列表、省略号、ParamSpec 或 Concatenate）替换。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8956
msgid ""
":issue:`44806`: Non-protocol subclasses of :class:`typing.Protocol` ignore "
"now the ``__init__`` method inherited from protocol base classes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44806`: :class:`typing.Protocol` 的非协议子类现在会忽略从协议基类继承的 ``__init__`` "
"方法。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8959
msgid ""
":issue:`27275`: :meth:`collections.OrderedDict.popitem` and "
":meth:`collections.OrderedDict.pop` no longer call ``__getitem__`` and "
"``__delitem__`` methods of the OrderedDict subclasses."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27275`: :meth:`collections.OrderedDict.popitem` 和 "
":meth:`collections.OrderedDict.pop` 不再调用 OrderedDict 子类的 ``__getitem__`` 和 "
"``__delitem__`` 方法。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8963
msgid ""
":issue:`44793`: Fix checking the number of arguments when subscribe a "
"generic type with ``ParamSpec`` parameter."
msgstr ":issue:`44793`: 修复在订阅带有 ``ParamSpec`` 参数的泛型类型时检查参数数量的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8966
msgid ""
":issue:`44784`: In importlib.metadata tests, override warnings behavior "
"under expected DeprecationWarnings (importlib_metadata 4.6.3)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44784`: 在 importlib.metadata 测试中，覆盖在预期的 DeprecationWarnings "
"下的警告行为（importlib_metadata 4.6.3）。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8969
msgid ""
":issue:`44667`: The :func:`tokenize.tokenize` doesn't incorrectly generate a"
" ``NEWLINE`` token if the source doesn't end with a new line character but "
"the last line is a comment, as the function is already generating a ``NL`` "
"token. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`44667`: :func:`tokenize.tokenize` 不会在源代码不以换行符结束但最后一行是注释时错误地生成 "
"``NEWLINE`` 令牌，因为该函数已经生成了一个 ``NL`` 令牌。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8974
msgid ""
":issue:`44771`: Added ``importlib.simple`` module implementing adapters from"
" a low-level resources reader interface to a ``TraversableResources`` "
"interface. Legacy API (``path``, ``contents``, ...) is now supported "
"entirely by the ``.files()`` API with a compatibility shim supplied for "
"resource loaders without that functionality. Feature parity with "
"``importlib_resources`` 5.2."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44771`: 添加了 ``importlib.simple`` 模块，实现了从低级资源读取器接口到 "
"``TraversableResources`` 接口的适配器。旧版 API（``path``、``contents`` 等）现在完全由 "
"``.files()`` API 支持，并为不具备该功能的资源加载器提供了兼容性垫片。与 ``importlib_resources`` 5.2 "
"功能对等。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8981
msgid ""
":issue:`44752`: :mod:`rcompleter` does not call :func:`getattr` on "
":class:`property` objects to avoid the side-effect of  evaluating the "
"corresponding method."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44752`: :mod:`rcompleter` 不在 :class:`property` 对象上调用 :func:`getattr`"
" 以避免评估相应方法的副作用。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8985
msgid ""
":issue:`44747`: Refactor usage of ``sys._getframe`` in ``typing`` module. "
"Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44747`: 重构 ``typing`` 模块中 ``sys._getframe`` 的使用。补丁由 Yurii Karabas "
"提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8988
msgid ""
":issue:`42378`: Fixes the issue with log file being overwritten when "
":class:`logging.FileHandler` is used in :mod:`atexit` with *filemode* set to"
" ``'w'``. Note this will cause the message in *atexit* not being logged if "
"the log stream is already closed due to shutdown of logging."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42378`: 修复了当 :class:`logging.FileHandler` 在 :mod:`atexit` 中使用且 "
"*filemode* 设置为 ``'w'`` 时日志文件被覆盖的问题。注意，如果日志流由于日志关闭已经关闭，这将导致 *atexit* "
"中的消息不被记录。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8993
msgid ""
":issue:`44720`: ``weakref.proxy`` objects referencing non-iterators now "
"raise ``TypeError`` rather than dereferencing the null ``tp_iternext`` slot "
"and crashing."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44720`: ``weakref.proxy`` 对象引用非迭代器现在会引发 ``TypeError``，而不是解引用空的 "
"``tp_iternext`` 槽并崩溃。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8997
msgid ""
":issue:`44704`: The implementation of ``collections.abc.Set._hash()`` now "
"matches that of ``frozenset.__hash__()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44704`: ``collections.abc.Set._hash()`` 的实现现在与 "
"``frozenset.__hash__()`` 的实现匹配。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9000
msgid ""
":issue:`44666`: Fixed issue in :func:`compileall.compile_file` when "
"``sys.stdout`` is redirected. Patch by Stefan Hölzl."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44666`: 修复了当 ``sys.stdout`` 被重定向时 :func:`compileall.compile_file` "
"的问题。由 Stefan Hölzl 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9003
msgid ""
":issue:`44688`: :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_collation` now accepts non-"
"ASCII collation names. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44688`: :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_collation` 现在接受非 ASCII "
"排序名称。补丁由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9006
msgid ""
":issue:`44690`: Adopt *binacii.a2b_base64*'s strict mode in "
"*base64.b64decode*."
msgstr ":issue:`44690`: 在 *base64.b64decode* 中采用 *binacii.a2b_base64* 的严格模式。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9008
msgid ""
":issue:`42854`: Fixed a bug in the :mod:`_ssl` module that was throwing "
":exc:`OverflowError` when using :meth:`_ssl._SSLSocket.write` and "
":meth:`_ssl._SSLSocket.read` for a big value of the ``len`` parameter. Patch"
" by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9013
msgid ""
":issue:`44686`: Replace ``unittest.mock._importer`` with "
"``pkgutil.resolve_name``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44686`: 使用 ``pkgutil.resolve_name`` 替换 ``unittest.mock._importer``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9016
msgid ""
":issue:`44353`: Make ``NewType.__call__`` faster by implementing it in C. "
"Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44353`: 通过在C中实现 ``NewType.__call__`` 来提高其速度。由Yurii Karabas提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9019
msgid ""
":issue:`44682`: Change the :mod:`pdb` *commands* directive to disallow "
"setting commands for an invalid breakpoint and to display an appropriate "
"error."
msgstr ":issue:`44682`: 修改 :mod:`pdb` 的 *commands* 指令，禁止为无效断点设置命令，并显示适当的错误。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9022
msgid ""
":issue:`44353`: Refactor ``typing.NewType`` from function into callable "
"class. Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ":issue:`44353`: 将 ``typing.NewType`` 从函数重构为可调用类。由Yurii Karabas提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9025
msgid ""
":issue:`44678`: Added a separate error message for discontinuous padding in "
"*binascii.a2b_base64* strict mode."
msgstr ":issue:`44678`: 在 *binascii.a2b_base64* 的严格模式下，为不连续的填充添加了单独的错误消息。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9028
msgid ""
":issue:`44524`: Add missing ``__name__`` and ``__qualname__`` attributes to "
"``typing`` module classes. Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44524`: 为 ``typing`` 模块类添加缺失的 ``__name__`` 和 ``__qualname__`` "
"属性。补丁由Yurii Karabas提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9031
msgid ""
":issue:`40897`: Give priority to using the current class constructor in "
":func:`inspect.signature`. Patch by Weipeng Hong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40897`: 在 :func:`inspect.signature` 中优先使用当前类的构造函数。由Weipeng Hong提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9034
msgid ""
":issue:`44638`: Add a reference to the zipp project and hint as to how to "
"use it."
msgstr ":issue:`44638`: 添加对zipp项目的引用以及如何使用它的提示。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9037
msgid ""
":issue:`44648`: Fixed wrong error being thrown by :func:`inspect.getsource` "
"when examining a class in the interactive session. Instead of "
":exc:`TypeError`, it should be :exc:`OSError` with appropriate error "
"message."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44648`: 修复了 :func:`inspect.getsource` 在检查交互式会话中的类时抛出的错误。应该是带有适当错误消息的"
" :exc:`OSError`，而不是 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9042
msgid ""
":issue:`44608`: Fix memory leak in :func:`_tkinter._flatten` if it is called"
" with a sequence or set, but not list or tuple."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9045
msgid ""
":issue:`44594`: Fix an edge case of :class:`ExitStack` and "
":class:`AsyncExitStack` exception chaining.  They will now match ``with`` "
"block behavior when ``__context__`` is explicitly set to ``None`` when the "
"exception is in flight."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44594`: 修复了 :class:`ExitStack` 和 :class:`AsyncExitStack` "
"异常链的一个边缘情况。当异常在传播过程中 ``__context__`` 被显式设置为 ``None`` 时，它们现在将匹配 ``with`` "
"块的行为。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9050
msgid ""
":issue:`42799`: In :mod:`fnmatch`, the cache size for compiled regex "
"patterns (:func:`functools.lru_cache`) was bumped up from 256 to 32768, "
"affecting functions: :func:`fnmatch.fnmatch`, :func:`fnmatch.fnmatchcase`, "
":func:`fnmatch.filter`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42799`: 在 :mod:`fnmatch` "
"中，编译的正则表达式模式的缓存大小（:func:`functools.lru_cache`）从 256 增加到 "
"32768，影响的函数包括：:func:`fnmatch.fnmatch`、:func:`fnmatch.fnmatchcase`、:func:`fnmatch.filter`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9055
msgid ""
":issue:`41928`: Update :func:`shutil.copyfile` to raise "
":exc:`FileNotFoundError` instead of confusing :exc:`IsADirectoryError` when "
"a path ending with a :const:`os.path.sep` does not exist; "
":func:`shutil.copy` and :func:`shutil.copy2` are also affected."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41928`: 更新 :func:`shutil.copyfile`，当以 :const:`os.path.sep` "
"结尾的路径不存在时，抛出 :exc:`FileNotFoundError` 而不是混淆的 "
":exc:`IsADirectoryError`；:func:`shutil.copy` 和 :func:`shutil.copy2` 也会受到影响。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9060
msgid ""
":issue:`44569`: Added the :func:`StackSummary.format_frame` function in "
":mod:`traceback`. This allows users to customize the way individual lines "
"are formatted in tracebacks without re-implementing logic to handle "
"recursive tracebacks."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44569`: 在 :mod:`traceback` 中添加了 :func:`StackSummary.format_frame` "
"函数。这使得用户能够自定义回溯中单行的格式化方式，而无需重新实现处理递归回溯的逻辑。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9065
msgid ""
":issue:`44566`: handle StopIteration subclass raised from "
"@contextlib.contextmanager generator"
msgstr ""
":issue:`44566`: 处理由 @contextlib.contextmanager 生成器引发的 StopIteration 子类。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9068
msgid ""
":issue:`44558`: Make the implementation consistency of "
":func:`~operator.indexOf` between C and Python versions. Patch by Donghee "
"Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44558`: 使 :func:`~operator.indexOf` 在 C 和 Python 版本中的实现保持一致。由 "
"Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9072
msgid ""
":issue:`41249`: Fixes ``TypedDict`` to work with ``typing.get_type_hints()``"
" and postponed evaluation of annotations across modules."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41249`: 修正 ``TypedDict`` 以使其能与 ``typing.get_type_hints()`` "
"和跨模块的注解延迟求值一起工作。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9075
msgid ""
":issue:`44554`: Refactor argument processing in :func:`pdb.main` to simplify"
" detection of errors in input loading and clarify behavior around module or "
"script invocation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44554`: 重构 :func:`pdb.main` 中的参数处理，以简化输入加载错误的检测，并澄清模块或脚本调用时的行为。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9079
msgid ""
":issue:`34798`: Break up paragraph about :class:`pprint.PrettyPrinter` "
"construction parameters to make it easier to read."
msgstr ":issue:`34798`: 拆分关于 :class:`pprint.PrettyPrinter` 构造参数的段落，使其更易于阅读。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9082
msgid ""
":issue:`44539`: Added support for recognizing JPEG files without JFIF or "
"Exif markers."
msgstr ":issue:`44539`: 添加了对识别没有 JFIF 或 Exif 标记的 JPEG 文件的支持。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9085
msgid ""
":issue:`44461`: Fix bug with :mod:`pdb`'s handling of import error due to a "
"package which does not have a ``__main__`` module"
msgstr ":issue:`44461`: 修复 :mod:`pdb` 处理由于包没有 ``__main__`` 模块而导致的导入错误的 bug。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9088
msgid ""
":issue:`43625`: Fix a bug in the detection of CSV file headers by "
":meth:`csv.Sniffer.has_header` and improve documentation of same."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43625`: 修复 :meth:`csv.Sniffer.has_header` 检测 CSV 文件头时的 bug，并改进相关文档。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9091
msgid ":issue:`44516`: Update vendored pip to 21.1.3"
msgstr ":issue:`44516`: 将捆绑的 pip 更新至 21.1.3 版本。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9093
msgid ""
":issue:`42892`: Fixed an exception thrown while parsing a malformed "
"multipart email by :class:`email.message.EmailMessage`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42892`: 修复 :class:`email.message.EmailMessage` 在解析格式错误的多部分邮件时抛出的异常。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9096
msgid ""
":issue:`44468`: :func:`typing.get_type_hints` now finds annotations in "
"classes and base classes with unexpected ``__module__``. Previously, it "
"skipped those MRO elements."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44468`: :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 现在可以在类和基类中查找带有意外 "
"``__module__`` 的注解。之前，它会跳过这些MRO元素。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9100
msgid ""
":issue:`44491`: Allow clearing the :mod:`sqlite3` authorizer callback by "
"passing :const:`None` to :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.set_authorizer`. Patch "
"by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44491`: 允许通过向 :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.set_authorizer` 传递 "
":const:`None` 来清除 :mod:`sqlite3` 授权器回调。由Erlend E. Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9104
msgid ""
":issue:`43977`: Set the proper :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_MAPPING` and "
":c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_SEQUENCE` flags for subclasses created before a parent "
"has been registered as a :class:`collections.abc.Mapping` or "
":class:`collections.abc.Sequence`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43977`: 对于在父类被注册为 :class:`collections.abc.Mapping` 或 "
":class:`collections.abc.Sequence` 之前创建的子类，设置正确的 "
":c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_MAPPING` 和 :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_SEQUENCE` 标志。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9109
msgid ""
":issue:`44482`: Fix very unlikely resource leak in :mod:`glob` in alternate "
"Python implementations."
msgstr ":issue:`44482`: 修复在替代Python实现中 :mod:`glob` 极不可能发生的资源泄漏。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9112
msgid ""
":issue:`44466`: The :mod:`faulthandler` module now detects if a fatal error "
"occurs during a garbage collector collection. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44466`: :mod:`faulthandler` 模块现在能检测到在垃圾回收器收集期间是否发生致命错误。由Victor "
"Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9115
msgid ""
":issue:`44471`: A :exc:`TypeError` is now raised instead of an "
":exc:`AttributeError` in :meth:`contextlib.ExitStack.enter_context` and "
":meth:`contextlib.AsyncExitStack.enter_async_context` for objects which do "
"not support the :term:`context manager` or :term:`asynchronous context "
"manager` protocols correspondingly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44471`: 在 :meth:`contextlib.ExitStack.enter_context` 和 "
":meth:`contextlib.AsyncExitStack.enter_async_context` 中，对于不支持相应 "
":term:`context manager` 或 :term:`asynchronous context manager` 协议的对象，现在会引发 "
":exc:`TypeError` 而不是 :exc:`AttributeError`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9121
msgid ""
":issue:`44404`: :mod:`tkinter`'s ``after()`` method now supports callables "
"without the ``__name__`` attribute."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44404`: :mod:`tkinter` 的 ``after()`` 方法现在支持没有 ``__name__`` 属性的可调用对象。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9124
msgid ""
":issue:`41546`: Make :mod:`pprint` (like the builtin ``print``) not attempt "
"to write to ``stdout`` when it is ``None``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41546`: 使 :mod:`pprint` (像内置的 ``print`` 一样) 当 ``stdout`` 为 ``None`` "
"时不尝试写入。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9127
msgid ""
":issue:`44458`: ``BUFFER_BLOCK_SIZE`` is now declared static, to avoid "
"linking collisions when bz2, lmza or zlib are statically linked."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44458`: ``BUFFER_BLOCK_SIZE`` "
"现在被声明为静态的，以避免在bz2、lmza或zlib被静态链接时发生链接冲突。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9130
msgid ""
":issue:`44464`: Remove exception for flake8 in deprecated importlib.metadata"
" interfaces. Sync with importlib_metadata 4.6."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44464`: 在弃用的importlib.metadata接口中移除对flake8的异常。与importlib_metadata "
"4.6同步。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9133
msgid ""
":issue:`44446`: Take into account that ``lineno`` might be ``None`` in "
":class:`traceback.FrameSummary`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44446`: 在 :class:`traceback.FrameSummary` 中考虑 ``lineno`` 可能为 "
"``None`` 的情况。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9136
msgid ""
":issue:`44439`: Fix in :meth:`bz2.BZ2File.write` / "
":meth:`lzma.LZMAFile.write` methods, when the input data is an object that "
"supports the buffer protocol, the file length may be wrong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44439`: 修复 :meth:`bz2.BZ2File.write` / :meth:`lzma.LZMAFile.write` "
"方法，当输入数据是支持缓冲协议的对象时，文件长度可能错误的问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9140
msgid ""
":issue:`44434`: _thread.start_new_thread() no longer calls "
"PyThread_exit_thread() explicitly at the thread exit, the call was "
"redundant. On Linux with the glibc, pthread_exit() aborts the whole process "
"if dlopen() fails to open libgcc_s.so file (ex: EMFILE error). Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44434`: _thread.start_new_thread() 不再在线程退出时显式调用 "
"PyThread_exit_thread()，该调用是多余的。在 Linux 上使用 glibc 时，如果 dlopen() 无法打开 "
"libgcc_s.so 文件（例如：EMFILE 错误），pthread_exit() 会中止整个进程。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9146
msgid ""
":issue:`42972`: The _thread.RLock type now fully implement the GC protocol: "
"add a traverse function and the :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_GC` flag. Patch by"
" Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42972`: _thread.RLock 类型现在完全实现了 GC 协议：添加了一个遍历函数和 "
":c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_GC` 标志。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9150
msgid ""
":issue:`44422`: The :func:`threading.enumerate` function now uses a "
"reentrant lock to prevent a hang on reentrant call. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44422`: :func:`threading.enumerate` 函数现在使用可重入锁以防止在可重入调用上挂起。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9153
msgid ""
":issue:`38291`: Importing typing.io or typing.re now prints a "
"``DeprecationWarning``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38291`: 导入 typing.io 或 typing.re 现在会打印一个 ``DeprecationWarning``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9156
msgid ""
":issue:`37880`: argparse actions store_const and append_const each receive a"
" default value of None when the ``const`` kwarg is not provided. Previously,"
" this raised a :exc:`TypeError`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9160
msgid ":issue:`44389`: Fix deprecation of :data:`ssl.OP_NO_TLSv1_3`"
msgstr ":issue:`44389`: 修复 :data:`ssl.OP_NO_TLSv1_3` 的弃用问题"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9162
msgid ""
":issue:`27827`: :meth:`pathlib.PureWindowsPath.is_reserved` now identifies a"
" greater range of reserved filenames, including those with trailing spaces "
"or colons."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27827`: :meth:`pathlib.PureWindowsPath.is_reserved` "
"现在能识别更多保留文件名，包括那些带有尾部空格或冒号的文件名。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9166
msgid ""
":issue:`44395`: Fix :meth:`~email.message.MIMEPart.as_string` to pass "
"unixfrom properly. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44395`: 修复 :meth:`~email.message.MIMEPart.as_string` 以正确传递 "
"unixfrom。补丁由 Donghee Na 提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9169
msgid ""
":issue:`34266`: Handle exceptions from parsing the arg of :mod:`pdb`'s "
"run/restart command."
msgstr ":issue:`34266`: 处理解析 :mod:`pdb` 的 run/restart 命令参数时的异常。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9172
msgid ""
":issue:`44362`: Improve :mod:`ssl` module's deprecation messages, error "
"reporting, and documentation for deprecations."
msgstr ":issue:`44362`: 改进 :mod:`ssl` 模块的弃用消息、错误报告和弃用文档。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9175
msgid ":issue:`44342`: [Enum] Change pickling from by-value to by-name."
msgstr ":issue:`44342`: [Enum] 将 pickle 从按值改为按名称。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9177
msgid ""
":issue:`44356`: [Enum] Allow multiple data-type mixins if they are all the "
"same."
msgstr ":issue:`44356`: [Enum] 如果所有数据类型混合都是相同的，则允许多个数据类型混合。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9180
msgid ""
":issue:`44351`: Restore back :func:`parse_makefile` in "
":mod:`distutils.sysconfig` because it behaves differently than the similar "
"implementation in :mod:`sysconfig`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9184
msgid ""
":issue:`35800`: :class:`smtpd.MailmanProxy` is now removed as it is unusable"
" without an external module, ``mailman``. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9187
msgid ""
":issue:`44357`: Added a function that returns cube root of the given number "
":func:`math.cbrt`"
msgstr ":issue:`44357`: 添加了一个返回给定数字的立方根的函数 :func:`math.cbrt`"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9190
msgid ""
":issue:`44339`: Change ``math.pow(±0.0, -math.inf)`` to return ``inf`` "
"instead of raising ``ValueError``. This brings the special-case handling of "
"``math.pow`` into compliance with the IEEE 754 standard."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44339`: 将 ``math.pow(±0.0, -math.inf)`` 的返回值从抛出 ``ValueError`` 改为返回 "
"``inf``。这使得 ``math.pow`` 的特殊情况处理符合 IEEE 754 标准。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9194
msgid ""
":issue:`44242`: Remove missing flag check from Enum creation and move into a"
" ``verify`` decorator."
msgstr ":issue:`44242`: 从 Enum 创建中移除缺失标志检查，并将其移至 ``verify`` 装饰器中。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9197
msgid ""
":issue:`44246`: In ``importlib.metadata``, restore compatibility in the "
"result from ``Distribution.entry_points`` (``EntryPoints``) to honor "
"expectations in older implementations and issuing deprecation warnings for "
"these cases: A. ``EntryPoints`` objects are once again mutable, allowing   "
"for ``sort()`` and other list-based mutation operations.   Avoid deprecation"
" warnings by casting to a   mutable sequence (e.g. "
"``list(dist.entry_points).sort()``). B. ``EntryPoints`` results once again "
"allow   for access by index. To avoid deprecation warnings,   cast the "
"result to a Sequence first   (e.g. ``tuple(dist.entry_points)[0]``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44246`: 在 ``importlib.metadata`` 中，恢复 ``Distribution.entry_points`` "
"(``EntryPoints``) 结果的兼容性，以符合旧实现的期望，并对以下情况发出弃用警告：A. ``EntryPoints`` 对象再次可变，允许"
" ``sort()`` 和其他基于列表的变异操作。通过转换为可变序列（例如 "
"``list(dist.entry_points).sort()``）避免弃用警告。B. ``EntryPoints`` "
"结果再次允许通过索引访问。为避免弃用警告，首先将结果转换为 Sequence（例如 ``tuple(dist.entry_points)[0]``）。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9207
msgid ""
":issue:`44246`: In importlib.metadata.entry_points, de-duplication of "
"distributions no longer requires loading the full metadata for "
"PathDistribution objects, improving entry point loading performance by ~10x."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44246`: 在 importlib.metadata.entry_points 中，去重分布不再需要为 "
"PathDistribution 对象加载完整的元数据，将入口点加载性能提高了约10倍。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9212
msgid ""
":issue:`43858`: Added a function that returns a copy of a dict of logging "
"levels: :func:`logging.getLevelNamesMapping`"
msgstr ""
":issue:`43858`: 添加了一个返回日志级别字典副本的函数：:func:`logging.getLevelNamesMapping`"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9215
msgid ""
":issue:`44260`: The :class:`random.Random` constructor no longer reads "
"system entropy without need."
msgstr ":issue:`44260`: :class:`random.Random` 构造函数不再无谓地读取系统熵。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9218
msgid ""
":issue:`44254`: On Mac, give turtledemo button text a color that works on "
"both light or dark background.  Programmers cannot control the latter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44254`: 在 Mac 上，为 turtledemo 按钮文本提供一种在亮或暗背景下都能工作的颜色。程序员无法控制后者。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9221
msgid ""
":issue:`44258`: Support PEP 515 for Fraction's initialization from string."
msgstr ":issue:`44258`: 支持从字符串初始化 Fraction 的 PEP 515。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9223
msgid ""
":issue:`44235`: Remove deprecated functions in the :mod:`gettext`. Patch by "
"Donghee Na."
msgstr ":issue:`44235`: 移除 :mod:`gettext` 中已弃用的函数。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9226
msgid ""
":issue:`38693`: Prefer f-strings to ``.format`` in importlib.resources."
msgstr ":issue:`38693`: 在 importlib.resources 中优先使用 f-strings 而非 ``.format``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9228
msgid ":issue:`33693`: Importlib.metadata now prefers f-strings to .format."
msgstr ":issue:`33693`: Importlib.metadata 现在优先使用 f-strings 而非 .format。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9230
msgid ""
":issue:`44241`: Incorporate minor tweaks from importlib_metadata 4.1: "
"SimplePath protocol, support for Metadata 2.2."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44241`: 从 importlib_metadata 4.1 中引入小调整：SimplePath 协议，支持 Metadata "
"2.2。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9233
msgid ""
":issue:`43216`: Remove the :func:`@asyncio.coroutine <asyncio.coroutine>` "
":term:`decorator` enabling legacy generator-based coroutines to be "
"compatible with async/await code; remove "
":class:`asyncio.coroutines.CoroWrapper` used for wrapping legacy coroutine "
"objects in the debug mode. The decorator has been deprecated since Python "
"3.8 and the removal was initially scheduled for Python 3.10. Patch by Illia "
"Volochii."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43216`: 移除 :func:`@asyncio.coroutine <asyncio.coroutine>` "
":term:`decorator`，该装饰器使得基于生成器的旧式协程能够与async/await代码兼容；移除 "
":class:`asyncio.coroutines.CoroWrapper`，该包装器用于在调试模式下包装旧式协程对象。此装饰器自Python "
"3.8起已被弃用，原计划在Python 3.10中移除。由Illia Volochii提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9241
msgid ":issue:`44210`: Make importlib.metadata._meta.PackageMetadata public."
msgstr ":issue:`44210`: 将importlib.metadata._meta.PackageMetadata公开。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9243
msgid ""
":issue:`43643`: Declare readers.MultiplexedPath.name as a property per the "
"spec."
msgstr ":issue:`43643`: 根据规范，将readers.MultiplexedPath.name声明为属性。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9246
msgid ""
":issue:`27334`: The :mod:`sqlite3` context manager now performs a rollback "
"(thus releasing the database lock) if commit failed.  Patch by Luca Citi and"
" Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27334`: :mod:`sqlite3` 上下文管理器现在在提交失败时执行回滚（从而释放数据库锁）。补丁由Luca "
"Citi和Erlend E. Aasland提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9250
msgid ""
":issue:`4928`: Documented existing behavior on POSIX: NamedTemporaryFiles "
"are not deleted when creating process is killed with SIGKILL"
msgstr ""
":issue:`4928`: 记录了POSIX上的现有行为：当创建进程被SIGKILL杀死时，NamedTemporaryFiles不会被删除。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9253
msgid ""
":issue:`44154`: Optimize :class:`fractions.Fraction` pickling for large "
"components."
msgstr ":issue:`44154`: 优化 :class:`fractions.Fraction` 对大型组件的pickling操作。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9256
msgid ""
":issue:`33433`: For IPv4 mapped IPv6 addresses (:rfc:`4291` Section "
"2.5.5.2), the :mod:`ipaddress.IPv6Address.is_private` check is deferred to "
"the mapped IPv4 address. This solves a bug where public mapped IPv4 "
"addresses were considered private by the IPv6 check."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33433`: 对于IPv4映射的IPv6地址（:rfc:`4291` "
"第2.5.5.2节），:mod:`ipaddress.IPv6Address.is_private` "
"检查被推迟到映射的IPv4地址。这解决了一个bug，其中公共映射的IPv4地址被IPv6检查视为私有地址。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9261
msgid ":issue:`44150`: Add optional *weights* argument to statistics.fmean()."
msgstr ":issue:`44150`: 向statistics.fmean()添加了可选的 *weights* 参数。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9263
msgid ""
":issue:`44142`: :func:`ast.unparse` will now drop the redundant parentheses "
"when tuples used as assignment targets (e.g in for loops)."
msgstr ":issue:`44142`: :func:`ast.unparse` 现在将在元组用作赋值目标时（例如在for循环中）删除冗余的括号。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9266
msgid ""
":issue:`44145`: :mod:`hmac` computations were not releasing the GIL while "
"calling the OpenSSL ``HMAC_Update`` C API (a new feature in 3.9).  This "
"unintentionally prevented parallel computation as other :mod:`hashlib` "
"algorithms support."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44145`: :mod:`hmac` 计算在调用OpenSSL ``HMAC_Update`` C "
"API时（3.9中的新功能）没有释放GIL。这无意中阻止了并行计算，而其他 :mod:`hashlib` 算法支持并行计算。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9271
msgid ""
":issue:`44095`: :class:`zipfile.Path` now supports "
":attr:`zipfile.Path.stem`, :attr:`zipfile.Path.suffixes`, and "
":attr:`zipfile.Path.suffix` attributes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44095`: :class:`zipfile.Path` 现在支持 "
":attr:`zipfile.Path.stem`、:attr:`zipfile.Path.suffixes` 和 "
":attr:`zipfile.Path.suffix` 属性。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9274
msgid ""
":issue:`44077`: It's now possible to receive the type of service (ToS), "
"a.k.a. differentiated services (DS), a.k.a. differentiated services code "
"point (DSCP) and explicit congestion notification (ECN) IP header fields "
"with ``socket.IP_RECVTOS``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44077`: 现在可以通过 ``socket.IP_RECVTOS`` "
"接收服务类型（ToS），也称为区分服务（DS），或区分服务代码点（DSCP）和显式拥塞通知（ECN）IP头字段。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9279
msgid ""
":issue:`37788`: Fix a reference leak when a Thread object is never joined."
msgstr ":issue:`37788`: 修复了一个当 Thread 对象从未被 join 时的引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9281
msgid ""
":issue:`38908`: Subclasses of ``typing.Protocol`` which only have data "
"variables declared will now raise a ``TypeError`` when checked with "
"``isinstance`` unless they are decorated with :func:`runtime_checkable`. "
"Previously, these checks passed silently. Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38908`: 只有数据变量声明的 ``typing.Protocol`` 子类现在在被 ``isinstance`` 检查时会抛出 "
"``TypeError``，除非它们被 :func:`runtime_checkable` 装饰。之前，这些检查会静默通过。由 Yurii "
"Karabas 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9286
msgid ""
":issue:`44098`: ``typing.ParamSpec`` will no longer be found in the "
"``__parameters__`` of most :mod:`typing` generics except in valid use "
"locations specified by :pep:`612`. This prevents incorrect usage like "
"``typing.List[P][int]``. This change means incorrect usage which may have "
"passed silently in 3.10 beta 1 and earlier will now error."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44098`: ``typing.ParamSpec`` 将不再出现在大多数 :mod:`typing` 泛型的 "
"``__parameters__`` 中，除非是在 :pep:`612` 指定的有效使用位置。这防止了像 ``typing.List[P][int]``"
" 这样的错误用法。这一变化意味着在 3.10 beta 1 及更早版本中可能静默通过的错误用法现在会报错。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9292
msgid ""
":issue:`44089`: Allow subclassing ``csv.Error`` in 3.10 (it was allowed in "
"3.9 and earlier but was disallowed in early versions of 3.10)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44089`: 在 3.10 中允许继承 ``csv.Error``（在 3.9 及更早版本中是被允许的，但在 3.10 "
"的早期版本中被禁止）。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9295
msgid ""
":issue:`44081`: :func:`ast.unparse` now doesn't use redundant spaces to "
"separate ``lambda`` and the ``:`` if there are no parameters."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44081`: :func:`ast.unparse` 现在如果 ``lambda`` 没有参数，不会使用多余的空格来分隔 "
"``lambda`` 和 ``:``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9298
msgid ""
":issue:`44061`: Fix regression in previous release when calling "
":func:`pkgutil.iter_modules` with a list of :class:`pathlib.Path` objects"
msgstr ""
":issue:`44061`: 修复了之前版本中当使用 :class:`pathlib.Path` 对象的列表调用 "
":func:`pkgutil.iter_modules` 时的回归问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9301
msgid ""
":issue:`44059`: Register the SerenityOS Browser in the :mod:`webbrowser` "
"module."
msgstr ":issue:`44059`: 在 :mod:`webbrowser` 模块中注册 SerenityOS 浏览器。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9304
msgid ""
":issue:`36515`: The :mod:`hashlib` module no longer does unaligned memory "
"accesses when compiled for ARM platforms."
msgstr ":issue:`36515`: 当为 ARM 平台编译时，:mod:`hashlib` 模块不再进行非对齐的内存访问。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:9307
msgid ""
