msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:10207
msgid ""
":issue:`43682`: Static methods (:func:`@staticmethod <staticmethod>`) are "
"now callable as regular functions. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:10210
msgid ""
":issue:`42609`: Prevented crashes in the AST validator and optimizer when "
