#: ../../../build/NEWS:21594
msgid ""
":issue:`34052`: :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_aggregate`, "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_function`, "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.set_authorizer`, "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.set_progress_handler` methods raises TypeError "
"when unhashable objects are passed as callable. These methods now don't pass"
" such objects to SQLite API. Previous behavior could lead to segfaults. "
"Patch by Sergey Fedoseev."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34052`: :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_aggregate`, "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_function`, "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.set_authorizer`, "
":meth:`sqlite3.Connection.set_progress_handler` 方法在传递不可哈希对象作为可调用对象时抛出 "
"TypeError。这些方法现在不会将这样的对象传递给 SQLite API。之前的行为可能导致段错误。由 Sergey Fedoseev 提供补丁。"

