msgstr ":issue:`33905`: 为idlelib.stackview.StackBrowser添加测试。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23092
msgid ""
":issue:`33924`: Change mainmenu.menudefs key 'windows' to 'window'. Every "
"other menudef key is lowercase version of main menu entry."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33924`: "
"将mainmenu.menudefs键'windows'更改为'window'。每个其他menudef键都是主菜单项的小写版本。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23095
msgid ""
":issue:`33906`: Rename idlelib.windows as window Match Window on the main "
"menu and remove last plural module name."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33906`: 将idlelib.windows重命名为window，以匹配主菜单上的Window，并移除最后一个复数模块名称。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23098
msgid ""
":issue:`33917`: Fix and document idlelib/idle_test/template.py. The revised "
"file compiles, runs, and tests OK.  idle_test/README.txt explains how to use"
" it to create new IDLE test files."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33917`: "
"修复并记录idlelib/idle_test/template.py。修订后的文件编译、运行和测试均正常。idle_test/README.txt说明了如何使用它来创建新的IDLE测试文件。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23102
msgid ""
":issue:`33904`: IDLE: In rstrip, rename class RstripExtension as Rstrip"
msgstr ":issue:`33904`: IDLE：在rstrip中，将类RstripExtension重命名为Rstrip"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23104
msgid ""
":issue:`33907`: For consistency and clarity, rename an IDLE module and "
"classes. Module calltips and its class CallTips are now calltip and Calltip."
" In module calltip_w, class CallTip is now CalltipWindow."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33907`: "
"为了保持一致性和清晰度，重命名一个IDLE模块和类。模块calltips及其类CallTips现在更名为calltip和Calltip。在模块calltip_w中，类CallTip现在更名为CalltipWindow。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23108
msgid ":issue:`33856`: Add \"help\" in the welcome message of IDLE"
msgstr ":issue:`33856`: 在IDLE的欢迎消息中添加“帮助”"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23110
msgid ""
":issue:`33839`: IDLE: refactor ToolTip and CallTip and add documentation and"
" tests"
msgstr ":issue:`33839`: IDLE：重构ToolTip和CallTip并添加文档和测试"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23113
msgid ""
":issue:`33855`: Minimally test all IDLE modules. Add missing files, import "
"module, instantiate classes, and check coverage. Check existing files."
msgstr ":issue:`33855`: 对所有IDLE模块进行最小化测试。添加缺失的文件，导入模块，实例化类，并检查覆盖率。检查现有文件。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23116 ../../../build/NEWS:23408
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28138
msgid ""
":issue:`33656`: On Windows, add API call saying that tk scales for DPI. On "
"Windows 8.1+ or 10, with DPI compatibility properties of the Python binary "
"unchanged, and a monitor resolution greater than 96 DPI, this should make "
"text and lines sharper.  It should otherwise have no effect."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33656`: 在Windows上，添加API调用表明tk针对DPI进行缩放。在Windows "
"8.1+或10上，Python二进制文件的DPI兼容性属性未更改，且显示器分辨率大于96 DPI时，这应使文本和线条更清晰。否则应无影响。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23121 ../../../build/NEWS:23413
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28143
msgid ""
":issue:`33768`: Clicking on a context line moves that line to the top of the"
" editor window."
msgstr ":issue:`33768`: 点击上下文行将该行移动到编辑器窗口的顶部。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23124 ../../../build/NEWS:23416
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28146
msgid ""
":issue:`33763`: IDLE: Use read-only text widget for code context instead of "
"label widget."
msgstr ":issue:`33763`: IDLE：使用只读文本小部件代替标签小部件作为代码上下文。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23127 ../../../build/NEWS:23419
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28149
msgid ""
":issue:`33664`: Scroll IDLE editor text by lines. Previously, the mouse "
"wheel and scrollbar slider moved text by a fixed number of pixels, resulting"
" in partial lines at the top of the editor box.  The change also applies to "
"the shell and grep output windows, but not to read-only text views."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33664`: "
"按行滚动IDLE编辑器文本。之前，鼠标滚轮和滚动条滑块以固定像素数移动文本，导致编辑器盒顶部出现部分行。此更改也适用于shell和grep输出窗口，但不适用于只读文本视图。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23132 ../../../build/NEWS:23424
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28154
msgid ""
":issue:`33679`: Enable theme-specific color configuration for Code Context. "
"Use the Highlights tab to see the setting for built-in themes or add "
"settings to custom themes."
msgstr ":issue:`33679`: 启用代码上下文的主题特定颜色配置。使用“高亮”选项卡查看内置主题的设置或为自定义主题添加设置。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23136 ../../../build/NEWS:23428
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28158
msgid ""
":issue:`33642`: Display up to maxlines non-blank lines for Code Context. If "
"there is no current context, show a single blank line."
msgstr ":issue:`33642`: 为代码上下文显示最多maxlines非空行。如果没有当前上下文，则显示单个空行。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23139 ../../../build/NEWS:23638
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28161
msgid ":issue:`33628`: IDLE: Cleanup codecontext.py and its test."
msgstr ":issue:`33628`: IDLE：清理codecontext.py及其测试。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23141 ../../../build/NEWS:23640
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28163
msgid ""
":issue:`33564`: IDLE's code context now recognizes async as a block opener."
msgstr ":issue:`33564`: IDLE的代码上下文现在能识别async作为一个块的开头。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23143 ../../../build/NEWS:23796
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28168
msgid ""
":issue:`21474`: Update word/identifier definition from ascii to unicode. In "
"text and entry boxes, this affects selection by double-click, movement "
"left/right by control-left/right, and deletion left/right by control-"
"BACKSPACE/DEL."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21474`: 将单词/标识符的定义从ASCII更新为Unicode。在文本和输入框中，这会影响通过双击选择、通过control-"
"left/right左右移动以及通过control-BACKSPACE/DEL左右删除。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23148 ../../../build/NEWS:23801
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28173
msgid ""
":issue:`33204`: IDLE: consistently color invalid string prefixes. A 'u' "
"string prefix cannot be paired with either 'r' or 'f'. Consistently color as"
" much of the prefix, starting at the right, as is valid. Revise and extend "
"colorizer test."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33204`: "
"IDLE：一致地着色无效的字符串前缀。'u'字符串前缀不能与'r'或'f'配对。从右边开始，尽可能多地着色有效的部分。修订并扩展颜色化器测试。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23153 ../../../build/NEWS:24012
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28492
msgid ""
":issue:`32984`: Set ``__file__`` while running a startup file.  Like Python,"
" IDLE optionally runs one startup file in the Shell window before presenting"
" the first interactive input prompt.  For IDLE, ``-s`` runs a file named in "
"environmental variable  :envvar:`IDLESTARTUP` or :envvar:`PYTHONSTARTUP`; "
"``-r file`` runs ``file``.  Python sets ``__file__`` to the startup file "
"name before running the file and unsets it before the first prompt.  IDLE "
"now does the same when run normally, without the ``-n`` option."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32984`: 在运行启动文件时设置 "
"``__file__``。与Python一样，IDLE在展示第一个交互式输入提示之前，可选地在Shell窗口中运行一个启动文件。对于IDLE，``-s``运行环境变量"
" :envvar:`IDLESTARTUP` 或 :envvar:`PYTHONSTARTUP` 中命名的文件；``-r file`` 运行 "
"``file``。Python在运行文件之前将 ``__file__`` 设置为启动文件名，并在第一个提示之前取消设置。IDLE现在在没有 ``-n``"
" 选项的情况下正常运行时也会这样做。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23162 ../../../build/NEWS:24021
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28501
msgid ""
":issue:`32940`: Simplify and rename StringTranslatePseudoMapping in pyparse."
msgstr ":issue:`32940`: 在pyparse中简化并重命名StringTranslatePseudoMapping。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23164 ../../../build/NEWS:24265
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28503
msgid ":issue:`32916`: Change ``str`` to ``code`` in pyparse."
msgstr ":issue:`32916`: 在pyparse中将 ``str`` 更改为 ``code``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23166 ../../../build/NEWS:24267
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28505
msgid ":issue:`32905`: Remove unused code in pyparse module."
msgstr ":issue:`32905`: 移除pyparse模块中未使用的代码。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23168 ../../../build/NEWS:24269
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28507
msgid ":issue:`32874`: Add tests for pyparse."
msgstr ":issue:`32874`: 为pyparse添加测试。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23170 ../../../build/NEWS:24271
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28509
msgid ""
":issue:`32837`: Using the system and place-dependent default encoding for "
"open() is a bad idea for IDLE's system and location-independent files."
msgstr ":issue:`32837`: 对于IDLE的系统和位置无关文件，使用系统和位置相关的默认编码对于open()来说是一个坏主意。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23173 ../../../build/NEWS:24274
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28512
msgid ""
":issue:`32826`: Add \"encoding=utf-8\" to open() in IDLE's test_help_about. "
"GUI test test_file_buttons() only looks at initial ascii-only lines, but "
"failed on systems where open() defaults to 'ascii' because readline() "
"internally reads and decodes far enough ahead to encounter a non-ascii "
"character in CREDITS.txt."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32826`: "
"在IDLE的test_help_about的open()中添加\"encoding=utf-8\"。GUI测试test_file_buttons()仅查看初始的ascii-"
"only行，但在open()默认为'ascii'的系统上失败，因为readline()内部读取和解码足够远，以在CREDITS.txt中遇到非ascii字符。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23179 ../../../build/NEWS:23642
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28178
msgid ":issue:`32831`: Add docstrings and tests for codecontext."
msgstr ":issue:`32831`: 为codecontext添加文档字符串和测试。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23181 ../../../build/NEWS:24280
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28518
msgid ""
":issue:`32765`: Update configdialog General tab docstring to add new widgets"
" to the widget list."
msgstr ":issue:`32765`: 更新configdialog General标签的文档字符串，将新部件添加到部件列表中。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23187
msgid ""
":issue:`35884`: Add a benchmark script for timing various ways to access "
"variables: ``Tools/scripts/var_access_benchmark.py``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35884`: "
"添加一个基准测试脚本，用于计时访问变量的各种方式：``Tools/scripts/var_access_benchmark.py``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23190
msgid ""
":issue:`34989`: python-gdb.py now handles errors on computing the line "
"number of a Python frame."
msgstr ":issue:`34989`: python-gdb.py 现在可以处理计算 Python 帧行号时的错误。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23193
msgid ""
":issue:`20260`: Argument Clinic now has non-bitwise unsigned int converters."
msgstr ":issue:`20260`: Argument Clinic 现在有了非位无符号整型转换器。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23195
msgid ""
":issue:`32962`: python-gdb now catches ``UnicodeDecodeError`` exceptions "
"when calling ``string()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32962`: python-gdb 现在在调用 ``string()`` 时会捕获 ``UnicodeDecodeError`` "
"异常。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23198
msgid ""
":issue:`32962`: python-gdb now catches ValueError on read_var(): when Python"
" has no debug symbols for example."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32962`: python-gdb 现在会在 read_var() 上捕获 ValueError：例如当 Python "
"没有调试符号时。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23201 ../../../build/NEWS:23809
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28183
msgid ""
":issue:`33189`: :program:`pygettext.py` now recognizes only literal strings "
"as docstrings and translatable strings, and rejects bytes literals and "
"f-string expressions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33189`: :program:`pygettext.py` 现在只识别字面字符串作为文档字符串和可翻译字符串，并拒绝字节字面量和 "
"f-string 表达式。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23205 ../../../build/NEWS:23813
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28187
msgid ""
":issue:`31920`: Fixed handling directories as arguments in the ``pygettext``"
" script. Based on patch by Oleg Krasnikov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31920`: 修复了 ``pygettext`` 脚本中将目录作为参数处理的问题。基于 Oleg Krasnikov 的补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23208 ../../../build/NEWS:23816
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28190
msgid ":issue:`29673`: Fix pystackv and pystack gdbinit macros."
msgstr ":issue:`29673`: 修复 pystackv 和 pystack gdbinit 宏。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23210
msgid ""
":issue:`25427`: Remove the pyvenv script in favor of ``python3 -m venv`` in "
"order to lower confusion as to what Python interpreter a virtual environment"
" will be created for."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25427`: 移除 pyvenv 脚本，转而使用 ``python3 -m venv``，以减少关于虚拟环境将为哪个 Python "
"解释器创建的混淆。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23214 ../../../build/NEWS:24026
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28192
msgid ""
":issue:`32885`: Add an ``-n`` flag for ``Tools/scripts/pathfix.py`` to "
"disable automatic backup creation (files with ``~`` suffix)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32885`: 为 ``Tools/scripts/pathfix.py`` 添加 ``-n`` 标志以禁用自动备份创建（带有 "
"``~`` 后缀的文件）。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23217 ../../../build/NEWS:24286
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28528
msgid ""
":issue:`32222`: Fix pygettext not extracting docstrings for functions with "
"type annotated arguments. Patch by Toby Harradine."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32222`: 修复 pygettext 不提取带有类型注释参数的函数的文档字符串的问题。由 Toby Harradine 提供的补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23220 ../../../build/NEWS:23818
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28195
msgid ""
":issue:`31583`: Fix 2to3 for using with --add-suffix option but without "
"--output-dir option for relative path to files in current directory."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31583`: 修复 2to3 在使用 --add-suffix 选项但没有 --output-dir "
"选项时对当前目录中文件的相对路径的处理。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23226
msgid ""
":issue:`35713`: The :c:func:`!PyByteArray_Init` and "
":c:func:`!PyByteArray_Fini` functions have been removed. They did nothing "
"since Python 2.7.4 and Python 3.2.0, were excluded from the limited API "
"(stable ABI), and were not documented."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35713`: :c:func:`!PyByteArray_Init` 和 :c:func:`!PyByteArray_Fini` "
"函数已被移除。自 Python 2.7.4 和 Python 3.2.0 以来，它们什么也不做，被排除在有限 API（稳定 "
"ABI）之外，并且没有文档记录。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23231
msgid ""
":issue:`33817`: Fixed :c:func:`_PyBytes_Resize` for empty bytes objects."
msgstr ":issue:`33817`: 修复了 :c:func:`_PyBytes_Resize` 对于空字节对象的处理。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23233
msgid ""
":issue:`35322`: Fix memory leak in :c:func:`PyUnicode_EncodeLocale` and "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_EncodeFSDefault` on error handling."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35322`: 修复 :c:func:`PyUnicode_EncodeLocale` 和 "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_EncodeFSDefault` 在错误处理中的内存泄漏。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23236
msgid ""
":issue:`35059`: The following C macros have been converted to static inline "
"functions: :c:func:`Py_INCREF`, :c:func:`Py_DECREF`, :c:func:`Py_XINCREF`, "
":c:func:`Py_XDECREF`, :c:func:`PyObject_INIT`, :c:func:`PyObject_INIT_VAR`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35059`: 以下 C 宏已转换为静态内联函数： :c:func:`Py_INCREF`, :c:func:`Py_DECREF`, "
":c:func:`Py_XINCREF`, :c:func:`Py_XDECREF`, :c:func:`PyObject_INIT`, "
":c:func:`PyObject_INIT_VAR`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23241
msgid ""
":issue:`35296`: ``make install`` now also installs the internal API: "
"``Include/internal/*.h`` header files."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35296`: ``make install`` 现在也会安装内部 API：``Include/internal/*.h`` 头文件。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23244
msgid ""
":issue:`35081`: Internal APIs surrounded by ``#ifdef Py_BUILD_CORE`` have "
"been moved from ``Include/*.h`` headers to new header files "
"``Include/internal/pycore_*.h``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35081`: 被 ``#ifdef Py_BUILD_CORE`` 包围的内部 API 已经从 ``Include/*.h`` "
"头文件移动到了新的头文件 ``Include/internal/pycore_*.h`` 中。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23248
msgid ""
":issue:`35259`: Conditionally declare :c:func:`Py_FinalizeEx()` (new in 3.6)"
" based on Py_LIMITED_API. Patch by Arthur Neufeld."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35259`: 根据 Py_LIMITED_API 有条件地声明 :c:func:`Py_FinalizeEx()`（3.6 "
"新增）。补丁由 Arthur Neufeld 提供。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23251
msgid ""
":issue:`35081`: The :c:func:`!_PyObject_GC_TRACK` and "
":c:func:`!_PyObject_GC_UNTRACK` macros have been removed from the public C "
"API."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35081`: :c:func:`!_PyObject_GC_TRACK` 和 "
":c:func:`!_PyObject_GC_UNTRACK` 宏已从公共 C API 中移除。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23255
msgid ":issue:`35134`: Creation of a new ``Include/cpython/`` subdirectory."
msgstr ":issue:`35134`: 创建了一个新的 ``Include/cpython/`` 子目录。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23257
msgid ""
":issue:`34725`: Adds _Py_SetProgramFullPath so embedders may override "
"sys.executable"
msgstr ":issue:`34725`: 添加了 _Py_SetProgramFullPath 以便嵌入者可以覆盖 sys.executable"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23260
msgid ""
":issue:`34910`: Ensure that :c:func:`PyObject_Print` always returns ``-1`` "
"on error.  Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34910`: 确保 :c:func:`PyObject_Print` 在出错时总是返回 ``-1``。由 Zackery Spytz "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23263
msgid ""
":issue:`34523`: Py_DecodeLocale() and Py_EncodeLocale() now use the UTF-8 "
"encoding on Windows if Py_LegacyWindowsFSEncodingFlag is zero."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34523`: 如果 Py_LegacyWindowsFSEncodingFlag 为零，Py_DecodeLocale() 和 "
"Py_EncodeLocale() 现在在 Windows 上使用 UTF-8 编码。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23266
msgid ""
":issue:`34193`: Fix pluralization in TypeError messages in getargs.c and "
"typeobject.c: '1 argument' instead of '1 arguments' and '1 element' instead "
"of '1 elements'."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34193`: 修复了 getargs.c 和 typeobject.c 中 TypeError 消息的单复数形式：'1 个参数' 代替"
" '1 个参数s' 和 '1 个元素' 代替 '1 个元素s'。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23270
msgid ""
":issue:`34127`: Return grammatically correct error message based on argument"
" count. Patch by Karthikeyan Singaravelan."
msgstr ":issue:`34127`: 根据参数数量返回语法正确的错误消息。由 Karthikeyan Singaravelan 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23273
msgid ""
":issue:`23927`: Fixed :exc:`SystemError` in "
":c:func:`PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords` when the ``w*`` format unit is used "
"for optional parameter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23927`: 修复了当 ``w*`` 格式单元用于可选参数时 "
":c:func:`PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords` 中的 :exc:`SystemError`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23277
msgid ":issue:`32455`: Added :c:func:`PyCompile_OpcodeStackEffectWithJump`."
msgstr ":issue:`32455`: 添加了 :c:func:`PyCompile_OpcodeStackEffectWithJump`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23279
msgid ""
":issue:`34008`: Py_Main() can again be called after Py_Initialize(), as in "
"Python 3.6."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34008`: Py_Main() 可以再次在 Py_Initialize() 之后被调用，就像在 Python 3.6 中一样。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23282
msgid ""
":issue:`32500`: Fixed error messages for :c:func:`PySequence_Size`, "
":c:func:`PySequence_GetItem`, :c:func:`PySequence_SetItem` and "
":c:func:`PySequence_DelItem` called with a mapping and "
":c:func:`PyMapping_Size` called with a sequence."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32500`: 修复了当 "
":c:func:`PySequence_Size`、:c:func:`PySequence_GetItem`、:c:func:`PySequence_SetItem`"
" 和 :c:func:`PySequence_DelItem` 被映射调用以及 :c:func:`PyMapping_Size` "
"被序列调用时的错误消息。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23287
msgid ""
":issue:`33818`: :c:func:`PyExceptionClass_Name` will now return ``const char"
" *`` instead of ``char *``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33818`: :c:func:`PyExceptionClass_Name` 现在将返回 ``const char *`` 而不是 "
"``char *``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23290 ../../../build/NEWS:24032
msgid ""
":issue:`33042`: Embedding applications may once again call "
"PySys_ResetWarnOptions, PySys_AddWarnOption, and PySys_AddXOption prior to "
"calling Py_Initialize."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33042`: 嵌入应用程序可以再次在调用 Py_Initialize 之前调用 "
"PySys_ResetWarnOptions、PySys_AddWarnOption 和 PySys_AddXOption。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23294 ../../../build/NEWS:24036
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28201
