"中，而不是添加 ``\".\"``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23714
msgid ""
":issue:`33217`: Deprecate looking up non-Enum objects in Enum classes and "
"Enum members (will raise :exc:`TypeError` in 3.8+)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33217`: 弃用在 Enum 类和 Enum 成员中查找非 Enum 对象的行为（在 3.8+ 中将引发 "
":exc:`TypeError`）。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23823
msgid "Python 3.7.0 beta 3"
msgstr "Python 3.7.0 beta 3"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23825
msgid "*Release date: 2018-03-29*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2018-03-29*"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23853 ../../../build/NEWS:27928
msgid ""
":issue:`33041`: Fixed jumping when the function contains an ``async for`` "
"loop."
msgstr ":issue:`33041`: 修复了当函数包含 ``async for`` 循环时的跳转问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:23951
msgid ""
":issue:`31639`: http.server now exposes a ThreadedHTTPServer class and uses "
"it when the module is run with ``-m`` to cope with web browsers pre-opening "
"sockets."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31639`: http.server 现在暴露了一个 ThreadedHTTPServer 类，并在模块使用 ``-m`` "
"运行时使用它以应对网络浏览器预打开套接字的情况。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24041
msgid "Python 3.7.0 beta 2"
msgstr "Python 3.7.0 beta 2"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24043
msgid "*Release date: 2018-02-27*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2018-02-27*"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24108
msgid ""
":issue:`25988`: Emit a :exc:`DeprecationWarning` when using or importing an "
"ABC directly from :mod:`collections` rather than from "
":mod:`collections.abc`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25988`: 当使用或直接从 :mod:`collections` 导入 ABC 而不是从 "
":mod:`collections.abc` 导入时，发出 :exc:`DeprecationWarning`。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24117
msgid ""
":issue:`31333`: ``_abc`` module is added.  It is a speedup module with C "
"implementations for various functions and methods in ``abc``.  Creating an "
"ABC subclass and calling ``isinstance`` or ``issubclass`` with an ABC "
"subclass are up to 1.5x faster. In addition, this makes Python start-up up "
"to 10% faster. Note that the new implementation hides internal registry and "
"caches, previously accessible via private attributes ``_abc_registry``, "
"``_abc_cache``, and ``_abc_negative_cache``.  There are three debugging "
"helper methods that can be used instead ``_dump_registry``, "
"``_abc_registry_clear``, and ``_abc_caches_clear``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31333`: 新增了 ``_abc`` 模块。这是一个速度优化模块，提供了 ``abc`` 中各种函数和方法的 C 语言实现。创建 "
"ABC 子类及使用 ABC 子类调用 ``isinstance`` 或 ``issubclass`` 的速度提高了 1.5 倍。此外，这还使得 "
"Python 的启动速度提高了 10%。请注意，新实现隐藏了内部注册表和缓存，之前可以通过私有属性 "
"``_abc_registry``、``_abc_cache`` 和 ``_abc_negative_cache`` 访问。现在可以使用三个调试辅助方法"
" ``_dump_registry``、``_abc_registry_clear`` 和 ``_abc_caches_clear`` 来代替。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24291
msgid "Python 3.7.0 beta 1"
msgstr "Python 3.7.0 beta 1"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24293
msgid "*Release date: 2018-01-30*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2018-01-30*"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24298
msgid ""
":issue:`32703`: Fix coroutine's ResourceWarning when there's an active error"
" set when it's being finalized."
msgstr ":issue:`32703`: 修复了协程在最终化时存在活动错误集时的 ResourceWarning 问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24301 ../../../build/NEWS:28246
msgid ""
":issue:`32650`: Pdb and other debuggers dependent on bdb.py will correctly "
"step over (next command) native coroutines. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32650`: Pdb 和其他依赖于 bdb.py 的调试器现在能够正确地单步跳过（next 命令）原生协程。由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24304
msgid ""
":issue:`28685`: Optimize list.sort() and sorted() by using type specialized "
"comparisons when possible."
msgstr ":issue:`28685`: 通过尽可能使用类型专用比较，优化了 list.sort() 和 sorted()。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24307 ../../../build/NEWS:28249
msgid ""
":issue:`32685`: Improve suggestion when the Python 2 form of print statement"
" is either present on the same line as the header of a compound statement or"
" else terminated by a semi-colon instead of a newline. Patch by Nitish "
"Chandra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32685`: 改进了当 Python 2 形式的 print 语句出现在复合语句的同一行或以分号而非换行符终止时的建议。由 "
"Nitish Chandra 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24312
msgid ""
":issue:`32697`: Python now explicitly preserves the definition order of "
"keyword-only parameters.  It's always preserved their order, but this "
"behavior was never guaranteed before; this behavior is now guaranteed and "
"tested."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32697`: Python "
"现在明确保留了仅关键字参数的定义顺序。虽然之前总是保留其顺序，但这一行为从未得到保证；现在这一行为得到了保证和测试。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24317
msgid ""
":issue:`32690`: The locals() dictionary now displays in the lexical order "
"that variables were defined.  Previously, the order was reversed."
msgstr ":issue:`32690`: locals() 字典现在按照变量定义的词法顺序显示。之前顺序是相反的。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24320
msgid ""
":issue:`32677`: Add ``.isascii()`` method to ``str``, ``bytes`` and "
"``bytearray``. It can be used to test that string contains only ASCII "
"characters."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32677`: 向 ``str``、``bytes`` 和 ``bytearray`` 添加了 ``.isascii()`` "
"方法。可用于测试字符串是否仅包含 ASCII 字符。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24324
msgid ""
":issue:`32670`: Enforce :pep:`479` for all code. This means that manually "
"raising a StopIteration exception from a generator is prohibited for all "
"code, regardless of whether 'from __future__ import generator_stop' was used"
" or not."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32670`: 对所有代码强制执行 :pep:`479`。这意味着从生成器中手动引发 StopIteration "
"异常对所有代码都是禁止的，无论是否使用了 'from __future__ import generator_stop'。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24329
msgid ""
":issue:`32591`: Added built-in support for tracking the origin of coroutine "
"objects; see sys.set_coroutine_origin_tracking_depth and "
"CoroutineType.cr_origin. This replaces the asyncio debug mode's use of "
"coroutine wrapping for native coroutine objects."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32591`: 添加了对跟踪协程对象来源的内置支持；参见 sys.set_coroutine_origin_tracking_depth"
" 和 CoroutineType.cr_origin。这取代了 asyncio 调试模式对原生协程对象使用协程包装的做法。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24334
msgid ""
":issue:`31368`: Expose preadv and pwritev system calls in the os module. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`31368`: 在 os 模块中暴露了 preadv 和 pwritev 系统调用。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24337
msgid ""
":issue:`32544`: ``hasattr(obj, name)`` and ``getattr(obj, name, default)`` "
"are about 4 times faster than before when ``name`` is not found and ``obj`` "
"doesn't override ``__getattr__`` or ``__getattribute__``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32544`: ``hasattr(obj, name)`` 和 ``getattr(obj, name, default)`` 在 "
"``name`` 未找到且 ``obj`` 未重写 ``__getattr__`` 或 ``__getattribute__`` "
"时，速度比以前快了约4倍。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24341 ../../../build/NEWS:28257
msgid ""
":issue:`26163`: Improved frozenset() hash to create more distinct hash "
"values when faced with datasets containing many similar values."
msgstr ":issue:`26163`: 改进了 frozenset() 的哈希函数，当面对包含许多相似值的数据集时，能生成更多不同的哈希值。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24344
msgid ":issue:`32550`: Remove the STORE_ANNOTATION bytecode."
msgstr ":issue:`32550`: 移除了 STORE_ANNOTATION 字节码。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24346
msgid ""
":issue:`20104`: Expose posix_spawn as a low level API in the os module. "
"(removed before 3.7.0rc1)"
msgstr ":issue:`20104`: 在 os 模块中暴露了 posix_spawn 作为低级 API。（在 3.7.0rc1 之前移除）"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24349
msgid ":issue:`24340`: Fixed estimation of the code stack size."
msgstr ":issue:`24340`: 修复了代码堆栈大小的估计问题。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24351
msgid ":issue:`32436`: Implement :pep:`567` Context Variables."
msgstr ":issue:`32436`: 实现了 :pep:`567` 上下文变量。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24353 ../../../build/NEWS:28270
msgid ""
":issue:`18533`: ``repr()`` on a dict containing its own ``values()`` or "
"``items()`` no longer raises ``RecursionError``; OrderedDict similarly. "
"Instead, use ``...``, as for other recursive structures.  Patch by Ben "
"North."
msgstr ""
":issue:`18533`: ``repr()`` 在包含其自身的 ``values()`` 或 ``items()`` 的字典上不再引发 "
"``RecursionError``；OrderedDict 同理。相反，像其他递归结构一样使用 ``...``。由 Ben North 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24358
msgid ""
":issue:`20891`: Py_Initialize() now creates the GIL. The GIL is no longer "
"created \"on demand\" to fix a race condition when PyGILState_Ensure() is "
"called in a non-Python thread."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20891`: Py_Initialize() 现在会创建 GIL。GIL 不再“按需”创建，以修复在非 Python 线程中调用 "
"PyGILState_Ensure() 时的竞态条件。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24362 ../../../build/NEWS:28275
msgid ""
":issue:`32028`: Leading whitespace is now correctly ignored when generating "
"suggestions for converting Py2 print statements to Py3 builtin print "
"function calls. Patch by Sanyam Khurana."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32028`: 在为将 Py2 打印语句转换为 Py3 内置打印函数调用生成建议时，现在正确地忽略了前导空白。由 Sanyam "
"Khurana 提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24366
msgid ":issue:`31179`: Make dict.copy() up to 5.5 times faster."
msgstr ":issue:`31179`: 使 dict.copy() 速度提高了多达5.5倍。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24368
msgid ""
":issue:`31113`: Get rid of recursion in the compiler for normal control "
"flow."
msgstr ":issue:`31113`: 在编译器中消除了对正常控制流的递归。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24373
msgid ""
":issue:`25988`: Deprecate exposing the contents of collections.abc in the "
"regular collections module."
msgstr ":issue:`25988`: 弃用在常规 collections 模块中暴露 collections.abc 的内容。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24376
msgid ""
":issue:`31429`: The default cipher suite selection of the ssl module now "
"uses a blacklist approach rather than a hard-coded whitelist. Python no "
"longer re-enables ciphers that have been blocked by OpenSSL security update."
" Default cipher suite selection can be configured on compile time."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31429`: "
"ssl模块的默认密码套件选择现在使用黑名单方法，而不是硬编码的白名单。Python不再重新启用被OpenSSL安全更新阻止的密码。默认密码套件选择可以在编译时配置。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24381
msgid ""
":issue:`30306`: contextlib.contextmanager now releases the arguments passed "
"to the underlying generator as soon as the context manager is entered. "
"Previously it would keep them alive for as long as the context manager was "
"alive, even when not being used as a function decorator. Patch by Martin "
"Teichmann."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30306`: "
"contextlib.contextmanager现在一旦进入上下文管理器，就会释放传递给底层生成器的参数。以前，它会保持它们活跃，只要上下文管理器是活跃的，即使不作为函数装饰器使用。由Martin"
" Teichmann提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24387
msgid ""
":issue:`21417`: Added support for setting the compression level for "
"zipfile.ZipFile."
msgstr ":issue:`21417`: 增加了对设置zipfile.ZipFile压缩级别的支持。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24390
msgid ":issue:`32251`: Implement asyncio.BufferedProtocol (provisional API)."
msgstr ":issue:`32251`: 实现了asyncio.BufferedProtocol（临时API）。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24392
msgid ""
":issue:`32513`: In dataclasses, allow easier overriding of dunder methods "
"without specifying decorator parameters."
msgstr ":issue:`32513`: 在数据类中，允许更容易地覆盖dunder方法，而无需指定装饰器参数。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24395
msgid ""
":issue:`32660`: :mod:`termios` makes available ``FIONREAD``, ``FIONCLEX``, "
"``FIOCLEX``, ``FIOASYNC`` and ``FIONBIO`` also under Solaris/derivatives."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32660`: :mod:`termios` 在Solaris/衍生系统下也提供 ``FIONREAD``, ``FIONCLEX``,"
" ``FIOCLEX``, ``FIOASYNC`` 和 ``FIONBIO``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24398 ../../../build/NEWS:28350
msgid ""
":issue:`27931`: Fix email address header parsing error when the username is "
"an empty quoted string. Patch by Xiang Zhang."
msgstr ":issue:`27931`: 修复当用户名为空引号字符串时的电子邮件地址头解析错误。由Xiang Zhang提供补丁。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24401
msgid ""
":issue:`32659`: Under Solaris and derivatives, :class:`os.stat_result` "
"provides a st_fstype attribute."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32659`: 在Solaris及其衍生系统下，:class:`os.stat_result` 提供了一个st_fstype属性。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24404
msgid ""
":issue:`32662`: Implement Server.start_serving(), Server.serve_forever(), "
"and Server.is_serving() methods.  Add 'start_serving' keyword parameter to "
"loop.create_server() and loop.create_unix_server()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32662`: "
"实现了Server.start_serving()、Server.serve_forever()和Server.is_serving()方法。向loop.create_server()和loop.create_unix_server()添加了'start_serving'关键字参数。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24408
msgid ""
":issue:`32391`: Implement :meth:`asyncio.StreamWriter.wait_closed` and "
":meth:`asyncio.StreamWriter.is_closing` methods"
msgstr ""
":issue:`32391`: 实现了 :meth:`asyncio.StreamWriter.wait_closed` 和 "
":meth:`asyncio.StreamWriter.is_closing` 方法。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24411
msgid ""
":issue:`32643`: Make Task._step, Task._wakeup and Future._schedule_callbacks"
" methods private."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32643`: 将Task._step、Task._wakeup和Future._schedule_callbacks方法设为私有。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24414
msgid ""
":issue:`32630`: Refactor decimal module to use contextvars to store decimal "
"context."
msgstr ":issue:`32630`: 重构decimal模块以使用contextvars存储decimal上下文。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24417
msgid ":issue:`32622`: Add :meth:`asyncio.AbstractEventLoop.sendfile` method."
msgstr ":issue:`32622`: 添加 :meth:`asyncio.AbstractEventLoop.sendfile` 方法。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24419 ../../../build/NEWS:28353
msgid ""
":issue:`32304`: distutils' upload command no longer corrupts tar files "
"ending with a CR byte, and no longer tries to convert CR to CRLF in any of "
"the upload text fields."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32304`: distutils的上传命令不再损坏以CR字节结尾的tar文件，并且不再尝试在上传的任何文本字段中将CR转换为CRLF。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24423 ../../../build/NEWS:28357
msgid ""
":issue:`32502`: uuid.uuid1 no longer raises an exception if a 64-bit "
"hardware address is encountered."
msgstr ":issue:`32502`: 当遇到64位硬件地址时，uuid.uuid1不再抛出异常。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24426
msgid ""
":issue:`32596`: ``concurrent.futures`` imports ``ThreadPoolExecutor`` and "
"``ProcessPoolExecutor`` lazily (using :pep:`562`). It makes ``import "
"asyncio`` about 15% faster because asyncio uses only ``ThreadPoolExecutor`` "
"by default."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32596`: ``concurrent.futures`` 现在懒加载 ``ThreadPoolExecutor`` 和 "
"``ProcessPoolExecutor`` (使用 :pep:`562`) 。这使得 ``import asyncio`` 大约快15%，因为 "
"asyncio 默认只使用 ``ThreadPoolExecutor``。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24431
msgid ""
":issue:`31801`: Add ``_ignore_`` to ``Enum`` so temporary variables can be "
"used during class construction without being turned into members."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31801`: 在 ``Enum`` 中添加 ``_ignore_``，以便在类构造期间可以使用临时变量而不会将其转换为成员。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24434
msgid ""
":issue:`32576`: Use queue.SimpleQueue() in places where it can be invoked "
"from a weakref callback."
msgstr ":issue:`32576`: 在可以从弱引用回调调用的地方使用 queue.SimpleQueue()。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24437
msgid ""
":issue:`32574`: Fix memory leak in asyncio.Queue, when the queue has limited"
" size and it is full, the cancelation of queue.put() can cause a memory "
"leak. Patch by: José Melero."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24441 ../../../build/NEWS:28367
msgid ""
":issue:`32521`: The nis module is now compatible with new libnsl and headers"
" location."
msgstr ":issue:`32521`: nis 模块现在与新的 libnsl 和头文件位置兼容。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24444
msgid ""
":issue:`32467`: collections.abc.ValuesView now inherits from "
"collections.abc.Collection."
msgstr ""
":issue:`32467`: collections.abc.ValuesView 现在继承自 collections.abc.Collection。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24447 ../../../build/NEWS:28370
msgid ":issue:`32473`: Improve ABCMeta._dump_registry() output readability"
msgstr ":issue:`32473`: 提高 ABCMeta._dump_registry() 输出的可读性"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24449
msgid ":issue:`32102`: New argument ``capture_output`` for subprocess.run"
msgstr ":issue:`32102`: subprocess.run 的新参数 ``capture_output``"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:24451 ../../../build/NEWS:28372
msgid ""
":issue:`32521`: glibc has removed Sun RPC. Use replacement libtirpc headers "
