#: ../../../build/NEWS:25305 ../../../build/NEWS:28749
msgid ""
":issue:`31770`: Prevent a crash when calling the ``__init__()`` method of a "
"``sqlite3.Cursor`` object more than once. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:25308 ../../../build/NEWS:28756
msgid ""
":issue:`31764`: Prevent a crash in ``sqlite3.Cursor.close()`` in case the "
"``Cursor`` object is uninitialized. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:25311 ../../../build/NEWS:28759
msgid ""
":issue:`31752`: Fix possible crash in timedelta constructor called with "
