msgid ""
":issue:`25349`: Optimize bytes % args using the new private _PyBytesWriter "
"API. Formatting is now up to 2 times faster."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:32278 ../../../build/NEWS:35297
msgid ""
":issue:`24806`: Prevent builtin types that are not allowed to be subclassed "
"from being subclassed through multiple inheritance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build/NEWS:32281
msgid ""
":issue:`25301`: The UTF-8 decoder is now up to 15 times as fast for error "
"handlers: ``ignore``, ``replace`` and ``surrogateescape``."
